<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">LUK</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lc.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lucas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diꞌs Nayon chanꞌ Jesucrist jwanꞌ mkeꞌ Luk</para>
  <para style="mt">Diꞌs wen chanꞌ Jesucrist jwanꞌ mkeꞌ Luk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Ye's mkeꞌ Luk lo Teoj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Naꞌrla xaꞌ mchal naxut mkeꞌ xa' lo ye's, re jwanꞌ lipa ngok nde xata ngokpey xij naꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Ta xata mbwiꞌ xaꞌ xa mdobtey, tata mbloꞌ xaꞌy lonꞌ nde mke xaꞌ sinꞌ mdej xaꞌ xkiꞌs Dios lo men. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Jwanꞌ nasa nogaꞌ na jwin mnabdiꞌs na a xata ngokpa reta jwanꞌ reꞌ lo xa mdobtey nde lo ngolo jwin mnabdiꞌs nay, ngwiꞌn wen naka keꞌ ney lo ye's xata ngokpay, sa tel' nay loa Teoj xa' ntak toz, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />sa jwin yoloa re jwanꞌ li ta mte'd la.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi anj ndej gal Juan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Senꞌ ngok Herodes rey lo xyon Judea, ngo thi nglweyꞌ ndole Zacarias, xaꞌ nzo lo grup nglweyꞌ Abias. Leꞌ ngol xaꞌ ndole Elisabet nde noga ngol nde lo bin Aaron. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Nde rop xaꞌ galꞌ nak lo Dios, nxoꞌbyek xaꞌ xkiꞌs Dios dib nzo lazoꞌ xaꞌ nde re jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Per ngenta xinꞌ xaꞌ, tak Elizabeth xa' nij xa' nde ngoxla ropta xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Thib wiz senꞌ mdinꞌ re xaꞌ nak grup nglweyꞌ chanꞌ Zacarias li xaꞌ sinꞌ lo Dios len' yodoꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />nde mod chanꞌ re nglweyꞌ nak ndlibe' xa' nyenꞌ cho ndinꞌ na, nde mdinꞌ Zacarias yote xaꞌ ten' nayon lenꞌ yodoꞌ chanꞌ Dios sa tolꞌ xaꞌ xtarak lo Dios. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />nde hor jwan' nchol xtarak, reta men toz tir nzi le, nzi todiꞌsno xaꞌ Dios. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Zyasa mbroꞌto thi anj chanꞌ Dios lo Zacarias, ndoli lad ban tenꞌ ndoyol xtarak. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Zacarias anj, nzoyen xa' nde mzyeb xa'. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Le' anj nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:13">—Zacarias, naꞌzyebta la, tak Dios mbinla jwanꞌ mnaꞌb la lo Dios, nde xaꞌ got la Elisabet tyan thi mbed biꞌ nde tob lea or Juan. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Nde nale toz yo lazoꞌa nde lyen la nde nale toz yo lazoꞌ bro men senꞌ gal or, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />tak le' or ak thi xa' ntak toz lo Dios. Nde naꞌgud or nit bin nekla nit xtus, ben' tera gal or Mbi Nayon chanꞌ Dios nyebeꞌla lazoꞌ or. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nde li or sa bro men Israel bere xa' lo Dios xa', Xa' Nyebe' lo xa'. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nde or, yate lo Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, kon xbi nde yalne chanꞌ Profet Elías, sa nabeꞌz kwe re xud mdyen' kon mdyen', nde sa teꞌd re men ndli jwanꞌ narax, xoꞌbyek xaꞌ xkiꞌs Dios. Tamod sa tosaꞌ or re men yez Dios, sa kaya' re men Xa' Nyebe'.<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zacarias mnabdiꞌs lo anj:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:18">—¿Xamod mnen ke li jwanꞌ reꞌ? Tak na ngoxla na nde xaꞌ got na no xaꞌ ngoxla xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Leꞌ anj mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:19">—Na nak Gabriel, nde ndlin sinꞌ lo Dios; Xaꞌ mtelꞌ na sa todiꞌsnon la, tej na diꞌs wen chanꞌ Xaꞌ loa. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Per naya, ta nandlid lazoꞌa jwanꞌ nin loa, yanꞌ ngup la, nde naꞌgakta nia axta wiz ak reta jwanꞌ reꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Laja re men nzi le ngembed xa' Zacarias nde ndli xa' xgab kwan liy ndolen' toz Zacarias ten' nayon len' yodo'. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Senꞌ mbroꞌte Zacarias tya, naꞌgakta ni xa', zyasa mbyen re men ke ti jwanꞌ mbroꞌto lo xaꞌ ten' nayon lenꞌ yodoꞌ, nde benꞌta señ ndli xaꞌ lo men, tak mbyan' ngup xa'.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Senꞌ ngoxob wiz mne rsinꞌ Zacarias len' yodoꞌ, ndya xaꞌ liz xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Tudla ndate, Elisabet ngol xa' mkelo xinꞌ na', nde nandroꞌd ngol liz ngol dib gayꞌ mbeꞌ nde mbli ngol xgab: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />"Wen toz nak Dios lon, mkib Xa' yantho ndyak na, na'wi'naraxtra' men na ta na'yod xin' na."<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi anj ndej gal Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Senꞌ ngoxo'b xop mbeꞌ ndo xa' yistan, Dios mtelꞌ anj Gabriel thi yez ndole Nazaret jwanꞌ nax lo xyon Galilea, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />tenꞌ nzo thi mzaꞌ yenꞌ ndole Mari, jwanꞌ tera gaxno mbiꞌ, jwan' nak di'sla selyaꞌ kon thi xaꞌ biꞌ ndole Jose, jwanꞌ nde lo bin rey David. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Nde ngote anj ten' ndo mzaꞌ, mni anj dyux lo mzaꞌ nchab anj:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:28">—¡Maa Mari, wen toz ngwiꞌ Dios la! Mbli leyꞌ Dios la xij re ngol nde ndono Dios la.<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Per senꞌ mbin Mari jwanꞌ nchab anj nyaga nzoyen Mari, mbli Mari xgab, kwan ta mbez anj. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Zyasa nchab anj lo Mari:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:30">—Naꞌzyebta la Mari, tak wen toz ngwiꞌ Dios la. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Nde naya kelo xinꞌ la nde kaa thi mbed biꞌ nde tob lea or Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Nde or ak thi xaꞌ ntak toz, nde ryoꞌ le or Xinꞌ Dios ro, nde Dios Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ ta' ten' mnebe' rey David nyebe' or, lo bin David tenꞌ nde or. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Sa nyebeꞌ or lo reta men Israel thibtane, nde yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ or naꞌluxtay.<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Mari lo anj:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:34">—¿Xamod ak jwanꞌ reꞌ tak tera tobnon mbiꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Zyasa mkab anj lo Mari:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:35">—Mbi Nayon yeꞌd xis la, nde yalne chanꞌ Dios ro ba lya xis la xaja xkala. Jwanꞌ nasa or gal loa, nayon or, nde Xinꞌ Dios ko'le men or. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Mbay na noga Elisabet xa' taa ka thi mbed, tenye ngoxla xaꞌ, nde naya ndola xaꞌ xop mbeꞌ lo yis tan, xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbez men nak xa' nij. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Tak par Dios na'ngyenta nekthib jwan' na'akta li Dios.<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Zyasa nchab Mari:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">—Ncheꞌ ndon, lin rsinꞌ Dios na, li Dios kon na xata nea lon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">Ngolo jwan'na, ndya anj.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mari ngwatna Elisabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Nde lenꞌ wiz ya mken Mari, ngwa Mari thi yez nax lo yiꞌ xyon Judea, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />senꞌ mzin Mari liz Zacarias, mni Mari dyux lo Elisabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Lo senꞌ mbin Elisabet dyux mni Mari, mbwin mbed lenꞌ Elisabet, nde mde' Mbi Nayon chanꞌ Dios xa'. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Zyasa ne mni xa' nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:42">—¡Mbli leyꞌ Dios la xij re ngol, nde mbli leyꞌ Dios xinꞌ la. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />¿Cho nak na sa ndetna xnaꞌ Xaꞌ Nyebe' lon, na? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nde leꞌ mbin na mnia dyux lon, mbwin mbed lenꞌ na, tak leꞌka nale ngo lazoꞌ or. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Nabe'z toz ndaa, tak mbli lazoꞌa xkiꞌs Dios, nde ak reta jwanꞌ ne Dios loa.<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Zyasa nchab Mari:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">Dib nzo lazoꞌn nin diꞌs wen lo Dios,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />nde xbin na nale toz nzo lazo'n lo Dios, Xaꞌ li sa lya'n.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Nde mblí Xa' na sa li rsinꞌ Xaꞌ na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">teꞌnye nanakta na xaꞌ ntak nde naya dib tyemp gab reta men nzo lo izyo, Dios mbli ley' xa'.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Tak Dios ta ngeno dib yalne, mbli yalnaro toz lon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">nayon nak le Dios.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Nde Dios thibla' ndlat lazonꞌ reta men jwanꞌ nzeb lazon' Dios.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Naro nak re jwanꞌ ndli Dios kon yalne chanꞌ Dios,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">nde mcha's Dios re xa' nchak naro.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Mkib Dios yalnyebeꞌ lo re rey nchak naro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">nde mbli naro Dios re xaꞌ nadoꞌ nak.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Re xaꞌ ndyak win mdaꞌ Dios bro jwan' lo xaꞌ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">Le' re xaꞌ ngeno bro jwanꞌ, tatanya xa' mse're Dios xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Dios mblasto xaꞌ Israel xa' ndli sin' lo Dios,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">nde nanchajta yek Dios ndlat lazoꞌ Dios xaꞌ,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />ta xa thibtane mda' Xa' xki's Xa' lo re xa' gox lon' pola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">lo Abraham nde lo re xa' nde lo bin Abraham.<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Nde ngo Mari mer son mbeꞌ liz Elisabet, seraꞌ ndya Mari liz Mari.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngol Juan jwan' ngole men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Senꞌ ngoxob be' gal xinꞌ Elisabet, thi mbed biꞌ ngol lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Lo mbin reta men nzo gax liz xaꞌ nde re ta xaꞌ plopa yalwen mbli Dios mblat lazoꞌ Dios xaꞌ, ngwatna re men xaꞌ nde nale toz ngo lazoꞌ reta men kon xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Nde senꞌ ngoxo'b xon wiz ngol mbed, mbeꞌ xaꞌ or sa tob xaꞌ beꞌ lad or, tenꞌ nadan lad men biꞌba, nde ncholaꞌs xaꞌ kole xaꞌ or Zacarias xa ndole xud or. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Per xnaꞌ mbed nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:60">—Naꞌryoꞌled mbed tamod, leꞌ mbed ryoꞌle Juan.<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:61">—¿Kwan liy? Ngen cho ta ndole Juan.<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Zyasa kon señ mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo xud mbed, sa tej xaꞌ xamod nchola's xa' ryoꞌle mbed. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Le' xud mbed mna'b thi ble tab, nde mkeꞌ xaꞌ lo tab: "Mbed ndole Juan." Nde reta men nzoyen toz xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Nde hor yaga taxa ngok mni Zacarias tedib gob, nde mdaꞌ Zacarias dyux lo Dios. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Nde reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ nzo gax liz Zacarias jwanꞌ toz nzoyen xaꞌ, nde mbrya's jwanꞌ na reta yez jwanꞌ nzi lo yiꞌ lo xyon Judea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Nde reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbin jwanꞌ na mbli xaꞌ xgab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:66">—¿Cho kwan ak mbed reꞌ senꞌ xyen or?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:66">Tak ndloꞌpa ndo yalwen chanꞌ Dios kon or.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zacarias mdej re diꞌs nchab Dios lo xaꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zyasa Zacarias xud mbed, mde' Mbi Nayon xa' nde mdej xaꞌ re jwanꞌ ak, nchab xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />¡Naro toz nak Dios, chanꞌ re naꞌ, xa' Israel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">tak mbyedtna Xaꞌ naꞌ nde mtolaꞌ Xaꞌ naꞌ, naꞌ jwanꞌ nak men yez Xaꞌ!<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Mtelꞌ Dios thi or jwanꞌ ngeno bro toz yalne, sa tolaꞌ or naꞌ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">Thi or jwanꞌ nde lo bin rey David xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbli sinꞌ lo Dios,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />ta xa nchab Dios lo re profet nayon Dios ngo pola.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Tolaꞌ Dios naꞌ lo re xaꞌ ndli jwanꞌ narax nde lo re xaꞌ nayi' lon'.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Nde tagaꞌ mdaꞌ Xaꞌ xkiꞌs Xaꞌ lyat lazoꞌ Xaꞌ reta xaꞌ gox lonꞌ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">nde li Xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab Xaꞌ lo re xaꞌ gox lonꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Re jwanꞌ mdaꞌ Dios xkiꞌs Dios li Dios lo Abraham xaꞌ gox lonꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Ke Dios tolanꞌ lo yaꞌ re xaꞌ ndebeyonon',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">sa naꞌzyebta naꞌ linꞌ sinꞌ lo Dios.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Nayon nde galꞌ ketenꞌ lo Dios reta wiz naban naꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nde lu xinꞌ lud na, ryoꞌlea profet Dios ro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">tak lu kwiblo lo Xa' Nyebe', sa xalꞌ la ned rid Xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Sa tej la lo reta men yez Dios, Dios tonꞌ xken xaꞌ nde tolaꞌ Dios xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Tak Dios naꞌ, jwanꞌ toz mblat lazoꞌ Xaꞌ men,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">mtelꞌ Xaꞌ thi Xaꞌ nak xaja thi xni wiza lo naꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Sa toxni Xaꞌ lo reta men ngete lo yalꞌ kow,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">nde we Xaꞌ men lo ned nzo yalnabeꞌz.<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Nde or luda ndoxen or, nde taja ndoxen yalnchak chan' or, nde ngo or re izyo nagan axta wiz senꞌ mbro' to or lo men Israel.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jesus ngol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Lenꞌ wiz ya, rey Augusto mnebeꞌ, sa reta men ya taꞌ lenꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Jwanꞌ reꞌ zyarka ngok ner, ngo le reta men lo libr, senꞌ ngok Cirenio gobernador yez Siria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Nde reta men ndablo ya xaꞌ tenꞌ nak las xaꞌ, sa tya yo le xaꞌ lo yeꞌs. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Jwanꞌ nasa, mbroꞌ Jose yez Nazaret, jwanꞌ nax lo xyon xaꞌ Galilea, nda xaꞌ yez Belen jwanꞌ nax lo xyon Judea, tenꞌ ngol rey David, tak Jose nde lo bin rey David, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />sa yo le xa' lo ye's kon Marí sal' xa', jwan' ndo lo yistan. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Nde laja benꞌ nzi xaꞌ yez Belen, mzin wiz gal xinꞌ Mari. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Tya ngol xinꞌ xaꞌ or ner, mchal lar xaꞌ or nde mdix xaꞌ or len' ya ten' ncho jwan' ncha ma' tak naꞌngasalta ti yo kwed xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Re anj nde re xaꞌ ngenap mbakxilꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Nde gax yez Belen, nzi pla xaꞌ lenꞌ wan, ngenap mbakxilꞌ yalꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Zyasa xaj mbro'to ti anj chanꞌ Dios lo xaꞌ nde ngo xni chanꞌ Dios dib tenꞌ nzi xaꞌ, nde mzyeb toz xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Per anj nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:10">—Naꞌzyebta goꞌ, tak na ndal tej thi diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios lo goꞌ, jwanꞌ li yo nale lazoꞌ reta men: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Na wiz ngol thi mbed lenꞌ yez David, or ya tolaꞌ men, or nak Crist Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Nde jwanꞌ reꞌ ak beꞌ lo goꞌ xamod yosal goꞌ mbed: Leꞌ mbed nachal thi lar nde nax mbed lenꞌ thi ya kano tenꞌ ncho jwanꞌ ncha maꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Zyasa xaj mbroꞌto thi byox anj chanꞌ Dios, tenꞌ ndo anj ya, nde ni re anj diꞌs wen lo Dios nchab anj:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />¡Naro toz nak Dios lo beꞌ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">¡Nde nabeꞌz kwe re men lo izyo, men jwan' nchal yalwen chan' Dios!<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Senꞌ mbere re anj ndya anj lo beꞌ, re xaꞌ ngenap mbakxilꞌ nchab xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:15">—Ndanꞌ yez Belen, nda winꞌ jwanꞌ ngok ta mbyed tej anj chanꞌ Dios lonꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Zyasa naban ngwa xaꞌ, nde mzyal xaꞌ Mari nde Jose kon mbed nax lenꞌ ya kano tenꞌ ncho jwanꞌ ncha maꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ mbed, mdej xaꞌ reta kwent chanꞌ mbed, ta mdej anj lo xaꞌ ya. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Nde reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbin kwent mdaꞌ re xaꞌ ngenap mbakxilꞌ la, leꞌka nzoyen re xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Per Mari mblosa' reta jwan' na len' lazo' Mari, nde thibla ndli Mari xgaba. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Leꞌ re xaꞌ ngenap mbakxilꞌ, mbere xaꞌ tenꞌ nzi xaꞌ, laja ndo xa' ned nda xaꞌ, nda' xa' dyux lo Dios nde ni xaꞌ diꞌs wen lo Dios, tak reta jwanꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ nde jwanꞌ mbin xaꞌ, ngoka xata nchab anj lo xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbe' xa' mbed yodo' sa mblo' xa' mbed lo Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Senꞌ ngok xon wiz ngol mbed, mtob xaꞌ beꞌ tenꞌ nadan lad mbed. Nde mtob le xaꞌ mbed Jesus, ta xata nchab anj ryo'le mbed senꞌ teraꞌ kelo mbed len' Mari.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Senꞌ ngoxob wiz ak nambi rop xa' xajka nyebeꞌ ley chanꞌ Moises, mbeꞌ xa' mbed yez Jerusalen sa lo' xa' mbed lo Dios. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Tamod mbli xaꞌ, tak ta nchab lo ley chanꞌ Dios: "Reta mbed biꞌ jwanꞌ nchal ner, ak nayon or par Dios." <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Nde mdaꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ yon, xajka nyebeꞌ ley chanꞌ Dios: chop ngog o chop mbyin be.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Lenꞌ wiz ya ngo thi xaꞌ ndole Simeon yez Jerusalen. Xaꞌ nak thi xaꞌ galꞌ nde nxoꞌbyek xa' xkiꞌs Dios, ngembed xaꞌ wiz telꞌ Dios thi xaꞌ konale lazo' men Israel. Nde Mbi Nayon ndono xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Nde mblo' Mbi Nayon lo Simeon sa mne xa' ke na'gajta xa' axta kebe' wi' xa', Xa' jwan' mtel' Dios. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Zyasa mbli Mbi Nayon ngwa Simeon yodoꞌ, senꞌ mzin Jose kon Mari ndeno xa' mbed yodoꞌ, sa li xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab ley Moises, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />zyasa mdeꞌs Simeon mbed nde mdaꞌ Simeon dyux lo Dios, nchab Simeon:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />Dios ro, naya ngokla reta jwanꞌ xata nea lon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">naya toyal nabe'z gaj na.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Tak mbwiꞌa na or jwanꞌ tolaꞌ re men,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />nde reta yez yolo xa' jwan' nak xgab la lia, tola'a re men.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Or ak xni lo reta yez nanakta xa' Israel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">nde por or sa xyob xki's yez Israel.<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Jose nde Mari xnaꞌ Jesus leꞌka nzoyen xaꞌ mbin xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ nchab Simeon kwent chanꞌ mbed. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Zyasa mbli leyꞌ Simeon xaꞌ, nde nchab Simeon lo Mari xnaꞌ Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:34">—Wiꞌ nea, Dios mtelꞌ or sa lir bro toz xa' Israel lyayo nde bro toz xa' tyotsa'. Jwan' lo' ak or, bro toz men na'ryo'd lazo' xa'y. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Per reta jwanꞌ reꞌ aka xaja thi espada yada lazo'a. Nde men thoz ryo'xo'b jwan' nzo lazoꞌ xa'.<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Nde tya ndoga' thi men got gox ndole An, xa' ya nak profet, xinꞌ Fanuel, jwan' nde lo bin Aser, sen' yen' ngol mpselyaꞌ ngol nde gaz linꞌ mdobno ngol salꞌ ngol, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />nde nzola xa' thap gal nzo thap linꞌ tata ndo thib xa'. Thibla' ndo ngol yodoꞌ, nde yalꞌ ndlyabe ndli ngol sinꞌ lo Dios, nke ngol yalse nde ndodi'sno ngol Dios. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Nde hor yaga' mbike ngol lo Jose nde Mari, mdobte mdaꞌ ngol dyux lo Dios, nde mdej ngol kwent chanꞌ Jesus lo reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngembed pol sin xaꞌ jwanꞌ tolaꞌ re men Jerusalen.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbere xaꞌ yez Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Senꞌ ngolo mbli Jose kon Mary reta jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ ley chanꞌ Dios, mbere xaꞌ yez Nazaret, tenꞌ nak las xaꞌ, jwanꞌ nax lo xyon Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Nde ndo xen Jesus nde taga' ndo yo xgab nde yalchak yek Jesus, nde yalwen chan' Dios thibla ndonoy Jesús.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndo lenꞌ yodoꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Reta linꞌ nda Jose kon Mari xud Jesus yez Jerusalen lo ni pask. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Senꞌ nzo Jesus thib sen linꞌ, ngwa re xaꞌ lo ni pask a xaja nak mod chanꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Senꞌ ngolo ni, ngo xaꞌ ned ndya xaꞌ liz xaꞌ. Per naꞌnyed Mari xnaꞌ Jesus nde Jose, leꞌ Jesus mbyanꞌ yez Jerusalen, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Mbli xaꞌ xgab leꞌ Jesus ndya xij re men. Nde ndola xaꞌ ned dib tib wiz, seraꞌ mkwanꞌ xaꞌ Jesus xij re ta xaꞌ nde xij re xaꞌ ncholo xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />per naꞌngazalta xaꞌ Jesus. Zyasa mbere xaꞌ yez Jerusalen, nda kwanꞌ xaꞌ Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ngoxob son wiz , seraꞌ mzyal xaꞌ Jesus lo le chan' yodoꞌ. Ndob or xij re maestr nchak ley, ndobyon or reta jwanꞌ ndloꞌ xaꞌ nde nyabdiꞌs or lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Nde reta xaꞌ nchon jwanꞌ ndej or, nzoyen xaꞌ xa nchen or nde xa nkab or. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ xud or kon xnaꞌ or, leꞌka nzoyen xaꞌ; nde xnaꞌ or nchab lo or:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:48">—Xinꞌ na, ¿Kwan ta mblinoa ná'? Rop náꞌ xud la jwanꞌ toz ndli náꞌ xgab maa nde ngete kwanꞌ náꞌ lu. <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:49">—¿Kwan liy nkwanꞌ goꞌ na? ¡Mnea go', lo rsin' xud na nakinꞌ ton!<verse eid="LUK 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Per naꞌngyenta xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab or.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Zyasa mbere or kon xaꞌ yez Nazaret nde mxobyek or reta jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ xud or, nde xnaꞌ or. Per xna' or ndli toz xa' xgab reta jwanꞌ ta ngoka. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Nde xa ndoxen or taga' ndoxenor yalchak nde nabe'z ngwi' Dios or nde taga' re men.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Juan ndaꞌ xkiꞌs Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Lenꞌ linꞌ tsinꞌ chanꞌ Tiberio Cesar xaꞌ nyebeꞌ dib izyo chan' Rom, zya Poncio Pilato nak gobernador lo xyon Judea, Herodes nak gobernador lo xyon Galilea, Felip wes Herodes nak gobernador lo xyon Iturea nde re yez chanꞌ Traconite. Nde Lizaneas nak gobernador re yez chanꞌ Abilinia. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Zya Anas nde Caifas nak nglweyꞌ ro. Lenꞌ wiz ya mni Dios lo Juan xinꞌ Zacarias jwanꞌ nzo izyo nagan, <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />jwanꞌ nasa, nkete Juan rop lad ro yoꞌ Jordan ngwa tej Juan lo re men ke nakinꞌ seꞌ xaꞌ xgab xaꞌ nde laꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ narax ndli xaꞌ nde ryoꞌle xaꞌ lenꞌ nit sa dyonꞌ xken xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Jwanꞌ reꞌ ngok xa nchab lo ye's mke' profet Isaias:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">Nchen mbez ti men lad izyo nagan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">"Ptoxkwa' goꞌ xned Xa' Nyebe'.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">Nali bdix goꞌ xned Xaꞌ,<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Reta yeryo zye, reta yiꞌ nde reta kox ak lap,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">reta ned nato ak nakwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">nde reta ned narax nak, ak nali.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Nde reta men wiꞌ xa tola' Dios men."<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Jwan' nasa nchab Juan lo re men toz tir jwan' nda lo Juan sa ryo'le:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:7">—¡Bin mzib nde goꞌ! ¿Cho ne lo go', lyaꞌ goꞌ lo yalnayiꞌ chanꞌ Dios jwanꞌ nde gaxla? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ban goꞌ thi mod ke lo' liga mzyeꞌ xgab go' nde mblaꞌ goꞌ re jwanꞌ narax ndli goꞌ, nde naꞌlid go' xgab len' lazo' go': "naꞌ nde lo bin Abraham", tak na ni lo go', Dios toyal lilal Xa' re ke re' xin' Abraham. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Mbay na tagaꞌ yiꞌbya nda'bsa'lay sa choꞌy axta dib lox ya jwanꞌ nandaꞌda ngud wen, xchoꞌy nde yobiy lo bel.<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Zyasa re men mnabdiꞌs lo Juan:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:10">—¿Cho kwan ndablo li náꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Juan mkab lo xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:11">—Go' jwanꞌ ngeno chop ned lar, ndablo taꞌ go' thib neda lo xaꞌ nangenoda nek thiba; nde go' ngeno jwanꞌ ncha, naxal' gok go', taga' bli go'.<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Noga ngwa pla xaꞌ jwanꞌ nthop tmi low par yez Rom lo Juan, sa koꞌle Juan xaꞌ, nde mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Juan nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:12">—Maestr, ¿kwan ndablo li náꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Juan nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:13">—Naꞌnyabta goꞌ masra tmi jwanꞌ nandabloda kix xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Noga pla sondad mnabdiꞌs lo Juan nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">—Mbay náꞌ, ¿kwan ndablo li náꞌ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Juan mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">—Naꞌkibta goꞌ chanꞌ men, neka keꞌ goꞌ yalke yek men jwanꞌ ngen kwan ndli nde blo nale lazoꞌ goꞌ jwanꞌ nchax nka goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Nde reta men nzimbed sin xaꞌ jwanꞌ telꞌ Dios nde mbli xaꞌ xgab nzo pa Juan nak Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Per Juan nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:16">—Na galꞌ diꞌs nin lo goꞌ, na ngole goꞌ kon nit, per tib xa' nde xis na, Xaꞌ ya ngeno mas yalne ke na, Xaꞌ koꞌle goꞌ kon Mbi Nayon nde kon bel. Nde nanzal'ta na xak na neka kore yalyid Xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Nzola pal ya Xaꞌ sa to Xaꞌ trig, tombi Xaꞌy nde kosaꞌ Xaꞌ trig tenꞌ nchosaꞌy, le' yix tolꞌ Xaꞌ lo bel jwanꞌ nanchuda.<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Mod reꞌ mdej Juan nde masraꞌ ntobeꞌ Juan yek men, senꞌ mdej Juan diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios lo men. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Mbay lo mtokox Juan Herodes xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo xyon Galilea, tak ndobno xaꞌ Herodias, ngol Blib wes xaꞌ nde por reta temasra' jwanꞌ narax mbli xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />mbliga' xa' tediba'y, mkeꞌ lizyiꞌb xa' Juan.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mbroꞌle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Senꞌ ngegoꞌle Juan re men, zyasa no Jesus mbroꞌle. Nde laj ngetodi'sno Jesus Dios, mxyalꞌ lo beꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />nde mbla Mbi Nayon yek Jesus xaja nya thi paloma, zyasa mbyen thi diꞌs mbroꞌ lo beꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:22">—Lu nak xinꞌ na jwanꞌ nkeꞌ toz lazoꞌn, nde nale toz nzo lazoꞌn ngwiꞌn la.<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lo bin jwan' nde Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Sen' mdobte Jesus rsin' Jesus nzo Xa' mer galpsiꞌ linꞌ, nde reta men mbli xgab Jesus nak xinꞌ Jose. Nde Jose ngok xinꞌ Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eli ngok xinꞌ Matat, Matat ngok xinꞌ Levi, Levi ngok xinꞌ Melqui, Melqui ngok xinꞌ Jana, Jana ngok xinꞌ Jose, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Jose ngok xinꞌ Matatias, Matatias ngok xinꞌ Amos, Amos ngok xinꞌ Nahum, Nahum ngok xinꞌ Esli, Esli ngok xinꞌ Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai ngok xinꞌ Maat, Maat ngok xinꞌ Matatias, Matatias ngok xinꞌ Semei, Semei ngok xinꞌ Jose, Jose ngok xinꞌ Juda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Juda ngok xinꞌ Joana, Joana ngok xinꞌ Resa, Resa ngok xinꞌ Zorobabel, Zorobabel ngok xinꞌ Salatiel, Salatiel ngok xinꞌ Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri ngok xinꞌ Melqui, Melqui ngok xinꞌ Adi, Adi ngok xinꞌ Cosam, Cosam ngok xinꞌ Elmodam, Elmodam ngok xinꞌ Er, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er ngok xinꞌ Josue, Josue ngok xinꞌ Eliezer, Eliezer ngok xinꞌ Jorim, Jorim ngok xinꞌ Matat, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Matat ngok xinꞌ Levi, Levi ngok xinꞌ Simeon, Simeon ngok xinꞌ Juda, Juda ngok xinꞌ Jose, Jose ngok xinꞌ Jonan, Jonan ngok xinꞌ Eliaquim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliaquim ngok xinꞌ Melea, Melea ngok xinꞌ Mainan, Mainan ngok xinꞌ Matata, Matata ngok xinꞌ Natan, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Natan ngok xinꞌ David, David ngok xinꞌ Isai, Isai ngok xinꞌ Obed, Obed ngok xinꞌ Booz, Booz ngok xinꞌ Salmon, Salmon ngok xinꞌ Naason, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Naason ngok xinꞌ Aminadab, Aminadab ngok xinꞌ Aram, Aram ngok xinꞌ Esrom, Esrom ngok xinꞌ Fares, Fares ngok xinꞌ Juda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Juda ngok xinꞌ Jakob, Jakob ngok xinꞌ Isaac, Isaac ngok xinꞌ Abraham, Abraham ngok xinꞌ Tare, Tare ngok xinꞌ Nacor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nacor ngok xinꞌ Serug, Serug ngok xinꞌ Ragau, Ragau ngok xinꞌ Peleg, Peleg ngok xinꞌ Heber, Heber ngok xinꞌ Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala ngok xinꞌ Cainan, Cainan ngok xinꞌ Arfaxad, Arfaxad ngok xinꞌ Sem, Sem ngok xinꞌ Noe, Noe ngok xinꞌ Lamec, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamec ngok xinꞌ Matusalen, Matusalen ngok xinꞌ Enoc, Enoc ngok xinꞌ Jared, Jared ngok xinꞌ Mahalaleel, Mahalaleel ngok xinꞌ Cainan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Cainan ngok xinꞌ Enos, Enos ngok xinꞌ Set, Set ngok xinꞌ Adan, Adan ngok xinꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Maxuꞌ ncholaꞌs tokil' Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Sen' mbere Jesus mbro' Xa' yo' Jordan, dib ben Xa' mde' Mbi Nayon, nde mbe' Mbi Nayon Xaꞌ izyo nagan. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Tya ngwa Jesus choꞌ wiz, nde re len' cho' wiza leꞌka mchal Maxu' tokil' Maxu' Jesus. Re len' wiz ya ngen kwan ngwa Jesus, lo ngoxob choꞌ wiz mzib lyanꞌ Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Zyasa nchab Maxuꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:3">—Tez lipa nak la Xinꞌ Dios, mnibe' sa yalal ke ba pan.<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Jesus mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:4">—Lo xkiꞌs Dios nchab: "Nanakta benꞌta pan ban men, noga reta diꞌs ndryoꞌ ro Dios ndaꞌ yalnaban lo men."<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Zyasa mbeꞌ Maxuꞌ Jesus thi yek yiꞌ gap toz ndab nde tib a'til mbloꞌ Maxuꞌ reta yalnyebe' dib nax izyo lo Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Nde nchab Maxuꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:6">—Tan dib yalnyebeꞌ nde yalne chanꞌ izyo loa, tak chanꞌ na naka, nde taney a choja lo xa' ncholas na taney. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Nde tez tyoxub la lon nde li naroa na, retey tan loa.<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Leꞌ Jesus mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:8">—Baxa wa, Maxuꞌ, tak lo xkiꞌs Dios nchab: "Lo Dios la Xa' Nyebe' loa tyoxub la, nde benꞌta lo Xaꞌ lia sinꞌ."<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Xisa mbeꞌ Maxuꞌ Jesus yez Jerusalen nde mto Maxuꞌ Jesus yek yodoꞌ tenꞌ mas gap ndab nde nchab Maxuꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:9">—Tez Xinꞌ Dios nak la, gobi axta laba, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />tak lo xkiꞌs Dios nchab:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:10">Dios nyebe' lo re anj chanꞌ Dios, sa kenap xa' la.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Lo ya' xa' tyenke' xa' lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:11">sa na'chepta nia ke.<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Jesus mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:12">—Noga nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios: "Naꞌtokilꞌta la Dios Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ loa."<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Nde senꞌ mbre reta yaltokilꞌ chan' Maxuꞌ, mblaꞌ Maxuꞌ Jesus thi tyemp axta kebe' zyal Maxu' thi wiz.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mdobte rsinꞌ Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Zyasa mbere Jesus lo xyon Galilea, nde dib ben Xa' mde' Mbi Nayon, nde mxyob xkiꞌs Xaꞌ reta yez nzi lo xyon Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nde kad yez mdobte Jesus mbloꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo men lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop re xaꞌ Israel, nde reta men nabeꞌz ni xa' xis Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus nda yez Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Senꞌ mzin Jesus yez Nazaret tenꞌ mxyen Xa', nde wiz jwanꞌ ndryoꞌxkwen re xaꞌ Israel, ngote Xa' lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop re xaꞌ Israel a xajka nak mod jwan' ngeno Xa' nde mdoli Xa' sa lab Xa' xkiꞌs Dios lo reta men. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Zyasa mda' xa' ye's jwan' mke' profet Isaias lo Jesus sa lab Jesusa, nde senꞌ mxalꞌ Xaꞌ ye's, mzyal Xaꞌ tenꞌ nchab:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />Mbi Nayon chanꞌ Dios ndonon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">tak mblí Dios na, sa tej na diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios lo re xaꞌ prob,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">mtelꞌ Dios na sa todanꞌ na re xaꞌ ndyak yis nabil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">sa tej na lyaꞌ re xa' nge lizyi'b,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">todanꞌ na ngudlo re xaꞌ syeg,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">tola'n re xaꞌ nga'sno re yalti,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />nde sa tej na lo re men ngol be' nzo yalwen chanꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Xisa mthus Jesus ye's mdaꞌ Jesus sa lo xaꞌ ndli sin' lo yo ndyop xa', nde mdob Jesus. Zyasa reta men nzi tya, ngwiꞌ do' xaꞌ lo Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Le' Jesus mdobte nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:21">—Naya ngok jwanꞌ nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios ta mblab na lo goꞌ re'.<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Nde reta xa' wen ni xa' xis Jesus, nde nzoyen xaꞌ mbin xaꞌ re diꞌs wen mni Jesus, nde nchab xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:22">—¿Cho nanakta xaꞌ reꞌ nak xinꞌ Jose?<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:23">—Mnepa na le' go' ncholaꞌs nye thi di's gol re' lon: "Doctor, ¡Btoyak leꞌga lu!" nde nye goꞌ: "Re jwanꞌ mbin náꞌ mblia yez Capernaum, noga las la re' bliy."<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Nde noga nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:24">—Lipa nin lo goꞌ, ngen choꞌ thi profet nabe'z lyen men las xa' xa'. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Nipa na lo go' ngo thoz ngol nguj sal' na' dib Israel tyemp mkete profet Elias, sen' ta na'ndlada yi tson lin' narol nde jwan' toz ngo win dib nax izyo, <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />per namtelꞌta Dios Elias lo nek thib ngola, cheꞌla mtelꞌ Dios Elias lo thi ngol nguj sal' na' xa' yez Sarepta jwanꞌ nzi lo xyon Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Nde tagaꞌ tyemp mkete profet Eliseo, ngo naꞌr toz men ndyak ye'sya's yez Israel, per nek thib xa' namdyanꞌta, benꞌta Naaman xaꞌ yez Siria mdyanꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Senꞌ mbin re xaꞌ jwanꞌ nzi lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel re jwanꞌ nchab Jesus, jwanꞌ toz ngok nayiꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Zyasa mbloꞌte xaꞌ Jesus len' yez, mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus axta gap yek yi, ten' nzi yez xa', tya ncholaꞌs xaꞌ chixkwe xaꞌ Jesus yek ble toz. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Per Jesus mbridndaꞌb xij xaꞌ nde nda Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi men bi' nzo mbi narax lazon'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Zyasa mdola Jesus nda Xa' yez Capernaum, jwanꞌ nax lo xyon Galilea; nde re wiz jwanꞌ ndryoꞌxkwen xa' Israel, ndloꞌ Xa' xkiꞌs Dios lo men. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Nde le'ka nzoyen re men ngwi' xa' xa ndloꞌ Jesus xki's Dios, tak kon yalnyebeꞌ ni Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Nde lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, ndob thi men biꞌ nzo mbi narax lazon', nde mbrezyaj xaꞌ nchab xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />—¡Blaꞌ náꞌ! ¿Cho kwan nchala's la li noa náꞌ, Jesus Xaꞌ Nazaret? ¿Choꞌ nde lux la náꞌ? Nzolon la, lu nak Xaꞌ Nayon chan' Dios.<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Nde mbresno Jesus mbi naraxa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:35">—¡Btowꞌ roa nde bro'te lazo' mbiꞌ re'!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:35">Zyasa nzi wi' re men mblobi mbi naraxa mbiꞌ ya izyo, nde mbroꞌtey per ngen kwan mblinoy mbiꞌ ya. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Nde reta men nzi tya le'ka nzoyen xaꞌ, nde nchab xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:36">—¿Cho yalne ndono mbi' ba? Sa kon yalnyebeꞌ, nyebeꞌ mbi' lo mbi narax ryoꞌtey, ¡Nde ndryoꞌtey!<verse eid="LUK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Nde jwan' toz mxyo'b xkis' Jesus reta yez jwan' nzi tya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ xnaꞌsap Simon Pedr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Zyasa Jesus mbroꞌte lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, nde nda Jesus liz Simon, leꞌ xnaꞌsap Simon nax lo yis, jwanꞌ toz nzo xlye xaꞌ. Nde mna'b re xaꞌ lo Jesus sa todanꞌ Jesus xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Zyasa mbla ke' yek Jesus lo xa', nde mnebeꞌ Jesus ryoꞌ xlye xaꞌ, nde mbroꞌ xlye nde zyaga ngoche xaꞌ nde mdaꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ mda reta xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ naꞌr men yis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Senꞌ ndobix wiz, reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngeno men yis, jwanꞌ ndyak xaꞌxaꞌ yis ndeno xaꞌ xaꞌ lo Jesus nde Jesus mxoꞌb yaꞌ Jesus yek kad thiba xaꞌ, mtodanꞌ Jesus reta xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Nde naꞌr re xa' yisa mbroꞌte mbi narax lazon', nde mbrezyaja nchab ba:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">—¡Lu nak Xinꞌ Dios!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Per Jesus mbresno mbi naraxa nde naꞌndaꞌd Jesus diꞌs niy, tak le'y mnela ke' Jesus nak Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mketeloꞌ xki's Dios dib lo xyon Galilea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Senꞌ mduxni, Jesus mbroꞌ yez ya, nda Xa' tenꞌ nagan, per re men ngwa kwanꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, nde senꞌ mzin xaꞌ tenꞌ ndo Jesus, ncholaꞌs xaꞌ tyenkeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, sa naꞌyad Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />per Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:43">—Noga nakinꞌ ya tej na diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios lo re temas yez, re jwan' nak yalnyebe' chan' Dios tak por jwanꞌ naga mtelꞌ Dios na.<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Tamod mkete loꞌ Jesus diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios lenꞌ re yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, dib lo xyon Galilea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesus mbli ngoga bro toz mbel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Thi wiz ndo Jesus ro nittoꞌ Genesaret, nde men toz tir mdyop lo Jesus axta ngaꞌs xaꞌ Jesus tak ncholaꞌs xaꞌ gon xaꞌ xkiꞌs Dios. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Jesus mbwi' chop bark nalaj nzi gax ro yux, tak re xaꞌ goꞌd mbel mbla xaꞌ lo bark ngetach xaꞌ yeꞌd xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Zyasa ngwap Jesus lo ti bark ya, nde bark ya nak chanꞌ Simon, nde mna'b Jesus lo Simon chep xa'y tud lenꞌ nittoꞌ. Zyasa mdob Jesus lenꞌ bark nde mdobte mbloꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo re men. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Senꞌ mne mdaꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo men, nchab Jesus lo Simon:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:4">—Beꞌ bark ten' na'sxa lenꞌ nit, nde kobi goꞌ yeꞌd goꞌ sa tyen goꞌ mbel.<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Zyasa mkab Simon:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:5">—Maestr, dib yalꞌ mke náꞌ goꞌd nde nek thib mbel naꞌngagada, per ta lu nyebeꞌy, gobin yeꞌd.<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nde senꞌ mblobi xaꞌ yeꞌd lenꞌ nit bro toz tir mbel ngoga, axta ndo ched yeꞌd. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Zyasa mbli xaꞌ señ mbrez xaꞌ ta xaꞌ ta nzo tedib len' bark, sa ye'd la'sto xa' xaꞌ. Nde mbyed la'sto xa' xaꞌ mtozeꞌ xaꞌ rop bark, lo mze toz rop bark axta ndolathab bark lenꞌ nit. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Simon Pedr jwanꞌ ta ngoka, mdoxub xaꞌ lo Jesus nde nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:8">—Bike tij lon Xa' Nyebe', tak na nak xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Tak nzoyen Simon nde mzyeb toz xa' kon reta xaꞌ nzino xa', lo tant bro mbel ngoga. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Taga' Jakob kon Juan xinꞌ Zebedeo ta god mbel Simon mzyeb toz xaꞌ. Per Jesus nchab lo Simon:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">—Naꞌzyebta la, tak xata naya le'a yalal men goꞌd, sa lia gan men par Dios.<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Senꞌ mzinno xaꞌ rop bark ro yux, mblaꞌ xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ tya, nde mdonke xaꞌ xis Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ thi xaꞌ ndyak ye'sya's</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Thi wiz sen' ndo Jesus thi yez ya, mzin thi xaꞌ biꞌ ndyak ye'sya's lo Jesus, senꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ Jesus mdoxub xaꞌ lo Jesus axta mdinꞌ yek xaꞌ izyo nde mnaꞌb xaꞌ lo Jesus nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:12">—Xa' Nyebe', Nya'b na loa todan' na, lu toyal liy tez ncholaꞌs la li ley.<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Zyasa mtogaꞌ Jesus yaꞌ Jesus nde mbwal Jesus xaꞌ ya nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:13">—Ncholas na, dyanꞌ la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:13">Nde zyaga mdyanꞌ xaꞌ lo yis ya. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:14">—Ngen cho lo tej la jwanꞌ reꞌ, benꞌta wa lo nglweyꞌ sa wiꞌ xaꞌ la, nde beꞌ yon jwanꞌ ndablo taꞌa lo ta mbyak la, a xata nyebeꞌ ley chanꞌ Moises, sa loꞌ ke mbyak la.<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Mbay che'la masra' mxyob xkiꞌs Jesus, men toz mdyop lo Jesus sa gon xaꞌ kwent ndaꞌ Jesus, nde sa todanꞌ Jesus xaꞌ lo re yis ndyak xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Per Jesus nda re tenꞌ nagan sa todiꞌsno Jesus Dios.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ thi xaꞌ nguj thi ble</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Thi wiz Jesus ngeloꞌ xkiꞌs Dios lo men, tya mdob re xaꞌ fariseo kon re xaꞌ nak maestr loley, jwanꞌ nde re lo xyon Galilea, Judea nde yez Jerusalen. Nde Jesus ngeno yalne chanꞌ Dios, sa todanꞌ Xaꞌ men. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Zyasa mzin pla xaꞌ ndeno thi xaꞌ nguj thi ble, nzo'b lo yalonꞌ nde ncholaꞌs xaꞌ we xaꞌ xaꞌ axta lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndo Jesus nde kix xa' xa' lo Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />per naꞌgakta yote xaꞌ, tak men toz tira, zyasa ngwap xaꞌ yek yo nde mkib xa' pla tej, sa tya mbla xaꞌ yalonꞌ nzoꞌb xaꞌ yisa tenꞌ ndo Jesus xtow re men toz tira'. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Jesus jwanꞌ toz ndli lazoꞌ re xaꞌ ya Jesus, nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ nguj thi ble yaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:20">—Mbiꞌ reta xken la mdyonꞌ la.<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Zyasa re xaꞌ fariseo nde re maestr nchak ley, mdobte mbli xaꞌ xgab: "¿Cho nak mbiꞌ reꞌ? ¿Kwan ndliy ta narax ni xaꞌ xis Dios? Ngencho li gan tonꞌ xken men, benꞌta Dios tak tonꞌ xken men."<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Leꞌ Jesus mnela cho xgab ndli xaꞌ, nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:22">—¿Kwan liy ta ndli goꞌ xgab? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />¿Cho kwan mas nambi gab na lo xaꞌ: "Leꞌ xken la mdyonꞌla", o gab na lo xaꞌ: "Goche nde pte"? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Sa nye goꞌ leꞌ Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ ngeno yalnyebeꞌ sa tonꞌ Xaꞌ re xken men lo izyo reꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:24">Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xa' nguj thi ble ya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:24">—Leꞌ loa nin, goche, bxen lonꞌ la nde bya liz la.<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Nde zyaga ngoche xaꞌ ta nguj thi ble ya, nde nzi wiꞌ re men, mxen xaꞌ lonꞌ xaꞌ ndya xaꞌ liz xaꞌ, nde taja ndaꞌ xaꞌ dyux lo Dios. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Nde reta xaꞌ nzi tya leꞌka nzoyen xaꞌ nde nzyeb xaꞌ, ndaꞌ xaꞌ dyux lo Dios nchab xa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:26">—Naya mbwinꞌ yalnaro chanꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mbrez Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Senꞌ mne jwanꞌ reꞌ, mbroꞌ Jesus nda Xaꞌ nde mbwiꞌ Xaꞌ thi xaꞌ biꞌ jwan' nyaꞌb tmi low ndole Levi, xaꞌ ya ndob tenꞌ nchax tmi low, nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:27">—Ptonke xis na.<verse eid="LUK 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Zyasa mdoli Levi, mblaꞌ xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ nde mdonke xaꞌ xis Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Xisa mda' Levi thi yalwa ro liz Levi par Jesus, nde bro xaꞌ jwan' naka sin' nthop tmi low nde temas re men nzi ro mes kon Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Per re xaꞌ fariseo nde re maestr nchak ley, mdobte ni xin xa' xis re xin'te'd Jesus nde nchab xa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:30">—¿Kwan liy ncha goꞌ nde nchuꞌ go' kon re xaꞌ nthop tmi low nde re xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Leꞌ Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:31">—Re xaꞌ nadanꞌ nanakinta xaꞌ doktor, benꞌta re xaꞌ nayiz, xaꞌ ya nakinꞌ doktor. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nandalta na sa bez na re xaꞌ gal' ndo, lenꞌ ndal sa bez na re xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ, sa laꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ narax nde bere xaꞌ lo Dios.<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ngoꞌxkan xamod nak yalse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:33">—¿Kwan liy re xin'te'd Juan nke toz xaꞌ yalse nde tibla' ndo di'sno xa' Dios nde tagaꞌ ndli re xin'te'd fariseo, per re xin'te'd la thiblaꞌ ncha xaꞌ nde nchuꞌ xaꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:34">—¿Cho nye toyal li goꞌ, sa re xaꞌ nzi lo yalselyaꞌ ke xa' yalse, laja mbyo ndo selyaꞌ ben' ndo xij xa'? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Per tsin wiz senꞌ we xaꞌ or nselyaꞌ, zyasa ke xaꞌ yalse.<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Zyasa mdej Jesus thi kwent nagan lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:36">—Ngen cho thi men nchoꞌ thi ble lar kub sa kibde xa'y lad lar gox. Tez ta li xaꞌ, benꞌta tati xaꞌ lar kub nde tagaꞌ lar gox nanzaltey kebdey kon lar kub. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Nde taga ngen choꞌ ngo bin kub lenꞌ yid gox, tez cho xaꞌ ta li, bin kuba li cheꞌd yid, xyo bin nde akti yid. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Jwanꞌ nasa ndablo ko men bin kub lenꞌ yid kub sa ropa na'yasaꞌda. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Nde re xaꞌ nchuꞌ bin ndala nzo, nanchalaꞌsta xaꞌ gu xaꞌ bin kub, tak mbez xaꞌ: "bin jwanꞌ ndala nzo jwanꞌ na mas naxeꞌ ndyeꞌ."<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Re xa' xin'te'd Jesus mthop trig lenꞌ wiz ndryoxkwen men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Thib wiz jwanꞌ ndryoꞌxkwen re xaꞌ Israel, ndarid Jesus kon re xin'te'd Xa' tenꞌ nzobin trig, nde re xa' nak xin'te'd Jesus, nthop xaꞌ trig ngis xaꞌy lo yaꞌ xaꞌ nde ncha xaꞌy. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Zyasa pla xaꞌ fariseo nchab lo re xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:2">—¿Kwan liy ndli goꞌ jwanꞌ nandabloda li men na wiz ndryoꞌxkwen men?<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Leꞌ Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:3">—¿Cho tera lab goꞌ jwanꞌ mbli David kon re men ndano xaꞌ lo senꞌ ndyanꞌ xaꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ngote xaꞌ lenꞌ liz Dios nde mxen xaꞌ pan nayon jwan' ben'ta nglwey' tak wa nde mda xaꞌy nde mdaꞌ xaꞌy mda re xaꞌ ndano xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Nde noga nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:5">—Le' na Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ, nyebe'n noga lo wiz jwan' ndryoꞌxkwen men.<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ mbiꞌ mbis yanꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Xa'ga' thi wiz jwan' ndryoꞌxkwen men, ngote Jesus lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, mdobte mbloꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo re xaꞌ, nde xija ndo thi mbiꞌ jwan' mbis yaꞌ ban naꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Nde re maestr nchak ley nde re xaꞌ fariseo ngela's xa' nyenꞌ cho todanꞌ Jesus xaꞌ yisa len' wiz ya, sa zyal xaꞌ yalke keꞌ xaꞌ yek Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Per Jesus mnela xgab ndli xaꞌ, nchab Jesus lo men ta mbis yanꞌ ya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:8">—Ptoli nde pto xtowꞌ reꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:8">Zyasa mdoli xaꞌ nde mdo xaꞌ xtowꞌ re men nzi tya. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo re xaꞌ nzi tya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:9">—Naya nyabdiꞌs na lo goꞌ: ¿Cho kwanꞌ ndablo li men lenꞌ wiz jwan' ndryoꞌxkwen men, li men jwanꞌ wen o li men jwanꞌ narax? ¿Cho tola' men yalnaban thi men o la' men di's gaj xa'?<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Zyasa xe mbwiꞌ Jesus lo reta xaꞌ nzi tya nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ ta mbis yanꞌ ya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:10">—Ptogaꞌ yaꞌa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:10">Zyasa mtogaꞌ xaꞌ yaꞌ xaꞌ nde mdyanꞌ yaꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Per re maestr nchak ley nde re xaꞌ fariseo jwanꞌ toz mxi lazoꞌ xaꞌ, nde mdobte mdodiꞌs re xaꞌ, sa nyenꞌ cho kwan lino xaꞌ Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mblí thib sen xa' jwan' ak apost</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Nde len' re wiz ya ngwa Jesus thi yek yiꞌ sa todiꞌsno Jesus Dios, nde dib yalꞌ ya mdodiꞌsno Jesus Dios. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Senꞌ mduxni mbrez Jesus re xin'te'd Xaꞌ, nde mblí Xaꞌ thib sen xaꞌ, nde re thib sen xaꞌ ya mblole Jesus Apost. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Re xaꞌ ya nak: Simon xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbloꞌlegaꞌ Jesus Pedr, Ndres wes Simon, Jakob, Juan, Blib, Bartol, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mateo, Max, Jakob xinꞌ Alfeo, Simon xaꞌ nzo xij partid kananist, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Judas wes Jakob nde Judas Iscariot, xa' jwanꞌ mdaꞌyaꞌ Jesus sa kuj xaꞌ Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mbloꞌ xkiꞌs Dios lo bro toz men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Zyasa mdola Jesus yiꞌ ya kon re apost Xa' nde mbled Xaꞌ thi lo laꞌs. Nde bro toz re xin' ted Xa' nzi tya, taga men toz tir mdyop jwanꞌ nde re yez nzi dib lo xyon Judea, yez Jerusalen, re yez nzi gax ro nitto lo xyon Tiro nde lo xyon Sidon, reta men mzin sa gon men jwanꞌ ndej Xa' nde sa dyanꞌ men lo re yis ndyak men. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Nde reta men jwan' nzo mbi narax lazon' mtodanꞌ Xa' men. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Zyasa reta men ncholaꞌs gal men lad Xa', tak lad Xa' ndryoꞌ re yalne jwan' dyanꞌ re men nayiz.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yalnabeꞌz chanꞌ Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Jesus mbwiꞌ lo re xin'te'd Jesus, nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:20">—Nabeꞌz toz nda re goꞌ ta ngekwan ngeno, tak chanꞌ goꞌ nak tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />ꞌNabeꞌz toz nda goꞌ jwanꞌ ndyanꞌ naya, tak nix tse goꞌ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:21">ꞌNabeꞌz toz nda goꞌ ta nchonꞌ naya, tak tsin wiz xi goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />ꞌNabeꞌz toz nda go' senꞌ ngiꞌno men goꞌ, senꞌ na'nzal'tatra' men go', senꞌ ndloꞌs men goꞌ nde senꞌ nixin men xis goꞌ xaja men xkapa, por ndli lazoꞌ goꞌ na Xin' Mbi'. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Nale toz blo lazoꞌ goꞌ wiz ya, tak naro toz nak jwanꞌ kayaꞌ goꞌ lo beꞌ, tak taga' re xaꞌ gox lo go' mtoti xaꞌ re profet ngo pola.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />ꞌPer nalat tyak re goꞌ xa' rik, tak ngenoa goꞌ yalnale chanꞌ goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />ꞌNalat tyak goꞌ ta ngeno jwanꞌ ncha naya, tak tsin wiz tyak goꞌ win!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:25">ꞌNalat tyak goꞌ jwanꞌ ta nale nzo lazonꞌ naya, tak tsin wiz gon goꞌ lo yalnabil.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />ꞌNalat tyak re goꞌ ta nabe'z ni re men xis go' naya, tak taga' nabe'z mni xaꞌ gox lo goꞌ xis re profet kwinꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keꞌ lazoꞌ men re xaꞌ nakap nak lo men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />ꞌPer na ni lo re goꞌ jwanꞌ ndoyon xkiꞌs na: Pkeꞌ lazoꞌ goꞌ re xa' nakap nak lo goꞌ, wen bli goꞌ lo re xaꞌ jwan' ngotal goꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />bli ley' goꞌ re xaꞌ naxin ni xis goꞌ, mnaꞌb goꞌ lo Dios por re xaꞌ nke' yalkwin' xis goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Tez cho ti xaꞌ keꞌy thi lad kwat la, pta' tedib lad kwat la keꞌ xaꞌy, nde tez cho xaꞌ kib chamar la, ptaꞌ diꞌs we xaꞌ noga camis la. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Nde tez cho xa' nyaꞌb thi jwan' loa ptaꞌy, nde tez cho xaꞌ kib jwanꞌ nak chanꞌ la, naꞌnyaꞌbta lay lo xa' sere xa'y. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Bli goꞌ lo re men a xaja ndryoꞌ lazoꞌ go' li men lo goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Tak tez benꞌta nkeꞌ lazoꞌ goꞌ re xaꞌ nkeꞌ lazonꞌ goꞌ, ¿Cho yalwen ndoli goꞌ sa? Tak axta re xaꞌ ndli jwanꞌ narax ndli jwan' na. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Nde tez ben'ta ndli goꞌ yalwen lo re xaꞌ ndli wen lo goꞌ, ¿Cho yalwen ndoli goꞌ sa? Tak axta re xaꞌ ndli jwanꞌ narax taga' ndli xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Nde tez benꞌta ndaꞌ goꞌ prest lo re xaꞌ jwanꞌ tak kotay, ¿Cho yalwen ndoli goꞌ sa? Tak axta re xaꞌ ndli jwanꞌ narax, ndli prest xaꞌ jwanꞌ lo ta xaꞌ nde ngebed xaꞌ kayaꞌ xaꞌ xinꞌ neꞌy. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Per goꞌ ndablo keꞌ lazoꞌ goꞌ re xaꞌ jwanꞌ nayiꞌ lo goꞌ, bli goꞌ yalwen lo xa', nde bkwan' prest go' jwan' ka xa' na'kembedta goꞌ kayaꞌ go nek thib jwanꞌ yotay. Tamod sa naro ak yalwen kayaꞌ goꞌ nde ndlo' nak goꞌ xinꞌ Dios ro, tak Dios wen toz nak Xa' lo re men nandyod cho nzo Dios nde lo re men ndli jwanꞌ narax. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Gok goꞌ men ndlat lazonꞌ ta mena, ta xa xud go' Dios ndlat lazoꞌ Xaꞌ reta men.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naꞌkoxyod goꞌ xaꞌga men.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Naꞌkoxyod goꞌ men, sa naꞌnyabta Dios kwent lo goꞌ. Nake'd goꞌ yalke yek men sa naꞌkeꞌd Dios yalke yek goꞌ, nde bri'd goꞌ yek go' re jwan' narax ndli men lo goꞌ sa taga' ton' Dios re xken go'. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ptaꞌ goꞌ jwan' lo men nde Dios taꞌy lo goꞌ, kej sak, sib xa'y nde axta ndorasa ta' xa'y lo go', tak xa nchix goꞌ jwanꞌ ndaꞌ goꞌ taga' chix Dios jwanꞌ taꞌ Dios lo goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Nde mdej Jesus thi kwent re':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:39">—¿Cho tak koꞌb thi xaꞌ nkow ngud lonꞌ ned lo tedib xaꞌ nkow ngud lonꞌ? ¿Cho naꞌgapta rop xaꞌ lenꞌ yeꞌr? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Nek thib xin' nte'd maestr mas ntak lo maestr, per senꞌ mne mteꞌd xaꞌ zyasa ak xaꞌ xaja Maestr xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />ꞌ¿Kwan liy ngwiꞌa yix lud nzo ngudlo wes la, nde nangwiꞌt la ya ro nzo le'ga ngudloa? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Nde tez nangwiꞌt la ya ro nzo leꞌga ngudloa, ¿Xamod ncholaꞌs la gab la lo wes la nde btan' la: "Ptaꞌ diꞌs sa go'ten yix lud nzo ngudloa ba?" ¡Ma kwinꞌ! Nerla bloꞌ ya ro nzo ngudloa, sa jwin wiꞌa, seraꞌ ko'a yix lud nzo ngudlo wes la nde btan' la.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Be' xa nak ngud ndaꞌ ya ncholo men cho yay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Jesus nchab ngenta ya wen jwanꞌ nda' ngud mbye'd nde naꞌngenta ya yis jwanꞌ ndaꞌ ngud wen. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Tak re ya ncholo mena lo xa nak ngud nda'y. Nanthopta men ig lo ya yis neka nanthopta men ub lo yis ti. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Men wen, ngo' men jwan' wen nzo lazo' men lo ndyodi's men nde men xkap, ngo' men jwan' xkap nzo lazo' men lo ndyodi's men, tak jwanꞌ mas nzo lazoꞌ men, jwanꞌ na ndryoꞌ ro men.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndaꞌ kwent chanꞌ chop xaꞌ nta' yo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />ꞌ¿Cho kwan liy mbez goꞌ lon, "Xaꞌ nyebeꞌ, Xaꞌ nyebeꞌ ", nde nandlid goꞌ jwanꞌ nin lo goꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Naya tej na lo goꞌ xamod nak xaꞌ nchon xkiꞌs na nde ndli xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbez na lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Nak xaꞌ xaja thi xaꞌ mtaꞌ thi yo. Nerla na's mdenꞌ xaꞌ tenꞌ tyob xanꞌ neꞌy nde xis ke mdob xa' xan' ne'y nde senꞌ mxyen yoꞌ, ngwap nit nde dib ne nit mkanꞌ na lad yo, per naꞌndlidey gan nkwina yo, tak xis ke ndob yo. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Per xaꞌ nchon xkiꞌs na nde nandlid xaꞌy, nak xaꞌ xaja thi xaꞌ jwanꞌ ntaꞌ yo tata lo izyo nde naꞌngyen'ta xa' tenꞌ ngo xanꞌ yo, senꞌ mxyen yoꞌ nde dib ney mkanꞌ na lad yo, mbyub yo nde thiptane mbil la.<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ thi xa' nak mos xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo sondad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Senꞌ mne mni Jesus lo re men, mbroꞌ Jesus nda Jesus yez Capernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Nde yez ya nzo thi xaꞌ Rom, jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ lo thib ayoꞌ sondad, xaꞌ ya ngeno thi mos jwanꞌ nkeꞌ toz lazoꞌ xaꞌ, nde jwanꞌ toz nayiz mos, mer gaj mos. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Senꞌ mbin xaꞌ nyebeꞌ ya ndej men Jesus, mtelꞌ xaꞌ pla xaꞌ Israel xaꞌ gox jwan' nyebe' lo re xa' Israel, sa ya naꞌb xaꞌ lo Jesus yeꞌd todanꞌ Jesus mos xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Senꞌ mzin re xaꞌ lo Jesus mnaꞌb toz xaꞌ lo Jesus nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:4">—Nzal' ye'd la'stoa xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo sondad. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Tak nkeꞌ lazoꞌ xaꞌ na', xaꞌ Israel nde mtaꞌ xaꞌ thi yo tenꞌ ndyop na'.<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Zyasa nda Jesus kon re xaꞌ ya, per senꞌ ndozin Jesus gax liz xaꞌ, zyasa leꞌ xaꞌ nyebeꞌ ya mtelꞌ pla xa' nzal' ta xaꞌ, ngwa yab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">—Naꞌlit la xgab yotea lenꞌ liz na, tak nanzalꞌta na yotea lenꞌ liz na; <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />jwanꞌ nasa na'ngad yub na ngaxin la. Per benꞌta mnabeꞌ lo yis sa dyanꞌ mos na. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Tak noga na ngenon xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lon, nde noga ngenon re sondad jwanꞌ nyebeꞌn lon'. Senꞌ gab na lo thi xaꞌ, "wa", nda xaꞌ, senꞌ gab na lo thib xaꞌ, "deꞌ ", nde xaꞌ, nde senꞌ nyebeꞌn lo mos na li xaꞌ thi jwanꞌ, ndli xaꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Senꞌ lo mbin Jesus jwanꞌ reꞌ leꞌka nzoyen Jesus, nde mbwiꞌ Jesus lo reta men ndanke xis Jesus nde nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:9">—Lipa nin lo goꞌ ke nek thib xaꞌ Israel teraꞌ yosal na jwanꞌ ndli toz lazonꞌ xaja ndli lazoꞌ mbiꞌ reꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Nde senꞌ mbere re xaꞌ ta mtelꞌ xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re sondada liz xaꞌ, mbwiꞌ xaꞌ leꞌ mos xaꞌ ya mdyanꞌla.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtoban thi xinꞌ ngol nguj sal' na'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Senꞌ mne mbrid re jwanꞌ reꞌ, ngwa Jesus thi yez ndole Nain, kon re xin'te'd Jesus nde men toz ndanke xis Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Senꞌ ndozin Jesus gax ro yez, mbwiꞌ Jesus nda ka's xa' thi thabol, nde thabol ya nak xinꞌ thi ngol nguj sal' na', thib nya or lo ngol. Nde men toz nda li kompay ngol. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Jesus ngol ya, mblat lazoꞌ Jesus xaꞌ nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:13">—Naꞌgonta la.<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Nde mbike Jesus gax cho lon' nde mbwal Xa'y, leꞌ re xaꞌ neꞌ lon' nzob or nguja ngoto xaꞌ, nde nchab Jesus lo or nguja:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:14">—Mbyo, nin loa: ¡Goche!<verse eid="LUK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Zyasa ngoche or nguja nde mdobte mdodiꞌs or, nde mdaꞌya' Jesus or lo xnaꞌr. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Le' reta men ta nzi wiꞌ ya mzyeb toz xa' jwanꞌ ta ngoka, nde mdobte ni xaꞌ diꞌs wen lo Dios nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:16">—Thi profet ro nzo xij naꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:16">Nde nchaba xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:16">—Dios nde laꞌsto re men yez Dios.<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nde dib lo xyon Judea nde re yez nzi dib tya mbin xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbli Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juan ta ngole men mtelꞌ chop xaꞌ nyaꞌb diꞌs lo Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Re xa' xin'te'd Juan ta ngole mena mdej xa' lo Juan re jwanꞌ mbli Jesus. Zyasa mbrez Juan chop xin'te'd Juan, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />nde mtelꞌ Juan xaꞌ lo Jesus, sa nyabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus: "¿Cho lu nak xaꞌ ta nak kwent telꞌ Dios o ndablo kwed xaꞌ tediba xaꞌ?"<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Senꞌ mzin rop xaꞌ ta mtelꞌ Juan na lo Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:20">—Juan ta ngole men mtel' ná' sa nyabdi's ná' loa: "¿Cho lipa lu nak xaꞌ ta nak kwent telꞌ Dios o ndablo kwed náꞌ tedib xaꞌ?"<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Nde le'xa zyapa mtodanꞌ Jesus bro men nayiz, re men ndyak yalti, re men jwanꞌ nzo mbi narax, nde bro men nglwe mtodanꞌ Jesus ngudlo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Zyasa mkab Jesus lo xin'te'd Juan nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:22">—Bya goꞌ nde btej goꞌ lo Juan reta jwanꞌ mbwiꞌ goꞌ nde reta jwanꞌ mbin goꞌ, re xaꞌ nglwe, ngwiꞌ xaꞌ, re xaꞌ naꞌakta tye ndye xaꞌ, re xaꞌ ndyak ye'sya's, mbyak xaꞌ, re xaꞌ nkweꞌ mxyalꞌ nza xaꞌ, re xaꞌ nguj mbroꞌxban, nde re xaꞌ prob ndoyon xa' diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Nabeꞌz toz nda xaꞌ jwan' nanchakropta xgab na' kwent ndyonke xa' xis na.<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Senꞌ ndyala re xin'te'd Juan, Jesus mdobte mdodi's Xa' kwent chanꞌ Juan lo re men nchab Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:24">—¿Cho kwan mbwi' go' sen' ngwa go' izyo nagan? ¿Cho benta thi yi nkwin mbi mbwiꞌ goꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Per, ¿cho ngwa wiꞌ goꞌ sa? ¿Cho thi mbiꞌ nok lar nap toza? Goꞌ mne le' re xaꞌ ndyokwa' nde re xa' ngeno re jwan' nap, liz rey nzo xa'. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Per, ¿cho ngwa wiꞌ go sa? ¿Cho thi profet mbwiꞌ goꞌ? Lipa, nin lo goꞌ, thi profetka ngwa wiꞌ goꞌ, nde xa' nak mas ke thi profet. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Juan reꞌ ngetej xkiꞌs Dios, tenꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">Na telꞌ thi xaꞌ kwiblo loa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">xaꞌ toxkwaꞌ xned la.<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Na ni lo goꞌ, xij reta mbi' ngol xis izyo re', tera' yo thi profet mas ntak lo Juan, per xaꞌ jwanꞌ mas lud ntak ten' nyebe' Dios, xaꞌ ya mas ntak lo Juan.<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Senꞌ mbin re men jwan' na nde axta re xaꞌ nthop tmi low par yez Rom mbyolo xa' gal' nak xned Dios, nde mblole Juan xa'. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Per re xaꞌ fariseo nde re maestr nchak ley, mblotal xaꞌ yalwen jwanꞌ nchola's Dios li Dios lo xaꞌ, tak na'ndeyalta xa' ngo'le Juan xa'. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:31">—¿Cho kwan kalal na kon re men nzo tyemp reꞌ? ¿Cho kwan lal nak xa'? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Nak xa' xaja re mbyo ta mbe lo xbiꞌ ngija nde mbez lo tan': "Mkeꞌ náꞌ flaut, nde naꞌnkanida goꞌ, mbilꞌ náꞌ di nabil ndye, nde naꞌngonꞌta goꞌ." <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Tak mbyeꞌd Juan ngole men, namdada xaꞌ pan nde nanguꞌda xaꞌ bin, nde mbez goꞌ mbi narax nzo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mbye'd Xin' Mbi' ncha nde nchu', nde mbez goꞌ xaꞌ wacho nde xaꞌ nchuꞌ bin, nde nzalꞌ ta xa' re xaꞌ nthop tmi low par Rom nde kon re xaꞌ nzo'b xken na'. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Per yalnchak chan' Dios ndloꞌ ndonoy re men jwanꞌ lí nkwan' na.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ngwa liz Simon xaꞌ fariseo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Zyasa thi xaꞌ fariseo mna'b lo Jesus, sa ya tha Jesus liz xaꞌ, senꞌ ngote Jesus len' liz xaꞌ mdob Jesus ro mes. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Nde yez ya nzo thi ngol jwanꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ, senꞌ mne ngol ndobya Jesus liz xa' fariseo, ngwa ngol nde mbeꞌ ngol thi bot naksa' ke ndole alabastro nzo perfum. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Nchonꞌ ngol ndoxub ngol lad xis Jesus, nde kon nit mbe lo ngol mbwaz ngol ni Xa', xisa kon yis yek ngol mkwiꞌs ngol ni Xaꞌ, mda ngol chut ni Xaꞌ nde mchub ngol perfum ni Xa'. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ fariseo ta mbeꞌ Jesus liz naꞌ ya, jwanꞌ mbli ngol ya, mbli xaꞌ xgab: "Tez liga profet nak Xaꞌ reꞌ, mnea Xaꞌ cho men nak ngol ta ndo gal Xaꞌ, ngol nzo'b xken na'y." <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ fariseo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">—Simon, ncholas na tej na thi jwanꞌ loa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Le' Simon mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">—Pteja, Maestr.<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:41">—Ngo chop xaꞌ nda'b tmi lo thi xaꞌ ngoꞌ prest. Thib xaꞌ ndab gayꞌ ayoꞌ tmi plat. Nde tedib xaꞌ nda'b chop siꞌ tmi plat. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Nde nek thib xa' nandlid gan ngixa lo xaꞌ ta mda' prest tmi ya, zyasa xaꞌ ta mda' prest tmi ya mton' xa' jwan' nda'b rop xa' ya. Naya ptej lon, ¿Lo rop xa', xanya xa' mas nke' lazo' xa' jwan' ta mda' prest tmi ya?<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Leꞌ Simon mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">—Nda lazoꞌn xaꞌ jwanꞌ mdyon' mas bro tmi nda'b ba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">—Lin lay.<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Zyasa mbwiꞌ Jesus lo ngol nde nchab Jesus lo Simon:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:44">—¿Bwiꞌ nea, ngol reꞌ? Senꞌ ngoteꞌn len' liz la namdat la nit ngech nin, per ngol reꞌ mtach nin kon nit mbe ngudlo ngol nde mtokwiꞌs ngola kon yis yek ngol. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Namdad la chut kwat na, per ngol reꞌ xata ngoten liz la ndoya ngol chut nin. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Namchupta la aseyt yek na, per ngol reꞌ mchub perfum nin. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Jwan' nasa na ni loa, reta xken ngol mdyon'la, jwanꞌ na bro toz nkeꞌ lazoꞌ ngol na, per xaꞌ lud xken naꞌ ndyonꞌ, lud nkeꞌ lazoꞌ xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo ngol:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:48">—Reta xken la mdyon'la.<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Nde re xaꞌ jwanꞌ nzino Jesus ro mes, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:49">—¿Cho nak Xaꞌ reꞌ, sa no Xa' nton' xken men?<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Per Jesus nchab lo ngol:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:50">—Tak mbli lazoꞌa na, jwanꞌ na mblya lo xken la, nabe'z bya.<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Re ngol jwanꞌ mbli sin' lo Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Senꞌ mne re jwanꞌ reꞌ, Jesus mkete naꞌr yez ro nde re rach, mkete loꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios nde yalnyebe' chan' Dios lo re men nde kon re thib sen apost Xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />nogaꞌ pla ngol ngetenke xis Jesus jwanꞌ ta mtodanꞌ Jesus lo yis nde mbloꞌte Jesus mbi narax lazon'. Xija nda Mari xaꞌ ndolegaꞌ Magdalen, xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbloꞌte Jesus gaz mbi narax lazon'. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />No ngol ndole Juán salꞌ xaꞌ ndole Chuza, xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndli sinꞌ lo Herodes nde Susan, nde temasraꞌ ngol jwanꞌ ndli kompay Jesus kon re jwanꞌ ngeno ngol.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndaꞌ thi di's nagan chanꞌ thi xa' ngo bin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Zyasa men toz mbroꞌ re yez ngwa wiꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, nde senꞌ mketa bro toz men lo Jesus, mdaꞌ Jesus thi diꞌs nagan yen men chanꞌ thi xaꞌ ngo bin.<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />—Ngo thi xaꞌ ngobin mbro' nda lo mbis laja ngecha's xa'y ten' yoy, play ngob ro ned nde mdob ni mena nde mda mbina, <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />nde thi pla mbis ngob xij ke, mblyena nde mbiza, tak ngenta yo nakop sa xyena. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Thi pla mbis ngob xij yis, le' yis ta thita mblyen kon mbisa, mko'ta yek mbis ta mblyena. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Per thi pla mbis ngob izyo wen, mblyena nde mxyena nde kad thibay mdaꞌy ayoꞌga mbis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Nde senꞌ mne mdaꞌ Jesus kwent reꞌ, mas ne mni Xa' nchab Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">—¡Re xaꞌ ndob nzan, gon xaꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ!<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sinꞌ ndli re kwent nagan ndlo' Jesús</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Zyasa re xin'te'd Jesus mnabdiꞌs xa' lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:9">—¿Xamod nak kwent nagan reꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:10">—Dios ndli sa yen goꞌ re jwanꞌ nzo nagaꞌs tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios, per lo temas xaꞌ nagan ndej na re kwent, sa tenye ngwiꞌ xaꞌy naꞌyonida lo xaꞌ, tenye nchon xaꞌy, naꞌyenta xaꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ngoꞌxkan kwent nagan chanꞌ xaꞌ ngo bin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Cheꞌ mod nak kwent nagan reꞌ: mbis nak xki's Dios. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Le' lo ta ngoba ro neda nak xa' nchon xkiꞌs Dios, per nde maxuꞌ nde nkib maxuꞌy lazoꞌ xa', sa naꞌlid lazoꞌ xay nde naꞌlyaꞌd xa'. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Le' lo ta ngoba xij ke, nak xa' jwanꞌ nchon xkiꞌs Dios nde dib nale nzo lazoꞌ xa' ndli lazoꞌ xa'y, per nak xa' xaja trig ngenta bro lox naꞌ, ndli lazoꞌ xaꞌy lud tyemp nde senꞌ nde cho yalti lo xa'. zyaga ndlaꞌ xaꞌ xkiꞌs Dios. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Le' mbis ngob xij yisa nak xa' jwan' nchon xkiꞌs Dios, per senꞌ ndli xa' xgab re jwan' lo izyo re', ndyen xa' ak rik xa' nde ndyabla's xa' re jwanꞌ lo izyo, jwan' na ndli sa na'nxyenta xa' lo xki's Dios. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Mbay le' mbis jwanꞌ ngob lo yo wena, nak xa' jwanꞌ nchon xkiꞌs Dios, nde ndli lazoꞌ xaꞌy dib nzo lazoꞌ xaꞌ nde nxobyek xaꞌy nde ne ndo xaꞌ lo xkiꞌs Dios, xaja' jwanꞌ bin ndaꞌ bro jwanꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ xni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Ngencho ntob xni thi kandil nde ntowꞌ xa' yek neꞌy kon thi jwanꞌ, o ntob xaꞌy xanꞌ kam, cheꞌla gap ntob xaꞌy, sa toꞌxniy lo re xaꞌ nchote lenꞌ yo. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Nde taga' ngenta jwanꞌ nzonagaꞌs na'ryoꞌxobta nde ngenta jwanꞌ nanyed men naꞌryo'xobta, retay tro'xobka.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Jwanꞌ nasa jwin bin goꞌ jwanꞌ nin lo goꞌ, tak xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchenla, masra' yen xaꞌ, per xaꞌ jwanꞌ lud nchen, axta jwan' ndli xa' xgab nchen xaꞌ, yiꞌba lo xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xnaꞌ Jesus na re wes Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Zyasa mzin xnaꞌ Jesus na re wes Jesus tenꞌ ndo Jesus, per naꞌngakta mbike xaꞌ gax lo Jesus tak bro toz men nzi tya. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Zyasa thi xa' ngwayab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:20">—Xnaꞌa nde re wes la nzi le nde ncholaꞌs xaꞌ wiꞌ xaꞌ lu.<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Nde Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:21">—Reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchon xkiꞌs Dios nde nxoꞌbyek xaꞌy, xaꞌ ya nak xnaꞌn, nde re wes na.<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mbli ngota'b thi mbi toz lo nit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Thib wiz, Jesus kon re xin'te'd Xa' ngo Xa' lenꞌ thi bark, nde nchab Xa' lo re xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:22">—Ndanꞌ tedib lad ro nittoꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:22">Zyasa nda re xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Laja nda bark lo nittoꞌ, mdat Jesus. Zyasa mxyo'b thi mbi toz tir lo nit, nde tolo ndola nit lenꞌ bark, ya mer ndolana's bark lenꞌ nit. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Zyasa mbloꞌxkalꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">—¡Maestr! ¡Maestr! ¡Ya mer ndolanꞌ lenꞌ nittoꞌ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Zyasa ngoche Jesus nde mni Xa' lo mbi nde lo bde nde xej ngotaꞌba, mbre xe retey. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo re xin'te'd Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">—¿Cho nandlid lazoꞌ go Dios?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Per re xaꞌ nzyeb xaꞌ nde nzoyen xaꞌ, nyabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">—¿Cho nak Xaꞌ reꞌ, axta lo mbi nde lo bde nyebeꞌ Xaꞌ nde nxobyeka Xaꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi xaꞌ nzo mbi narax lazonꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Zyasa mzin xaꞌ las men Gadara, jwanꞌ nzi ro nittoꞌ, ngoꞌ lo xyon Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Nde senꞌ mbla Jesus lo bark, mbyeꞌd thi xaꞌ yez ya mbike lo Jesus. Xaꞌ ya, ndala nzo mbi narax lazo' xaꞌ, nde tata kacheꞌy xaꞌ ngete xaꞌ, nanchod xaꞌ thi yo, cheꞌla re xij baꞌ ncho xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Nde senꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, mdoxub xaꞌ lo Jesus nde mbrez yaj xaꞌ nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:28">—¿Cho kwan ndyaknoa na Jesus Xinꞌ Dios ro? ¡Nyaꞌb na loa naꞌtotit la na!<verse eid="LUK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ta nchab xaꞌ, tak Jesus mnebeꞌ lo mbi narax ryoꞌtey lazoꞌ xaꞌ, tak naꞌr toz gob jwanꞌ toz mtoti mbi narax xaꞌ, nde tenye ntobo men yaꞌ xaꞌ nde ni xaꞌ kon kaden, sa naꞌxyonꞌta xaꞌ, per nyay nchoꞌ xaꞌ nde nche' mbi naraxa xa' re tenꞌ nagan. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Zyasa mna'bdiꞌs Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">—¿Cho lea?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Le' mbi ya mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">—Na ndole Legion.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Ta nchab xaꞌ, tak bro toz tir mbi narax, mbla len' lazoꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Nde re mbi naraxa mnaꞌb toz lo Jesus sa natelꞌta Xaꞌy lenꞌ poz ngenta xanꞌ na'. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Nde gax tya nzi bro toz nguch lo kox nzi ya, zyasa mna'b toz re mbi naraxa lo Jesus sa taꞌ Jesus diꞌs yotey lenꞌ re nguch nde mdaꞌ Jesus diꞌs ngotey lenꞌ re nguch. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Zyasa mbroꞌte reta mbi naraxa lazoꞌ mbi' ya nde mblay lenꞌ re nguch, zyaga reta nguch mkeꞌ karel nde mbixndaꞌb nguch ble, mbla nguch lenꞌ nit nde ngwap nguch.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Nde senꞌ mbwiꞌ reta xaꞌ jwan' ngenap nguch jwanꞌna, mbroꞌ xaꞌ karel ngwatne xaꞌy lo re xaꞌ nzo yez nde nzo dib re ro yez. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Zyasa re men ngwa wiꞌ jwanꞌ ngok, senꞌ mzin re men tenꞌ ndo Jesus, mbwiꞌ xaꞌ leꞌ xa' ta mbro' mbi narax lazonꞌ ya ndob lo Jesus, nok xab xaꞌ nde mdyanꞌ tir xaꞌ, zyasa jwanꞌ toz mzyeb re men. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Nde reta xaꞌ ta mbwiꞌ jwanꞌ ngok, mdej xaꞌ xa mdyanꞌ xaꞌ nzo mbi naraxa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Zyasa reta xaꞌ xyon Gadara, mna'b xaꞌ lo Jesus sa ryoꞌte Jesus tya, tak jwanꞌ toz mzyeb xaꞌ. Zyasa ngwap Jesus lo bark nda Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Leꞌ xaꞌ ta mbroꞌte re mbi narax lazonꞌ ya, mnaꞌb xa' lo Jesus sa taꞌ Jesus diꞌs tyonke xaꞌ xis Jesus, per Jesus mnibeꞌ yanꞌ xaꞌ, nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />—Bere liz la nde btej plopa naro re jwanꞌ mbli Dios loa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Zyasa ndya xaꞌ, nde ngwa tej xaꞌ lo reta men yez xaꞌ, plopa naro re jwan' mbli Jesus lo xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzaꞌ xinꞌ Jairo nde ngol mbwal xab Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Senꞌ mbere Jesus tedib lad ro nittoꞌ, reta men toz tir nzi tya ngo nale lazoꞌ xaꞌ mzin Jesus, tak nzimbedla xaꞌ sin Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Zyasa mzin thi mbiꞌ ndole Jairo lo Jesus, xaꞌ ya nak xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel. Nde mdoxub xaꞌ lo Jesus mna'b toz xaꞌ sa ya Jesus liz xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />tak mza' xinꞌ xa' mer gaj nax lo yis, jwan' nzo thib senka lin' nde thi nyar lo xa'. Lo nda Jesus liz xaꞌ, men toz tir mdonke xis Jesus, anta ngaꞌs xaꞌ Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Nde xij reta mena nzo thi ngol, ndala thib sen lin' ndyak yis ndlyaj ren, nde mbyal mkete ngol lo re doktor, mblu'x ngol reta jwanꞌ ngeno ngol nde ngen cho doktor ndli gan ntodanꞌ ngol. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Zyasa mbike gax ngol a'xis Jesus, mbwal ngol lad xab Jesus, nde hor yaga ngota'b yis lo ngol.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Zyasa mna'bdiꞌs Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">—¿Cho mbwal lad xab na?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Nde reta xa' mkab namblid xa'y, zyasa Pedr kon temas xa' nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">—Maestr cho nangwi'd la men toz ngaꞌs la nde ntobyaꞌ xaꞌ la, nde nya'bdiꞌs la: "¿Cho mbwal lad xab na?"<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Per Jesus bere nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:46">—Thi xaꞌ mbwal xab na, tak nden' na mbroꞌ yalne lad na.<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Nde senꞌ mne ngol naꞌgakta ka's ngol, nde anta nxiꞌd xa' bike xa', mdoxub xa' lo Jesus, nde nzi wi' reta men, mbloro ngol kwan liy mbwal ngol xab Xa', nde mdej ngol hor yaga ngotab yis . <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo ngol:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:48">—Xinꞌ na, tak mbli lazoꞌa na, jwan' na mbyak la, nde naya nabeꞌz bya.<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Tata benꞌ ndo todiꞌs Jesus, senꞌ mzin thi xaꞌ mbro' liz Jairo ta nyebe' lo yo ten' ndyop xa' Israel nde nchab xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:49">—Naꞌtyodoꞌtra' la lo Maestr. Tak ngujla xinꞌ la.<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Per lo mbin Jesus jwan' na nchab Jesus lo Jairo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:50">—Naꞌzyepta la, benꞌta bli lazoꞌa Dios, nde xinꞌ la dyan'.<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Nde senꞌ mzin Jesus liz Jairo, naꞌndad Jesus diꞌs ngate re men lenꞌ yo, benꞌta Pedr, Santiag nde Juan, kon xud mzaꞌ nde xnaꞌ mzaꞌ ngoteno Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Nde reta men nabil ndyak, nchonꞌno xaꞌ mzaꞌ. Per Jesus nchab lo re men:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:52">—Naꞌgonta goꞌ, nangujta mzaꞌ, benꞌta naxyat mzaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Leꞌ re men mxino xaꞌ Jesus, tak mnea xaꞌ nguj mzaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Zyasa mxen Jesus yaꞌ mzaꞌ nde ne mni Xa' lo mzaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:54">—¡Mzaꞌ, goche!<verse eid="LUK 8:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Zyasa mbere xbin mzaꞌ, nde zyaga ngoche mzaꞌ, nde mnebeꞌ Jesus taꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ wa mzaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Leꞌ xud mzaꞌ nde xnaꞌ mzaꞌ nzoyen toz xaꞌ, per Jesus mnibe' lo xaꞌ, ngen cho lo gab xa' jwanꞌ ngok.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Jwan' li re thib sen xinꞌteꞌd Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mt. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mr. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Zyasa mthop Jesus re thib sen xin'te'd Jesus, nde mdaꞌ Jesus yalne nde yalnyebeꞌ lo re xa' sa koꞌte xaꞌ re ned mbi narax nzo lazo' men nde sa todanꞌ xaꞌ re men nayis. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Nde mtelꞌ Jesus xaꞌ sa yatej xaꞌ di's wen chanꞌ Dios nde ya todanꞌ xaꞌ re men nayiz. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:3">—Nawed go' nek thib jwan' nakin' go' ned, nawed go' yaga, neka bols, neka jwan' wa go', neka tmiꞌ, neka chop ned lar. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Nde one cho yo sin go', tyata byan' goꞌ axta senꞌ ryoꞌte goꞌ yez ya. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Nde yez jwanꞌ naꞌtad ten' kwed goꞌ, broꞌte goꞌ tya nde bzib goꞌ yothiꞌ ni goꞌ, sa nye xaꞌ ke narax mbli xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Zyasa mbroꞌ re xaꞌ, nde nda xaꞌ reta yez, nda tej xaꞌ diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios nde nda todanꞌ xaꞌ re men yis.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herodes nchola's nye nyen' cho nak Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Senꞌ mbin rey Herodes reta jwanꞌ ndli Jesus, anaꞌnye xaꞌ kwan li xaꞌ, tak cho men mbez mbroꞌxban Juan. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Nde cho men mbez Elias mbroꞌto nde cho men mbez nzo cho thi profet ngo pola, mbro'xban. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Per Herodes nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:9">—Leꞌga na mnibeꞌ mchoꞌ yek Juan. ¿Choga xaꞌ taja nchona ndej mena?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:9">Jwanꞌ nasa ncholaꞌs Herodes wiꞌ xa' Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mdaꞌ jwanꞌ mda gayꞌ mil men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Senꞌ mbere re apost Jesus, mdej xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ mbli xaꞌ lo Jesus. Zyasa xaꞌta mbeꞌ Jesus xaꞌ thi tenꞌ nagan lad yez Betsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Per senꞌ mne re mena, mdoke xaꞌ xis Jesus, nde ndyen Jesus mbwi' Jesus xa'. Mbloꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo xaꞌ nde mtodanꞌ Jesus re men nayiz.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Nde senꞌ ndozyela izyo, mbike re thib sen xin'te'd Jesus lo Jesus, nde nchab xaꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:12">—Gus lo re men sa ya xaꞌ re yez bix, nde re ranch nzi gax re' sa kwanꞌ xaꞌ tenꞌ ryoꞌxkwen xaꞌ nde kwanꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ wa xaꞌ, tak ncheꞌya ngen kwan nak.<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">—Pta' goꞌ jwanꞌ wa xaꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Le' re xa' mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">—Ngenta kwan nak benꞌta gayꞌ pan nde chop mbel ngeno náꞌ, o ¿nakinꞌ yatiꞌ náꞌ jwanꞌ wa re men toz re?<verse eid="LUK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Nde lo re xaꞌ biꞌ, mer ti gayꞌ milka xaꞌ. Zyasa Jesus nchab lo re xin'te'd Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">—Gus go lo re men, sa tyob xaꞌ por choꞌpsiga xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Nde tamod mbli re xin'te'd Jesus, mdob xa' reta men. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Nde mxen Jesus re gayꞌ pan nde rop mbel, mbwiꞌ Xa' lo beꞌ, mdaꞌ Xa' dyux lo Dios, mblirol Xa'y nde mdaꞌ Xa'y lo re xinꞌteꞌd Xa', sa kiꞌd xin'te'd Xaꞌy lo reta men. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Reta men mda axta ploja mze lenꞌ xaꞌ, ngolo mda xa', re xin'te'd Jesus mthop xaꞌ thib sen chokwid jwanꞌ mbroꞌxob.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pedr mdej Jesus nak Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Thib wiz senꞌ xaꞌta nge todi'sno Jesus Dios, nde no re xin'te'd Xa' nzi tya, zyasa mnabdiꞌs Xa' lo re xin'te'd Xa' nchab Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:18">—¿Cho xa' nak na mbez men?<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Le' re xa' mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:19">—Pla xaꞌ mbez lu nak Juan jwan' ngole men, pla xaꞌ mbez lu nak Elias, nde pla xaꞌ mbez lu nak thi profet ngo pola nde mbroꞌxban.<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">—Mbay goꞌ, ¿Cho na, ndyak go'?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Le' Pedr mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">—Lu nak Crist, Xa' jwan' mtelꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndej le' Xa' gaj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Per Jesus mnibe' lo re xin'te'd Xa', sa ngen cho lo gab xaꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />nde nchab Xa' lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:22">—Le' Xin' Mbi', nakinꞌ ridndaꞌb bro toz yalti nde reta men kotal men Xa', re xaꞌ gox jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ nde re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ, nde re maestr nchak ley, kuj xaꞌ Xa', per yaxob son wiz ryoꞌxban Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Nde nchab Jesus lo reta xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:23">—Tez cho goꞌ, nchola's tyonke xis na, bkalo go' lo re jwan' ndyen goꞌ li goꞌ, bta'ya' lazo' go' rid go' pen reta wiz xaja men ne' kruza nde ptonke goꞌ xis na. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Tak re xaꞌ ngenap lazon', xaꞌ ya che' ta'b xa' yalnaban xa', le' re xa' ta'ya' lazon' kwent chan' na, xaꞌ ya ligan yalnaban. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />¿Tak cho sinꞌ liy lo thi men, li men gan reta jwanꞌ lo izyo reꞌ, tez leꞌga leꞌ men ndyab men nde nge tolux men lazoꞌ men? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Tak tez cho goꞌ ndyolaꞌs kwent chan' na nde kwent chan' xki's na, noga Xin' Mbi' tyola's Xa' nye Xaꞌ go', senꞌ ye'd Xa' kon yalne chanꞌ Xa', kon yalne chan' Xud Xa', nde kon yalne chan' re anj nayon. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nde lipa nin lo goꞌ, nzo pla men jwanꞌ nzi ncheꞌ ya, nagajta xaꞌ axta kebe' wiꞌ xaꞌ xamod nak tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzyeꞌ nya Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Senꞌ ngok xonka wiz nchab Jesus jwanꞌ reꞌ, ngwa Jesus thi yek yiꞌ, sa todiꞌsno Jesus Dios, nde mbeꞌ Jesus Pedr, Juan nde Jakob. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Nde laj ndotodiꞌsno Jesus Dios, mzyeꞌ nya lo Jesus, nde xab Jesus anta nakis tir ngok nde anta ndlyabel nyay. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Nde mbroꞌto chop xaꞌ bi' ndotodiꞌsno xa' Jesus, rop xaꞌ ya nak Moises nde Elias, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />mzalꞌ xni ndlyabel xaꞌ, nde mdodiꞌs xaꞌ kwent chan' yalguj jwanꞌ nakla rid Jesus yez Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Nde Pedr, Juan nde Jakob, jwanꞌ toz ncho mkalꞌ lo xaꞌ, per mbrena xaꞌ, mbwiꞌ xaꞌ xni ndlyabel chanꞌ Jesus nde xni chan' rop xaꞌ jwanꞌ nzino Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Nde laj ndya rop xaꞌ ya, Pedr nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:33">—Maestr, ¡Wenka nzi náꞌ ncheꞌya! Sa toxkwaꞌ náꞌ son ramad; thiba kaa, thiba ka Moises nde thiba ka Elias.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:33">Per Pedr naꞌnyeda kwan li ta nchab Pedr. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Nde laj ndotodiꞌs Pedr, mbla thi xkow mkot reta xaꞌ, nde laj nzo xaꞌ lenꞌ xkow, mzyeb xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Nde lenꞌ xkowa mbyen thi diꞌs nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:35">—Xaꞌ reꞌ nak xinꞌ na, Xaꞌ jwanꞌ nkeꞌ toz lazo'n, bxoꞌbyek goꞌ Xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Senꞌ mne mbyen diꞌs ya, thib Jesus ndo. Nde ngen cho lo mdej xa' jwan' mbwi' xa' dib tyemp mkete Jesus lo izyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ntodan' thi mbyo nzo mbi narax nzo lazon'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Nde tedib wiz, senꞌ mbere xaꞌ yek yiꞌ, bro toz men mbyeꞌd wiꞌ lo Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Xij re men ya nzo ti xaꞌ biꞌ, ne mbres:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:38">—Maestr, nyaꞌb na loa, bwiꞌ xinꞌ na, tak thib nyar ngenon, <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />nde thi mbi narax ndyen or, ndliy mbezyaj or, ngobiy or izyo, nde ndryoꞌ psinꞌ ro or, ntotiy or nde naꞌlaꞌdey or. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mna'bla na lo re xin'te'd la sa koꞌte xaꞌ mbi narax nzo or, per naꞌndlid xaꞌ gan ndroꞌtey.<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Jesus mkab nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:41">—¡Goꞌ nak tib ned men nandlid lazon' Dios nde men xkap nak goꞌ! ¿Axta plopa nakinꞌ ketenon goꞌ, nde xek na goꞌ? Deꞌno xinꞌ la ncheꞌ ya.<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Laj ndo bike mbyo gax lo Jesus, mbli mbi narax ngobi mbyo izyo nde mtotiy mbyo; per Jesus mbrezno mbi naraxa, mtodanꞌ Jesus mbyo nde mda'ya' Jesus mbyo lo xud mbyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Nde reta men nzoyen xa', mbwiꞌ xa' yalnaro chanꞌ Dios.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jesus ndej tedib gob le' Xa' gaj</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Laj nzoyen re men re jwan' ndli Jesus, Jesus nchab lo re xin'te'd Xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />—Jwin bin goꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ nde naꞌyajtey yek goꞌ: Le' Xin' Mbi' tayaꞌ xa' Xa' lo re men sa kuj men Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Per naꞌngyenta xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ, tak teraꞌ taꞌ Dios lo xaꞌ, sa yen xaꞌy; nde nzyeb xaꞌ nyaꞌbdiꞌs xaꞌ kwan ta nchab Jesusa lo xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">¿Choꞌ xa' mas ntak?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Zyasa re xin'te'd Jesus tolo mbez xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ nyen' cho xa' mas ntak xij xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />per Jesus mnela cho xgab ndli xaꞌ. Zyasa mto Jesus thi or lud lo Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:48">—Cho xaꞌ wen ngwi' or lud reꞌ por len, xa' ya wen ngwi' xaꞌ na, nde xa' wen ngwi' na, xaꞌ ya wen ngwi' Xaꞌ jwanꞌ mtelꞌ na. Tak xaꞌ jwanꞌ mas lud ntak xij goꞌ, xaꞌ ya nak xa' mas ntak.<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xaꞌ nanixinta xis Jesus kon Jesus ndo xaꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Zyasa nchab Juan lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:49">—Maestr, mbwiꞌ náꞌ thi xaꞌ kon lea ngego'te mbi narax nzo lazo' men nde mka náꞌ di's li xaꞌy, tak nangeted xaꞌ kon naꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:50">—Naꞌkad goꞌ diꞌs li xaꞌy. Tak xaꞌ nanaraxta nye naꞌ, kon naꞌ ndo xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtokox Jakob nde Juan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Senꞌ ndosin gaxla wiz ndya Jesus lo beꞌ, mtoli xgab Xa' ya Xa' Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Mtelꞌ Xa' pla xaꞌ ndasiblo, sa ya kwan' xaꞌ yo tenꞌ kwed Jesus yez jwanꞌ nax lo xyon Samaria; <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />per re xaꞌ yez Samaria naꞌndaꞌd xaꞌ tenꞌ kwed Jesus, tak mne xaꞌ leꞌ Jesus nda Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Lo mne rop xa' nak xin'te'd Jesus Jakob kon Juan jwan' na, nchab xa' lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:54">—Xaꞌ nyebeꞌ, ¿Cho ncholaꞌs la nyaꞌb náꞌ, ryoꞌ ki lo beꞌ sa luxa reta xaꞌ, xa mbli profet Elias?<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Per Jesus mbyek mbwiꞌ lo xaꞌ nde mtokox Jesus xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:55">—Goꞌ ba naꞌnyed go' cho men nak goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Leꞌ Xin' Mbiꞌ nandeda sa lux Xaꞌ xbin men, leꞌ Xaꞌ nde sa tolaꞌ Xaꞌy.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:56">Nde nda re xaꞌ tediba yez.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchola's tyonke xis Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Laj ndo xaꞌ ned, thi xaꞌ biꞌ nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:57">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, na tonkyeꞌn xis la a ploja ndaa.<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:58">—Re mbeꞌd ngeno maꞌ len' ke tenꞌ ncho maꞌ nde re mbin ngeno maꞌ lye'd maꞌ, per Xin' Mbiꞌ na'ngenod Xa' liz Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Nde nchab Jesus lo tedib xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">—Ptonke xis na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Per xaꞌ ya mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, nerla pta' di's ngolo mkas na xud na.<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Jesus mkab nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:60">—Blaꞌ re xaꞌ nguja, ka's xa' tha'bol xa', le' lu wa tej xkiꞌs Dios lo re men.<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nde tediba' xaꞌ nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:61">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, na tyonkeꞌ xis la, per ptaꞌ diꞌs nerla nda tne ney lo re xaꞌ liz na.<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:62">—Thi men jwan' ngele yogon nde ngwi' xa' a lad xis xa', nalid sin' xa' ten' nyebe' Dios.<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesus mtelꞌ son gal nzo ziꞌ men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Lo senꞌ mne jwanꞌ reꞌ, Jesus mblí tedib son gal nzo siꞌ xaꞌ, jwan' mtelꞌ Jesus chop chopa xaꞌ, sa kwiblo xaꞌ lo Jesus, ya xaꞌ reta yez nde reta tenꞌ nkelo Jesus ya Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nde nchab Jesus lo xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:2">—Gal' di's nin lo goꞌ, bro toz jwan' ngok, per lud xaꞌ nge sinꞌ lo neꞌy. Jwanꞌ nasa mna'b goꞌ lo xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ neꞌy sa telꞌ xaꞌ masra' men ke sin' lo jwan' ngok. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Naya wa goꞌ, nde bwiꞌ goꞌ nea, na ngetelꞌ goꞌ xaja mbakxilꞌ yenꞌ xij mbak be. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Nde naꞌwed goꞌ bed, naꞌwed goꞌ tmi, naꞌwed goꞌ tedib ned yayid goꞌ, nde naꞌyatod goꞌ todiꞌsno goꞌ men zyalꞌ goꞌ ned. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Senꞌ sin go' thi liz men, nerla mni goꞌ dyux lo xaꞌ, gus goꞌ: "Yalnabe'z chan' Dios xyo'b xis re men liz go'." <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nde tez yo ya nzo xaꞌ nabeꞌz nak, yalnabe'z ta ndano go' ya yanꞌ na lo xaꞌ, per tez nanabeꞌzta nak xaꞌ, bere yalnabe'z go' lo go'. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Nde byanꞌ goꞌ yo ya, wa goꞌ nde gu goꞌ jwanꞌ kwek xaꞌ lo goꞌ, tak xaꞌ nke sinꞌ ndablo yax ka xaꞌ. Nde na'yanta goꞌ xa'xa' liz men. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Senꞌ sin goꞌ thi yez tenꞌ wen nak xaꞌ lo goꞌ, bda goꞌ jwanꞌ kwek xaꞌ lo goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Btodanꞌ goꞌ re men nayiz nzo yez ya nde gus goꞌ lo xaꞌ: "Le' yalnyebe' chan' Dios ndo sin gaxla lo goꞌ." <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Per tez sin goꞌ thi yez tenꞌ na'tonzad xa' go', broꞌte goꞌ re ro ned ro nde gus goꞌ: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />"Axta re yothi' yez goꞌ, jwanꞌ mke lad ni náꞌ, zib náꞌy sa go'jka mne, per wi' go' nea, leꞌ yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios mzin gaxla lo goꞌ." <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Lipa' nin lo goꞌ senꞌ sin wiz nyaꞌb Dios kwent lo men, zyasa mas naro yalti par re xaꞌ yez reꞌ, ke par re xaꞌ yez Sodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwanꞌ yate re yez nandla'd jwanꞌ narax</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Nde nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:13">—¡Nalat toz yate goꞌ men yez Corazin! ¡Nalat toz yate goꞌ men yez Betsaida! Tak tez lo yez Tiro nde lo yez Sidon ngak re yalnaro ta ngok xij go' re', ne' pola ndlaꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ narax ndli xaꞌ nde ngok xaꞌ lar nabaꞌd nde ndob xaꞌ lo di lo ki sa loꞌ mzyeꞌ xgab xaꞌ lo Dios. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Jwanꞌ na senꞌ sin wiz nyaꞌb Dios kwent lo re men, mas naro toz nak yalti rid re goꞌ, ke re yalti rid re xaꞌ yez Tiro nde re xaꞌ yez Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nde goꞌ men yez Capernaum, ¿Cho ndyak goꞌ na axta lo beꞌ xap Dios goꞌ? ¡Nakte, le' goꞌ yatu axta lo bel adi'!<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Xaꞌ ntobnza xki's go', xaꞌ ya ntobnza xkiꞌs na nde xaꞌ jwan' ngotal go', xa' ya ngotal na nde ngotal xaꞌ Xaꞌ mtelꞌ na.<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbere re son gal nzo siꞌ xaꞌ ta mtelꞌ Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Senꞌ mbere re son gal nzo siꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ mtelꞌ Jesus, nale toz nzo lazoꞌ xaꞌ nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:17">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, axta re mbi narax nxobyeka ná' lo ndej ná' lea.<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:18">—Mbwiꞌn maxuꞌ ngob lo beꞌ xaja thi mdi'ba. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Nde na ta yalne lo goꞌ sa tyobni goꞌ xis mbelꞌ nde xis mxub, nde xis re yalne chanꞌ re mbi narax, nde ngen kwan linoy goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Per naꞌkonaled lazoꞌ goꞌ kwent nxoꞌbyek re mbi narax goꞌ, cheꞌla blo nale lazoꞌ goꞌ tak nzola le goꞌ lo beꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nale nzo lazoꞌ Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Zyasa hor yaga Mbi Nayon mbli ngo nale lazoꞌ Jesús, nde nchab Jesús:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:21">—Tan dyux loa, Xud na, lu jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ lo beꞌ nde lo izyo, tak mkaꞌs la jwanꞌ reꞌ lo re xaꞌ nchak nde lo re xaꞌ nchen, nde mbloꞌ lay lo re xaꞌ nak xaja or bix, tamod mbli lay Xud na, tak ta ncholaꞌs la aka.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Tak Xud na mdaꞌ reta jwan' lon. Ngen cho nzolo cho nak Xin' Xa', benꞌta Xud Xa' mney, nde ngen cho nzolo cho nak Xud Xa', benꞌta Xin' Xa' mney, nde Xin' Xa' teja lo men jwanꞌ nchola's Xin' Xa' tej Xa'y. <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Zyasa xata nchab Jesus lo re xin'te'd xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:23">—Nabe'z toz nda re men jwan' ngwi' re jwan' ngwi' go', <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />tak lipa nin lo goꞌ, naꞌr toz profet nde nar toz xaꞌ ngok rey mda'bla's xaꞌ ngwiꞌ xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ ta ndowiꞌ goꞌ nde nangwiꞌd xaꞌy, mda'bla's xaꞌ ngon xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ ta nchon goꞌ, nde naꞌngonta xaꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi xaꞌ yez Samaria wen toz nak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Zyasa thi maestr nchak ley xkiꞌs Dios, ngwa lo Jesus, nde mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ, sa libe' xaꞌ Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:25">—Maestr, ¿kwan ndablo lin sa kenon yalnaban adiꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:26">—¿Cho kwan ngeni ley chan' Moises? ¿Cho kwan ndlab la?<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Zyasa leꞌ maestr nchak ley xkis Dios mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:27">—"Bkeꞌ lazoꞌa Dios Xa' Nyebeꞌ loa dib nzo lazoꞌa, kon dib yalnaban chanꞌ la, kon dib yalne chanꞌ la, nde kon dib xgab la, nde bkeꞌ lazoa ta men la xajka nkeꞌ lazoꞌa leꞌga lu."<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Leꞌ Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:28">—Wen mkab la, bli re jwanꞌ reꞌ, kenoa yalnaban adiꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Per maestr nchak ley xkiꞌs Dios, ndyak xa' galꞌ ndo xa' nde nchab xa' lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:29">—¿Cho nak ta men na sa?<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:30">—Thi mbiꞌ mbroꞌ yez Jerusalen ndala nda yez Jerico, nde mbroꞌ pla wanꞌ lo xaꞌ ned, mkib wanꞌ reta chanꞌ xa', axta xab xa' mkib wan', mdin wan' xaꞌ, tawen xa' xajaꞌ men nguja xa' mbla' wan' xa' nde nda re wan'. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Nde leꞌga ned ya ndarid thi nglweyꞌ, senꞌ mbwiꞌ nglweyꞌ nax xaꞌ ya tya, che' mbri'd nglweyꞌ tedib lad ro ned nde nda nglwey'. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Nde ned yaga' mbriꞌdndab tiba xaꞌ nak nak sin' lo yodo', nde senꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ nax xaꞌ ya, taga' benꞌta mbwiꞌ xaꞌ lo xaꞌ che' mbyek xa' thib lad ro ned nde nda xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Per thi xaꞌ yez Samaria ndarid ned yaga' nde senꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ nax mbi' ya, mblat lazoꞌ xaꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Mbike xaꞌ gax lo mbi', nde mtombi xaꞌ lad mbi', mblo xa' aseyt kon bina. Nde mchal xaꞌ lar lad mbi' tenꞌ nawiꞌ ya, zyaga mxap xaꞌ mbi' xis bur xaꞌ nde mbeꞌ xaꞌ xaꞌ thi yo tenꞌ mbed men nde mkenap xaꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Tedib wiz senꞌ mbroꞌ xaꞌ nda xaꞌ, mdaꞌ xaꞌ chop tmi plata lo xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ yo nde nchab xaꞌ: "Bkenap mbiꞌ reꞌ, nde tez masra' mbro'to jwan' mbli goꞌ, na yixa lo goꞌ senꞌ beren." <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo maestr nchak ley:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:36">—¿Xa nya re yon xaꞌ reꞌ ngok ta men xaꞌ, tá mbro' wan' lon' ya?<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Zyasa maestr nchak ley nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">—Xaꞌ jwanꞌ mblat lazonꞌ mbi' ya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">—Bya nde tagaꞌ bli.<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ngwa tna Mart nde Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Laja ndo Jesus ned, mzin Jesus thi yez lud, tya nzo thi ngol ndole Mart, ngol ya mdaꞌ liz naꞌ mbled Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Nde Mart ngeno thi bel naꞌ ndole Mari, nde Mari mdob lo Jesus ndoyon reta jwanꞌ ndej Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Per Mart, mas mbix rsin' naꞌ, zyasa nchab Mart lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:40">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, ¿Cho nandlit la xgab ta mbla' bel na na thib na lo sinꞌ? Gus lo xa' sa ta' ya' xa' lon.<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Per Jesus mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:41">—Sib la Mart, jwanꞌ toz ndlia xgab nde mbix la rsinꞌ la, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />per nzo thita jwanꞌ mas nakinꞌ nde Mari mblí jwanꞌ na, nde ngen cho kiba lo xa'.<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jesus ndloꞌ xamod todiꞌsno men Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Thib wiz Jesus ndo thi ten' ndotodiꞌsno Xa' Dios, nde senꞌ mne mdodiꞌsno Xa' Dios, thi xin'te'd Xa' nchab lo Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:1">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, bloꞌ lo náꞌ xamod todiꞌsno náꞌ Dios, ta xa mbloꞌ Juan lo re xin'te'd Juan.<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">—Senꞌ todiꞌsno goꞌ Dios, gab goꞌ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Xud náꞌ Dios, jwanꞌ ndob lo beꞌ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">nayon nak lea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Yeꞌd yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Nde bli xa ncholaꞌs la, ta xa ndlia lo beꞌ, tagaꞌ bli lo izyo reꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Jwanꞌ nak la' náꞌ re wiz, bta'y na wiz.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Pton' reta xken náꞌ, tak no náꞌ ntori'd ná' yek náꞌ re jwanꞌ narax ndli men lo náꞌ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Nde nalayat la náꞌ li náꞌ re jwanꞌ narax.<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Nde noga' nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:5">—Tez nzo thi goꞌ ngeno thi amig naꞌ, nde rol yalꞌ nda go' liz xaꞌ, nde gab go' lo xaꞌ: "Pkwan' son pan kan, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />tak thi amig na jwan' nde tij mzin liz na, nde ngen kwan ngenon tan wa xaꞌ." <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Nde amig ya lenꞌ lizta xaꞌ kab xaꞌ: "Naꞌtyodoꞌd la lon, nowꞌla ro liz na nde re xinꞌ ná' naxla, naꞌgakta yochen tan pan loa." <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Na ni lo go', te'nyega nak xa' amig xa', pa yache xa', sa taꞌ xaꞌ pan lo amig xaꞌ, per lo tibla' ndobez amig lo xaꞌ, tache xaꞌ ta' xa' reta jwanꞌ nakinꞌ amig xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Jwanꞌ nasa nin lo goꞌ: Mna'b go'y de kaya' go'y, pkwan' goꞌy nde tasal goꞌy, brez goꞌ xis yala, nde txalꞌla lo goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Tak xaꞌ jwan' nyaꞌba, nkayaꞌ xaꞌy, nde xaꞌ nkwanꞌ na nchasal xaꞌy, nde xaꞌ mbez xis yala, nxyalꞌla lo xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />¿Cho thi go' ba jwan' nak xud mdyen', tez nyaꞌb or thi pan lo go', cho thi ke taꞌ goꞌ lo or? ¿o tez thi xin' go' nyaꞌb thi mbel lo goꞌ, cho thi mbelꞌ ta go' lo or? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />¿O tez nyaꞌb or thi ngo lo goꞌ, cho thi mxub ta' go' lo or? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Mbay goꞌ, teꞌnye narax nak goꞌ, nchak ndaꞌ goꞌ jwanꞌ wen lo xinꞌ goꞌ, plopa mas Xud naꞌ ndob lo beꞌ, taꞌ Xaꞌ Mbi Nayon chanꞌ Xaꞌ lo men jwanꞌ nyaꞌba lo Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni xin men xis Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Jesus ngegoꞌte thi mbi narax jwanꞌ ndli sa na'akta todi's thi xaꞌ biꞌ, nde senꞌ mbroꞌte mbi narax mbiꞌ ya, mdobte mdodi's xaꞌ, nde reta men leꞌka nzoyen xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Per pla xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:15">—Mbi' re'ya ngo'te re mbi narax por yalne chan' Beelzebu, xa' jwan' nyebe' lo reta mbi narax.<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Nde thi pla xaꞌ nchola's li beꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, nyaꞌb xaꞌ li Jesus thi yalnaro jwanꞌ ryoꞌ lo beꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Per Jesus mnela cho xgab ndli xaꞌ, nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:17">—Reta xaꞌ nyebeꞌ jwanꞌ nchak rol nde ngyo xaꞌ leꞌga ta xaꞌ, tlayo xa', nde men nchak rol leꞌga lenꞌ liz men nde ngyo men, tlayo men. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Taga re mbi narax chan' maxu' tez yo xa' le'ga ta xa'. ¿Xamod yobe yalnyebe' chanꞌ maxu' sa? Jwanꞌ reꞌ nin lo goꞌ, tak mbez goꞌ ke na ngote mbi narax por yalne chanꞌ Beelzebu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Per tez liga kon yalne chan' Beelzebu ngoten re mbi narax, ¿cho ndaꞌ yalne lo re xin'te'd goꞌ, par kote xaꞌ mbi narax? Jwanꞌ nasa leꞌga xin'te'd goꞌ mne narax ndo goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Per tez na ngote mbi narax por yalne chanꞌ Dios, jwanꞌ na ndloꞌ, le' yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios mzinla lo goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Senꞌ thi xaꞌ ne lazonꞌ thibla' ndenza' xa' yi'b nke' men byo nde ngenap xaꞌ re chanꞌ xa' jwan' nzo tsa' liz xaꞌ, zyasa re jwanꞌ ngeno xaꞌ ngenkwan tyaka.<verse eid="LUK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Per tez nde tedib xaꞌ mas ne lo xa' ya, li xaꞌ gan lo xa', kib xaꞌ re yib xa' jwan' tá nda' yalne lo xa' ya, nde kiꞌd xaꞌ jwan' mkib xa'.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Xaꞌ jwanꞌ na'ndoda kon na, xaꞌ ya narax nye xaꞌ na, nde xaꞌ jwanꞌ nanthopta men par na, xaꞌ ya cheꞌ nchaꞌs xaꞌ men na.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Senꞌ mbere mbi narax</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Senꞌ ndryoꞌte mbi narax nzo lazo' thi men, ndaketey re tenꞌ nabis, nda kwanꞌ na tenꞌ ryoꞌxkwen na, per senꞌ na'yasaltey tenꞌ ryoxkwen na, zyasa ndliy xgab: "Beren liz na tenꞌ mbroꞌn." <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Nde senꞌ mzina, nzyala men ya, xaja thi yo mblyoba nde nawe nya. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Zyasa nday nde nthopa thi gaz mbi mas natin ke mbi narax ya, nde ndlya rey lazo' men ya, nde mas narax ngote men ya ke jwan' mxak ner xa'.<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Re xa' jwan' liga nabe'z toz nda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Laja ndotej Jesus re jwanꞌ reꞌ, thi ngol nzo xij re men ya ne mbrez xa', nchab xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:27">—¡Nabe'z toz nda ngol jwanꞌ mxan la nde mdaꞌ nis nguꞌa! <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:28">—¡Mas nabe'z toz nda re xaꞌ nchon xkiꞌs Dios nde nxobyek xaꞌy!<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Re men xkap nyaꞌb li Jesus thi yalnaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Senꞌ masra' ndo ndop men lo Jesus, zyasa mdobte nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:29">—Reta men nzo na tyemp reꞌ, men xkap xaꞌ nde nyaꞌb xaꞌ thi yalnaro wiꞌ xaꞌ, per ngentra' cho yalnaro wiꞌ xaꞌ benꞌta yalnaro chan' Jonas wiꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Xa yalnaro jwan' ngok lo Jonas, mbli sa re men yez Ninive mbli lazo' xa' ke Dios mtel' Jonas, thi yalnaro yaga' lo'n sa lo' ke Dios mtel' na. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Per wiz senꞌ nyaꞌb Dios kwent lo re men nzo na tyemp reꞌ, zyasa ryo'to ngol ngok rey lo yez Saba, nde ngol ya tej reta jwanꞌ narax mbli re men nzo naya, tak tij toz mbroꞌ ngol sa gon ngol yalnchak chan' rey Salomon, nde naya, lo go' ndo thi Xa' mas ntak lo rey Salomon. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Nde taga' ryo'to re men yez Ninibe, wiz senꞌ nyaꞌb Dios kwent lo re men nzi naya, nde re xaꞌ ya tej reta jwanꞌ narax mbli re men nzi naya, tak re men yez Ninibe mxobyek xaꞌ Jonas nde mblaꞌ xaꞌ re jwanꞌ narax nak xaꞌ nde mbli lazoꞌ xaꞌ Dios, nde naya, lo go' ndo thi Xa' mas ntak lo Jonas.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwan' ntoxni lo men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Ngen cho ntob ki ti kandil nde nka'slo xa'y, o ngo xa'y xanꞌ xibe', cheꞌla gap ntob xaꞌy, sa toxniy lo re men nchote lenꞌ yo. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ngudlo men nak xaja thi xni lo diben men, tez wen ngudloa, nawe nchoxni loa, per tez nayiz ngudloa, diben la ndo yalꞌkow. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ndawiꞌ toz la sa xnita ntoxni loa ba naꞌaktey yalꞌkow. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Jwan' nasa tez diben la nawe ndo lo xniy, ngenta nek lud yal'kowa, reta jwanꞌ nawe wiꞌa, xaja ti kandil nawe ntoxni ba.<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ntobeꞌ yek re xaꞌ fariseo nde re maestr nchak ley</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Senꞌ mne mdodiꞌs Jesus, thi xaꞌ fariseo mna'b xa' lo Jesus sa wa Jesus liz xaꞌ, zyasa ngwa Jesus liz xaꞌ nde ngote Jesus mdob Jesus ro mes. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Zyasa xaꞌ fariseo nzoyen xaꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ tak naꞌnad Jesus xa nak mod ngeno xaꞌ sen' ncha xa'. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Per Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:39">—Re goꞌ men fariseo ben'ta xis bas nde xis yen ntach goꞌ, per lenꞌ lazo' go' se nzo re xgab xkap, nde yalwanꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />¡Ne yek go'! ¿Cho naꞌnyed goꞌ Xaꞌ jwanꞌ mdoxkwaꞌ lad xis, Xaꞌ yaga' mdoxkwaꞌ lad lenꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ptaꞌ goꞌ gon lo xaꞌ prob lo re jwanꞌ ngeno goꞌ, tamod sa yanꞌ nambi goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />¡Per nalat tyak goꞌ xaꞌ fariseo! tak ndaꞌ goꞌ dyezmo chanꞌ pthyon, chanꞌ rud, nde chan' re lo yeꞌd, per nandlid goꞌ re jwanꞌ galꞌ nde nankeꞌd lazoꞌ go' xa ndli Dios. Jwanꞌ re ndablo li goꞌ nde nalaꞌd goꞌ li goꞌ temasa.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />¡Nalat nya goꞌ xaꞌ fariseo! tak ndyen goꞌ tyob goꞌ lo re yasil nzi axta lo, lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel nde ncholaꞌs goꞌ, ni men dyux lo goꞌ lo xbiꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />¡Nalat nya goꞌ xaꞌ fariseo nde maestr nchak ley, makwinꞌ, tak nak goꞌ xaja baꞌ nandlod nax nde ana'nye men ndyop ni men xis neꞌy! <verse eid="LUK 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Zya mkab thi maestr nchak ley, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:45">—Maestr, no náꞌ nchaꞌd re diꞌs ta mbez la.<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Per Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:46">—¡Taga' nalat nya goꞌ, maestr nchak ley!, tak cho kwan liy sa nyebe' go' li men thi jwan' na'lid men gan li men, nde go' nek lud na'ndlastod go' xa'.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />¡Nalat nya goꞌ! tak ndoxkwaꞌ goꞌ xna xis banꞌ profet, jwanꞌ mbij leꞌga leꞌ re xaꞌ gox lo bin tenꞌ nde goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Jwanꞌ reꞌ ndloꞌ ke ndyen goꞌ re jwanꞌ mbli re xaꞌ gox lo bin tenꞌ nde goꞌ, tak xa' mbij re profet nde goꞌ mtoxkwaꞌ banꞌ profet.<verse eid="LUK 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Jwanꞌ nasa yalchak chanꞌ Dios nchab: "Telꞌ na profet nde apost, pla xaꞌ kuj goꞌ nde pla xaꞌ chu'bla goꞌ." <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Per Dios nyaꞌb kwent lo re xaꞌ nzi naya, lo ta mbij xa' re profet axta senꞌ mdoxkwa izyo, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />xata mbij xa' Abel axta Zacarias, xa' jwan' mbij goꞌ xlaj tenꞌ ntolꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ yon nde tenꞌ nayon lenꞌ yodoꞌ. Jwanꞌ na nin lo goꞌ, Dios nyaꞌb kwent chanꞌ ren re xaꞌ ya lo men nzi naya.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />¡Nalat nya goꞌ, maestr nchak ley!, tak nka goꞌ di's yolo men Dios, per le'ga go' mtow' go' ned lo go', nde taga' mtow' go' ned lo re men nchola's yolo Dios.<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Senꞌ mne nchab Jesus re jwanꞌ reꞌ, zyasa re maestr nchak ley nde re fariseo jwanꞌ toz mxi lazoꞌ xaꞌ, nde mdobte masraꞌ mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />ncholaꞌs xaꞌ ni Jesus pla diꞌs jwanꞌ nandabloda ni Jesus, sa zyal xa' yalke ke' xa' yek Jesús.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Jesus ndloꞌ kenap lazoꞌ men lo re xaꞌ kwinꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Laja mdyop por mil men lo Jesus, lo taja bro toz men anta ngaꞌs ta men. Jesus mdobte mni, nerla lo re xin'te'd Jesus, nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:1">—Pkenap lazoꞌ goꞌ lo re jwanꞌ ndloꞌ re xaꞌ fariseo, tak nandlid xa' jwan' ndlo' xa'. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Tak na'ngenta jwanꞌ nzo nagaꞌs, naꞌloda, nde ngenta thi jwanꞌ nkaꞌs men, naꞌryoꞌxo'bta. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Jwanꞌ nasa reta jwan' nagaꞌsta ndyodiꞌs goꞌ, le'y tonka men, nde reta jwanꞌ mdodiꞌs rslyanꞌ goꞌ lo nzo now'yo go', axta gap yek yo kwez men koxo'b mena.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cho ndablo syeb men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Le na ni lo goꞌ, amig na, na'zyebta goꞌ re xaꞌ nguj men, tak senꞌ mne mbij xaꞌ men, ngentraꞌ kwan mas ak li xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Per naya nin lo goꞌ cho ndablo seb lazoꞌ goꞌ: Pseb lazoꞌ goꞌ Xaꞌ jwanꞌ tak kib yalnaban, nde ngeno Xaꞌ yalne ko xaꞌ men lo bel. Xaꞌ ya pseb lazoꞌ goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />¿Cho nakta gay' mbyin ntak chop tmi bix? Per Dios nanchajta yek na' nek thib mbyina. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Nde tagaꞌ go', axta re yis yek go' nagaba lo Dios. Jwanꞌ nasa nazyebta goꞌ, tak mas ntak goꞌ ke re mbyina.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xa' jwanꞌ gab nzolo xa' na lo men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Nipa na lo goꞌ, reta men jwanꞌ gab, nzolo xaꞌ na lo re men, taga' na Xin' Mbi' gab na lo re anj chanꞌ Dios, ke nzolon xa'. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Per men jwanꞌ gab na nanzolod xaꞌ na lo re men, noga na gab nanzolod na xaꞌ lo re anj chan' Dios.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Nde choja xaꞌ jwanꞌ ni xis Xin' Mbi', tonꞌ Dios xken xaꞌ, per xaꞌ nixin xis Mbi Nayon chanꞌ Dios, naꞌtonꞌta Dios xken xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Nde senꞌ we xaꞌ goꞌ lo re men lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, o lo re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re yez nde lo re xaꞌ ngeno yalnyebeꞌ ro, naꞌlid goꞌ xgab xamod gab goꞌ lo xaꞌ o xamod kab goꞌ lo xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />tak senꞌ sin hor ni goꞌ lo xaꞌ, zyasa Mbi Nayon chanꞌ Dios lo' lo goꞌ xamod kab goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xaꞌ rik ngenta xgab yek naꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Zyasa thi xaꞌ biꞌ nzo xij men toza nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:13">—Maestr, gus lo wes na sa li rol xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngok chanꞌ xud ná' nde taꞌ xaꞌ jwan' ndinꞌ na.<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:14">—Mbiꞌ, ¿Cho mtob na sa ak na juez o xaꞌ lirol jwanꞌ mtan' xud goꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Nogaꞌ nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:15">—Ndawiꞌ toz goꞌ nde bkenap lazoꞌ goꞌ lo re yaltabla's, tak yalnaban chan' men nandede lo re jwanꞌ toz ngeno men.<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Zyasa mdaꞌ Jesus thi kwent, nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:16">—Ngo thi xaꞌ rik, lo izyon xa' ngok bro toz tir jwan'. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Nde mbli xaꞌ xgab: "¿Kwan lin naya? Nangenot na tenꞌ gosaꞌn reta jwanꞌ ngok." <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Zyasa mbli xaꞌ xgab: "Mnea na kwan lin. Sil na re ló ngenon, nde toxkwan thi pla ló mas naro, sa tya gosaꞌn reta jwanꞌ ngok nde reta jwanꞌ ngenon. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Zyasa gab na lo lazoꞌn: Bro toz jwanꞌ ngenoa tala waa naꞌr linꞌ, naya broꞌxkwen, bda nde guꞌ nit, nde blo nale lazoꞌa." <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Per Dios nchab lo xaꞌ: "Mbiꞌ neyek, na yalꞌ reꞌ gaj la, nde reta jwanꞌ mblosaꞌa, ¿cho chanꞌ aka?" <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Tamod nchate xaꞌ ta ngosaꞌ bro jwanꞌ par le'ga xa' lo izyo reꞌ, per lo Dios ngen kwan ngeno xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dios nkenap xinꞌ Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Xisa nchab Jesus lo re xin'te'd Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:22">—Naya nin lo goꞌ, naꞌlid goꞌ xgab por re jwanꞌ wa goꞌ, neka li goꞌ xgab ma lar gok goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Tak yalnaban chanꞌ goꞌ mas ntak ke jwanꞌ ncha go', nde goꞌ mas ntak ke lar nchok go'. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Jwin bli goꞌ xgab xa re mbyaka, nangod maꞌ bin, neka nthop maꞌ kosech, neka ngeno maꞌ tenꞌ nchosaꞌ kosech ma', per Dios ndaꞌ jwanꞌ ncha maꞌ. ¡Plopa mas ntak goꞌ ke re mbina! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />¿Nde cho ti goꞌ ba li gan xyen tud, lo ndli toz goꞌ xgab? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Tez akta li go' nekla thi jwan' lud, ¿Kwan ndliy sa ndli goꞌ xgab temas re jwanꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Jwin bwiꞌ goꞌ xa nxyen re yeꞌ ba, nankedey sinꞌ, nantoxkwadey xab neꞌy, nde na nin lo goꞌ neka rey Salomon nangokxabta xa' xaja nya re yeꞌ ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Nde tez Dios ta ngok xab re ye' nzo wan, jwanꞌ naya nzoy yeꞌ mbiza, nde yola. ¡Chole'ta go' plopa jwan' ta' Dios lo go', per goꞌ lud ndli lazo' go' Dios! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Jwanꞌ nasa nin lo goꞌ, nalid goꞌ xgab jwanꞌ wa goꞌ nde jwanꞌ gok goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Tak reta jwanꞌ reꞌ nak xgab lo men lo izyo reꞌya, per Xud goꞌ ndob lo beꞌ mnela Xaꞌ re jwanꞌ nakinꞌ goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Per nerla pkwanꞌ goꞌ yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios nde xamod gal' ak goꞌ lo Dios, zyasa Dios taꞌ reta jwanꞌ na lo goꞌ<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwan' ntak nzo lo beꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Naꞌzyebta goꞌ, mbakxilꞌ bix na, per Xud goꞌ ndob lo beꞌ, mblila Xaꞌ xgab taꞌ Xaꞌ yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Xaꞌ lo goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Jwanꞌ nasa ptho goꞌ re jwanꞌ ngeno goꞌ, nde pta' goꞌy lo re xaꞌ nakinꞌ na, tamod ndogosaꞌ goꞌ jwanꞌ ntak toz lenꞌ thi bed jwanꞌ nandluxta, lo beꞌ tenꞌ nandlyad wanꞌ nde nanchad mbexa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Tak tenꞌ ngeno goꞌ bro jwanꞌ ntak, tya ndob lazo' goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndablo tyosa' men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Ptosa' go', gok xab go' nde thibla tyob ki kandil goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Nde gok goꞌ xaja thi mos, jwanꞌ ngembed bere xwan' naꞌ, jwan' ngwa lo yalselyaꞌ, ngembedla xaꞌ xalꞌ xaꞌ ro yo senꞌ kwes xwan' xa' xis yala. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Nabeꞌz toz nda re mos ya, senꞌ sin xwan' xaꞌ, nzina xaꞌ. Nipa na lo goꞌ, leꞌga leꞌ xwan' mos nyebeꞌ tyob mos ro mes nde ko xaꞌ jwanꞌ wa mos. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Re mos ya nabeꞌz nda xaꞌ, tez tenye rol yalꞌ o nda tuxni nzina xaꞌ senꞌ sin xwan' xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Nde ndablo nye goꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ, tez thi xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ yo, mne xaꞌ cho hor lya xaꞌ wanꞌ liz xaꞌ, pa laꞌ xaꞌ liz xaꞌ lya wanꞌ, sa we wanꞌ chanꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Taga' goꞌ, ptosa' go', tak Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ yeꞌd senꞌ nandlid goꞌ xgab sin Xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi mos wen nde thi mos narax</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Pedr lo Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:41">—Xaꞌ nyebeꞌ, ¿cho ben'ta lo ná' ndej la kwent reꞌ o lo reta mena?<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:42">—¿Cho nak mos tiblaꞌ ndo nde nzo xgab yek naꞌ? Lo mos ya tanꞌno xaꞌ nyebeꞌ re men liz xaꞌ, sa taꞌ mos jwanꞌ ndin' re men liz xa' wa xa' sen' nchal hor wa xa'. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Nabe'z toz nda mos ya, sen' lo bere xa' nyebe' lo mos, yosal xa' mos ngeli mos jwan' mtan'no xa' mos. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Nipa na lo goꞌ, leꞌ xwan' mos ya tob xaꞌ mos kenap mos reta jwanꞌ ngeno xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Per tez mos ya, ndli xgab sowꞌra sin xwan' na nde tyobte mos kin mos, mos bi nde mos got nde tyobte mos wa mos, gu mos nit nde tyus mos. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Nde wiz senꞌ nandlid mos xgab zin xwan' mos, nde hor jwanꞌ nangembeta mos zin xaꞌ, zyasa jwan' toz ta'pen xa' mos nde ko xaꞌ mos tenꞌ nzo re xaꞌ nandlid lazon' Dios.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Per mos jwanꞌ mnela jwanꞌ ncholaꞌs xwan' mos, nde nandosa'd mos neka nxobyek mos xwan' mos, mos ya, leꞌka kin toz xaꞌ mos. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Per mos jwanꞌ namneda jwanꞌ ncholaꞌs xwan' mos, nde mbli mos jwanꞌ narax, mos ya mas lud kin xaꞌ. Nde mos jwanꞌ mdaꞌ xwan' mos bro yalnyebeꞌ lo mos, mos ya, mas bro kwent nyaꞌb xwan' mos lo mos, nde mos jwanꞌ mtanꞌ xaꞌ bro jwanꞌ lonꞌ, mas bro jwanꞌ nyaꞌb xaꞌ lo mos ya.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ Jesus ak rol men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:49">—Na ndal, sa tob na ki izyo, ¡Nde axta ndya'bla's na ya ndoyola izyo! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Per nerla rid na thi yalti toz, ¡Nde jwanꞌ toz ncho nabil lazoꞌn axta kebeꞌ ri'd na yalti ya! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />¿Cho ndyak goꞌ yalnabeꞌz ndalnon lo izyo reꞌ? Nandalnot na yalnabeꞌz, cheꞌla leꞌn ndal sa ak rol men. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Tak xata naya tyobte ak rol men, thi liz men nzo gayꞌ xa', son xaꞌ yo kon chop xaꞌ nde chop xaꞌ yo kon son xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Xud mdyenꞌ yo kon mdyenꞌ nde mdyenꞌ yo kon Xud mdyenꞌ, xnaꞌ mdyenꞌ yo kon mdyen got nde mdyenꞌ got yo kon xnaꞌ mdyenꞌ, xnaꞌyiꞌ ngol yo kon ngol, nde ngol yo kon xnaꞌyiꞌ ngol.<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Li be' men tyemp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Nde nchab Jesus lo reta men:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 12:54">—Senꞌ ngwiꞌ goꞌ ndeke xkow lad ned ncha'd wiz, mbez goꞌ: "yi lya", nde ndlyaga yi. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Nde senꞌ nzyoꞌb mbi lad la, mbez goꞌ: "ak nasoꞌ " nde nchak nasoꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />¡Makwin'! Nchak ntakbeꞌ goꞌ jwanꞌ lo beꞌ nde jwan' lo izyo. ¿Nde nanchakta ntakbeꞌ goꞌ tyemp nzo goꞌ naya?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bsalꞌdiꞌs kon xa' ndebeyonoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />¿Kwandliy xanaꞌ leꞌga goꞌ koxyo goꞌ kwan nak jwanꞌ galꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Tez xaꞌ jwan' ndebeyonoa mbeꞌ xaꞌ la yolow, laja ndo rop goꞌ ned, pken bsalꞌdiꞌs rop goꞌ xaꞌ, sa naꞌtayaꞌd xaꞌ la lo juez. Nde tez naꞌtad lia, leꞌ juez taꞌyaꞌa lo xa' nak sin' nde xa' nak sin' na keꞌ xaꞌ la lizyiꞌb. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nde nipa na loa, naꞌryoꞌted la tya axta kebeꞌ kix la re nak jwanꞌ ndaꞌb la.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">La' men jwan' narax o lux men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Len' wiz ya ngwa pla men lo Jesus, ngwatej xa' xamod mnabe' Pilat, mbij xa' pla xaꞌ lo xyon Galilea nde mkos xa' ren men ya kon ren maꞌ jwanꞌ mbij xaꞌ mda' xa' yon lo Dios. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:2">—¿Cho ndli goꞌ xgab jwanꞌ reꞌ ngote xaꞌ Galilea, tak mas nzoꞌb xken xaꞌ lo temas men las xaꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Na ni lo goꞌ, naktey, noga' goꞌ tez naꞌlad goꞌ jwanꞌ narax ndli go' nde naꞌzed goꞌ xgab go', no go' taga' lux go'. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />¿O ndyak go' re sinꞌ son men jwanꞌ nguj, senꞌ ngob yo gap toz tir ndab ta ndob yez Siloe, mas nchap xaꞌ yalke ke re xaꞌ nzo yez Jerusalen? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Na ni lo goꞌ, naktey, noga' go' tez naꞌlad goꞌ jwanꞌ narax ndli goꞌ nde naꞌzed go' xgab goꞌ, no go' taga' lux go'.<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ ya hig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Zyasa Jesus mdej thi kwent nagan lo re men, nchab Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:6">—Thi mbi' ngeno bin thi ya hig ten' nzobin lus ub xa', ngwa wiꞌ xaꞌ lo ya nyenꞌ cho ndo nguda, nde naꞌngazalta xa' nek thib ngud lo ne'y. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ lo xaꞌ ta ngenap lus uba: ꞌꞌWi' nea, ndala son linꞌ, tibla' nchakwan na ngud lo ya hig, per nek thib gob naꞌngasalta na ngud lo ne'y. Maska pchoꞌy; tak benꞌta nale ndoba.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Per xaꞌ ngenap izyo ya nchab: ꞌꞌXaꞌ nyebeꞌ, blaꞌ go'y linꞌ reꞌta, sa toleꞌn yo xanꞌ neꞌy nde gon beꞌba. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Taꞌda taꞌy ngud, per tez naꞌtaꞌdey ngud, zyasa choꞌ lay.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ntodan' thi ngol len' wiz ndryo'xkwen men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lenꞌ wiz ndryoꞌxkwen men, Jesus ngelo' xkiꞌs Dios lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />nde xij re mena nzo thi ngol, jwanꞌ ndala sinꞌ son linꞌ nayiz. Thi mbi narax mtoleng xis ngol, nde nek lud naꞌgakta gaꞌy. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Jesus ngol, mbrez Jesus ngol, nde nchab Jesus lo ngol:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:12">—Ngol, se mbro'ngi'b la lo yis ndyak la.<verse eid="LUK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Zyasa mxoꞌb Jesus yaꞌ Jesus yek ngol, nde hor yaga mbwaꞌ xis ngol nde mbli naro ngol Dios. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Per xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, ngok nayiꞌ xaꞌ, tak mtodanꞌ Jesus xaꞌ ya lenꞌ wiz ndryoꞌxkwen men, nde nchab xaꞌ lo reta men nzi tya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:14">—Xop wiz nzo jwan' ndablo ke men sinꞌ, len' re wiz ya deꞌ go' sa todanꞌ Xaꞌ goꞌ, nde naꞌyedta goꞌ lenꞌ wiz ndryoꞌxkwen men. <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Zyasa mkab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:15">—Makwinꞌ, ¿Cho nek thib goꞌ nanxakta ngon naꞌ o bur naꞌ, sa yano goꞌ maꞌ gu maꞌ nit lenꞌ wiz ndryoꞌxkwen men? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Per ngol ta nde lo bin Abraham re', ndala sinꞌ son linꞌ ntoti mbi narax ngol, ¿Cho naꞌgakta go'ngi'b na ngol lo yiz lenꞌ wiz ndryoꞌ xkwen men?<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Senꞌ nchab Jesus jwanꞌ reꞌ, re xaꞌ ta nayiꞌ ya ndyolaꞌs xaꞌ, per reta men nale toz ngo lazoꞌ xaꞌ por re yalnaro jwanꞌ ndli Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ mbis mostas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:18">— ¿Kon cho thi jwan' lal nak ten' nyebe' Dios? ¿Kon cho kwan toyal kalal nay? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Leꞌy nak xaja thi mbis mostas, jwanꞌ mblo bin thi xaꞌ lo izyon xaꞌ nde naro mxyena, ngoka thi ya nde re mbin ndoxkwaꞌ ma' lyeꞌd maꞌ lo re xod ya ya.<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ levadur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Nde bere nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:20">— ¿Kon cho kwan tedib jwan' kalal na ten' nyebe' Dios? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ta naka, xa nak levadur jwanꞌ nkos thi ngol kon son xi beꞌ di harin axta kebes dib koꞌb.<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yala naya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Nde senꞌ ndo Jesus ned nda Xaꞌ yez Jerusalen, taja nda loꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo re men, re yez nde re ranch tenꞌ ndarid Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Zyasa thi xa' mnabdiꞌs lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, ¿cho nagabta men jwan' lyaꞌ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Jesus nchab:<verse eid="LUK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />—Pchal goꞌ yote goꞌ ro yala naya, tak nipa na lo goꞌ, bro toz men chal yotey per naꞌlid xaꞌ gan. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Nde senꞌ xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ yo, tyoli xa' towꞌ xaꞌ ro yo nde re goꞌ jwanꞌ mbyanꞌ le, kwes goꞌ nde gab goꞌ: ꞌꞌ Xwan' ná', bxalꞌ goꞌ ro yo lo ná'.ꞌꞌ Per xaꞌ kab lo goꞌ: ꞌꞌNa'nyet na plo mbro' go'.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Zyasa tyobte gab goꞌ: "Thita mda na' nde thita nguꞌ na' nde re lo xbi' yez na' mtote'd la men." <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Per Xaꞌ kab lo goꞌ: ꞌꞌNia na lo go', na'nyet na plo mbro' go'. Baxa wa goꞌ men ndli jwan' narax nak go'.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Tya gon goꞌ nde te's kele goꞌ, senꞌ wiꞌ goꞌ Abraham, Isaac, Jakob nde reta xaꞌ mbrid xkiꞌs Dios pola, nzi xaꞌ tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios, nde goꞌ mbyanꞌ le. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Nde yeꞌd re men ryoꞌ dib nax izyo, nde tyob xaꞌ ro mes tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Zyasa re xa' ta ndo axta xiska, xa' ya tyo ner nde le' xa' ndo ner, xa' ya yan' axta xis.<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mbinꞌ por men yez Jerusalen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Nde le'ga wiz ya mzin pla xaꞌ fariseo, nchab xa' lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:31">—Broꞌte ncheꞌya, tak Herodes ncholaꞌs kuj la.<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Zyasa Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:32">—Bya goꞌ nde gus goꞌ lo mbe'd taya: ꞌꞌWiꞌ, naya nde yeꞌ go'ten mbi narax nzo re men nde ntodanꞌ na re men yis, nde wiz tolon rzin na.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Per ndabloga ndan xned na naya, yeꞌ nde wiz, tak naꞌndabloda gaj thi profet ten' nanakta yez Jerusalen.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />¡Men Jerusalen, men Jerusalen, goꞌ jwanꞌ nchuj re profet nde ngadke goꞌ re xaꞌ ntelꞌ Dios jwan' ncha's xkiꞌs Dios! ¡Naꞌr toz gob ncholas na nthop na re xinꞌ goꞌ, xaja ngidtan jwanꞌ nthop re chuy bix len' xil' na'. Per naꞌndoyalta goꞌ! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Bwiꞌ goꞌ nea, le' liz goꞌ yanꞌ nagan, nde nipa na lo goꞌ nagwiꞌtra goꞌ na axta kebeꞌ sin wiz senꞌ gab goꞌ: ꞌꞌNayon nak xaꞌ nde lo le Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ thib xaꞌ ndyak yis ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Thib wiz jwan' ndryoꞌxkwen men, Jesus ngwa tha liz thi xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re xaꞌ fariseo, nde tipla xaꞌ fariseo nzi laꞌs xa' nyenꞌ kwan li Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Nde tya ndo thi xaꞌ bi' ndyak yis ki. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Jesus lo re maestr nchak ley nde lo re xaꞌ fariseo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:3">—¿Cho gal' nak todan' men thi xa' nayiz len' wiz ndryo'xkwen men?<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Per naꞌnkapta xaꞌ. Zyasa mxen Jesus ya' xaꞌ yisa, mtodanꞌ Jesus xaꞌ nde mbloned Jesus xaꞌ, ndya xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Nde nchab Jesus lo re xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:5">—¿Xanya thi goꞌ, tez le'xa len' wiz ndryoxkwen men gab thi bur goꞌ o thi ngon goꞌ lenꞌ poz, cho naꞌkoted goꞌ maꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Nde ngen kwan ngak nkab xaꞌ lo Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Re xaꞌ ncha lo yalselyaꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Lo mbwiꞌ Jesus lo re xaꞌ nde lo fyest, xa mbi xaꞌ re yasil nzi axta lo tyob xa', sa wa xaꞌ, zyasa mdaꞌ Jesus thi kwent lo xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />—Senꞌ kwes thi men goꞌ ya goꞌ lo yalselyaꞌ, naꞌkwid goꞌ tenꞌ ndyob xa' ntak tyob goꞌ, tak ndaga sin thib xaꞌ nde lo yalselyaꞌ jwanꞌ mas ntak lo goꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />nde xaꞌ jwanꞌ ta mbrez goꞌ lo yalselyaꞌ ya, bike xaꞌ gax lo goꞌ nde nye xaꞌ lo go': "Btaꞌ goꞌ tenꞌ ndob go' reꞌ tyob xaꞌ reꞌ.ꞌꞌ Zyasa nyata lo go' tyolaꞌs goꞌ nde yatob goꞌ axta xis. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Mbay le' go' senꞌ kwes xaꞌ goꞌ lo yalselyaꞌ, wa tob goꞌ axta xiska, sa senꞌ nde xaꞌ jwan mbrez goꞌ, nye xaꞌ lo goꞌ. ꞌꞌAmig, deꞌ go' tyob goꞌ xij re xa' ntak reꞌ.ꞌꞌ Zyasa ntak goꞌ lo re xaꞌ nzino go' ro mes. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Tak xaꞌ nchak naro, xaꞌ ya ryoꞌ yantho, nde xa' jwan' nanchak naroda xaꞌ ya ak naro.<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Nogaꞌ nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ ta mbrez Jesus lo fyest ya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:12">—Senꞌ kwes la men lo yalwa, naꞌkwesta la xaꞌ nak amig la, nek re wes la, nek re taa nde nek re xaꞌ rik jwanꞌ nzo gax liz la; tak reta xaꞌ reꞌ, no xaꞌ kwes xaꞌ lu lo yalwa chanꞌ xaꞌ, sa yotay nde tamod yaxa. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Le' senꞌ ndlia thi fyest, brez re xaꞌ prob, re xaꞌ naꞌngenta thi ninꞌ, ngenta thi yan', re xaꞌ ngob nin', nde re xaꞌ nglwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Sa nabe'z toz yaa, tak xaꞌ reꞌ naꞌgakta kix xaꞌy loa. Per Dios taꞌy loa senꞌ ryoꞌxban re xinꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi kwent chanꞌ thi rzyeꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Senꞌ lo mbin thi xaꞌ ndob ro mes kon Jesus jwan' nchab Jesus, nchab xaꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:15">—¡Nabez toz nda xaꞌ jwanꞌ wa ro mes tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios! <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:16">—Thi mbi mda' thi rzye' thoz wa re men, nde mbrez xaꞌ bro thoz men. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Senꞌ ngoxob hor ya rsye'y, mtelꞌ xaꞌ mos xaꞌ, sa yatne mosa lo re xaꞌ ta mbrez xaꞌ ya: ꞌꞌDe' go', tak nzisa'la rzyeꞌ.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Per reta xaꞌ mdobte, mtob ro choja jwan' sa nayad xa'. Xaꞌ ner nchab: ꞌꞌNya'b na loa gab la lo xa' nyebe' loa, penta mxin' thi izyo nde nakin' ya wi' ney.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Nde tedib xaꞌ nchab: ꞌꞌNa penta mxin gayꞌ yunt ngon, nde nakinꞌ nda wiꞌn nyenꞌ cho ndli ma' sinꞌ. Nyab na loa ta gab la lo xaꞌ nyebeꞌ loa.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Nde tedib xaꞌ nchab: ꞌꞌNa ngolo mpselyan, jwan' nasa naꞌlit na gan yan." <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Senꞌ mbere mos nchab mos reta jwan' na, lo xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo mos. Zyasa mxi lazoꞌ xaꞌ nyebeꞌ, nde nchab xaꞌ lo mos: ꞌꞌBken wa re ned ro, re lenꞌ yez nde waxiꞌ re xaꞌ prob, re xaꞌ ngenta ninꞌ nde yanꞌ, re xaꞌ syeg nde re xaꞌ renk.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Senꞌ mbere mos nchab mos: ꞌꞌXa' nyebe' mblia na re jwanꞌ mnebeꞌ goꞌ lon, per tata ben' nalaja.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo mos: ꞌꞌWa re ned ro, nde re ned bix, nde le'ka bchal xa' sa yeꞌd xaꞌ, sa se liz na. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Tak nipa na lo goꞌ nek thib xaꞌ, ta mbrez na nera', naꞌwarzyeꞌda jwan' mdoxkwan.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xa ne naka tyonke men xis Jesús</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Men toz tir ndenke xis Jesus, nde mbyek Xa' nchab Xa' lo re men:<verse eid="LUK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />—Tez cho goꞌ ncholaꞌs tyonke xis na, ndablo mas ke' lazo' go' na, ke xud go', xnaꞌ goꞌ, xaꞌ got goꞌ, re xinꞌ goꞌ, re wes goꞌ, re ptanꞌ goꞌ nde leꞌga leꞌ yalnaban chan' go', sa li goꞌ gan gak goꞌ xinꞌteꞌd na. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Nde tez na'taya'd lazo' go' rid go' pen xaja' men ne' kruza nde na'tyonked goꞌ xis na, naꞌlid go' gan ak goꞌ xin'te'd na. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Tez cho thi goꞌ ncholaꞌs toxkwaꞌ thi yo na'r toz xta', ¿Cho nanerta tyob goꞌ li goꞌ xgab sa koꞌ goꞌ kwent, nyenꞌ cho tal tmi talo goꞌy? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ndaga na ben'ta mdixsa' go' xan' yo, nde na'ndlid go' gan ngaloy, reta men jwan' wi'y xino xa' go', <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />nde gab xaꞌ: ꞌꞌXa' ba mdobte toxkwa' xaꞌ liz xaꞌ, nde naꞌndlid xaꞌ gan ngaloy.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Nde taga' cho rey, senꞌ nda xaꞌ lo byo sa yo xaꞌ kon tediba rey, ndablo nerla li xaꞌ xgab, ¿Cho tak yo siꞌ mil sondad xaꞌ kon thibwal mil sondad jwanꞌ nde kon tedib rey? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nde tez mne xa' naꞌlid xaꞌ gan, senꞌ tata benꞌ ndo tij tedib rey, telꞌ xaꞌ pla men xaꞌ yanaꞌb lo tedib rey ya, sa toyal xa' kwent. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Taga', tez cho thi goꞌ naꞌlada re jwanꞌ ngeno go', na'lida goꞌ gan ak goꞌ xin'te'd na.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Senꞌ nanazigta ted</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Wen nak ted, per tez tya'b naziga, ¿xamod ak nasiga tedib gob? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Nde naꞌlid sinꞌna, nekla li sin'na par beꞌb, benꞌta yobiy, tez ndob nza goꞌ, par gon goꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ, bin goꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ mbakxilꞌ jwanꞌ mdyab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ nthop tmi low par yez Rom, nde re men nzo'b xkena mbike xaꞌ sa gon xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndej Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Re xaꞌ fariseo nde re maestr nchak ley ngoxyo xaꞌ Jesus nde nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:2">—Mbiꞌ re' nkata kon re xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ nde nchano xaꞌ xa'.<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Zyasa mdej Jesus thi kwent nagan lo xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />—¿Cho thi goꞌba, ngeno thib ayoꞌ mbakxilꞌ nde tez tyaꞌb thi maꞌ, cho naꞌlad goꞌ thi thap gal nzo tsinꞌ thap maꞌ lenꞌ wan nde yakwan' goꞌ maꞌ ta mdyaba, axta ke yosal goꞌ maꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nde senꞌ zyal goꞌ maꞌ, nawe toz yo lazoꞌ goꞌ we goꞌ maꞌ yen goꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />senꞌ sin goꞌ liz goꞌ, thop goꞌ re amig goꞌ nde re xaꞌ nzo gax liz goꞌ, nde gab goꞌ lo xaꞌ: ꞌꞌBlo nale lazoꞌ goꞌ kon na, tak mzyala mbakxilꞌ na ta mdyaba.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Nin lo goꞌ taga' mas ncho yalnale lo beꞌ por thib xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken na', lo nzye' xgab xa' nde ndlaꞌ xa' jwan' narax, ke re thap gal nzo tsinꞌ thap xaꞌ jwanꞌ gal' ndo nde nanakin'ta zye' xgab xa' nde laꞌ xa' jwanꞌ narax.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ thi tmi mdyaꞌb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Taga', ¿cho thi ngol ngeno siꞌ tmi nde mtaꞌb ngol thiba, cho nangista ngol ki nde ndlo'b ngol yo, jwin ndryal ngol nkwanꞌ ngola axta kebe' yosala? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Nde senꞌ yosala, nthop ngol re xaꞌ nsal'ta ngol nde re xaꞌ nzo gax liz ngol, nde gab ngol lo xaꞌ: ꞌꞌBlo nale lazoꞌ goꞌ kon na, tak ngosal na tmin na ta mtab na ya.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nde nin lo goꞌ, taga' ncho nale lazoꞌ re anj chanꞌ Dios senꞌ thib xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken na', nzye' xgab xa' nde ndlaꞌ xa' jwan' narax.<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ thi mdyenꞌ ndriꞌdcho tmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Noga nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:11">—Thi mbi' ngeno chop xinꞌ bi' naꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />nde or yenꞌ nchab lo xud naꞌ: "Xud na, ptaꞌ jwanꞌ ndaꞌblo ak chanꞌ na.ꞌꞌ Zyasa mdiꞌd xaꞌ chenꞌ xaꞌ lo rop xinꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mbrid ta pla wiz, leꞌ xinꞌ xaꞌ or yenꞌ na, mthor reta jwanꞌ mdaꞌ xaꞌ lor, nde ndar tij, xa'la yez, nde tya mbriꞌdchor tmin or lo re jwanꞌ narax ngoxte lir. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Nde senꞌ mblu'xla or re tmin or, ngo thi win toz yez ya, nde mdobte ndya win lor. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Zyasa ngwa kwanꞌ or sinꞌ lo thi xaꞌ yez ya, nde xaꞌ ya mtelꞌ or ya kenap or nguch. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Nde ndyanꞌ toz or, ncholaꞌs or war jwanꞌ ncha nguch, tak ngen cho taꞌ jwanꞌ war. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Zyasa mblir xgab: "¡Plopa re mos nge sinꞌ liz xud na, nde axta ndryoꞌ xoꞌb jwanꞌ ncha re mos, nde leꞌ na mer gaj na win ncheꞌya! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Mas beren liz xud na, nde gab na lo xaꞌ: ¡Xud na, mblin jwanꞌ narax loa nde mblin jwanꞌ narax lo Dios! <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Nanzalꞌta na koꞌlea na xinꞌ la; blilal na xaja thi mos la jwanꞌ nge sinꞌ loa." <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Zyasa mxen or ned, ndyar liz xud or.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Senꞌ tata benꞌ tij nder, mbwiꞌ xud or or, mblat lazoꞌ xaꞌ or, mkeꞌ xaꞌ karel nda xiꞌ ned xaꞌ or, mdeꞌs xaꞌ or, nde mda xaꞌ chut kwat or. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Zyasa nchab or, lo xud or: ꞌꞌXud na, mblin jwanꞌ narax lo Dios nde mblin jwanꞌ narax loa; nanzalꞌta na koꞌlea na xinꞌ la." <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Per xud or nchab lo re mos xaꞌ, "Bken go' waxiꞌ goꞌ lar wen bok xab goꞌ or, blo goꞌ thi ani kwen yaꞌr nde blo goꞌ yayid nir. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Nde waxiꞌ goꞌ thi ngon mas nacha nde bij goꞌ maꞌ wanꞌ nde linꞌ fyest. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Tak xinꞌ na reꞌ ngujla or, nde naya naban or, mdyab or, nde naya ngosal or." Zyasa mdobte mbli xaꞌ fyest.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Nde laja, leꞌ xinꞌ xaꞌ or gox naxte lo sinꞌ wan. Senꞌ mberer liz or, lo ndo sin gax or yo mbin or, nge keꞌ xaꞌ di nde nzo kani. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Zyasa mbrez or thi mos nde mnabdiꞌs or lo mos, cho kwan nchak. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Mos mkab: "Wes la mbere nde xud goꞌ mnibeꞌ gaj ngon mas nachaꞌ, tak or wes la wen mberer nde nadanꞌ or." <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Per wes or, or goxa, ngok nayiꞌ, nde nancholasta or yoter lenꞌ yo, zyasa mbroꞌ xud or, ngwayab xaꞌ lor, sa yeꞌd or yoter lenꞌ yo. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Zyasa nchab or lo xud or: "Bwiꞌ pla linꞌ ndo lin sinꞌ loa, nde thiblaꞌ nxoꞌbyek na la, nde nekla thi chib namdat la, par tyoxkwaꞌ thi komid wanon re xa' nzal'tan. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Nde naya mzin xinꞌ la jwanꞌ mblux reta tmin la lo re ngol ntho lad na' nde lo re jwanꞌ narax, nde mbij la ngon mas nacha par or." <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Zyasa nchab xud or: "Xinꞌ na lu thibla nzo lon, nde reta jwanꞌ ngenon nak chanꞌ la. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Per naya ndablo konale lazonꞌ nde linꞌ fyest, tak wes la, ngujla nde naya naban or, mdya'b or nde ngosal or."<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ thi xaꞌ naleꞌda nke sinꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Jesus mdaꞌ thi kwent lo re xin'te'd Jesus, nchab Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:1">—Ngo thi xaꞌ rik mkeno thi mos jwanꞌ ndowiꞌ re chanꞌ xaꞌ, nde ngwa yab men lo xaꞌ rika, leꞌ mos ndowiꞌ chanꞌ xaꞌ ya, ndoja ndlux mos re chanꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Zyasa mbrez xa' rika mos ya; nde nchab xaꞌ lo mos: ꞌꞌ¿Cho kwan nak jwanꞌ nchon na ndo linoa re chanꞌ na? Btej lon xamod ngea sinꞌ, tak naꞌtatra na sinꞌ kea. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Zyasa mbli mos xgab: ¿Cho kwan lin naya, tak xaꞌ nak chanꞌ sinꞌ naꞌtatra xaꞌ sinꞌ keꞌn? Naꞌxektra na lin sinꞌ wan, nde ndyolas na nyaꞌb na gon. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />¡Aa! Mnea na kwan linꞌ, sa yo men taꞌ liz naꞌ kwed na senꞌ mkib xaꞌ sinꞌ lon.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Zyasa mbrez mos, thib thiba xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndaꞌb lo patron mos, nde nchab mos lo xaꞌ ner: ꞌꞌ¿Plopa ndaꞌb la lo patron na?ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Leꞌ xaꞌ nchab: ꞌꞌNdab na thiba ayo barril aseit.ꞌꞌ Zyasa nchab mos lo xaꞌ: ꞌꞌNcheꞌ xkeꞌs la jwanꞌ ndob kwent la, btonꞌ thib ayoꞌ barril aseyt jwanꞌ ndob lo ney, nde benꞌta btob cho'psi' barril aseyt lo ney.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Nde nchab mos lo tedib xaꞌ: ꞌꞌMbay lu, ¿plopa ndab la lo patron na?ꞌꞌ Xaꞌ ya nchab: ꞌꞌThib ayoꞌ sak trig ndaꞌb na.ꞌꞌZyasa nchab mos lo xaꞌ: ꞌꞌNcheꞌ xkeꞌs la jwanꞌ ndob kwent la, nde ptob benꞌta thap gal sak trig lo ney.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Nde xaꞌ rika wen mbwiꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbli mos narax reꞌ, lo xa mkwanꞌ mos mod mbli mos. Tak mas nata yek re men lo izyo reꞌ, par lo re jwanꞌ lo izyo reꞌ, ke re men naxte lo xni chanꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Na ni lo goꞌ, no goꞌ bli rsinꞌ goꞌ tmin goꞌ nde re jwanꞌ nchap goꞌ lo izyo reꞌ, sa li goꞌ gan amig, sa senꞌ lo mbre tmin goꞌ, ngeno goꞌ cho taꞌ tenꞌ kwed goꞌ lo beꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Xaꞌ jwanꞌ naxut ndli rsinꞌ lud jwanꞌ, taga naxut ndli rsinꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ bro; per xaꞌ jwanꞌ narax ndli rsinꞌ jwanꞌ lud, taga narax li rsin xaꞌ jwanꞌ bro. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Jwanꞌ nasa tez nanaxuta ndli rsinꞌ goꞌ tmi nde re jwanꞌ ngeno goꞌ lo izyo reꞌ, ¿cho li lazonꞌ galꞌ li rsinꞌ goꞌ re jwanꞌ liga ntak toz? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Nde tez nandlid goꞌ jwanꞌ galꞌ lo jwanꞌ nanakta chanꞌ goꞌ, ¿Xomod li lazoꞌ men li goꞌ jwanꞌ galꞌ lo jwanꞌ nak chanꞌpa goꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Ngen cho mos li gan ke sinꞌ lo chop xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ sinꞌ, tak giꞌno xaꞌ thi xaꞌ nde keꞌ lazoꞌ xaꞌ tedib xaꞌ, o li xaꞌ sinꞌ lo tib xaꞌ nde laꞌ xaꞌ tedib xaꞌ. Ngen cho men li gan li sinꞌ lo Dios nde nyalo xaꞌ yalrik.<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Lo mbin re xaꞌ fariseo jwanꞌ nchab Jesus, mxiꞌno xaꞌ Jesus tak ndyablaꞌs toz re xa' tmi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:15">—Goꞌ ba, wen toz goꞌ lo re men ndyak goꞌ, per Dios nzolo lazoꞌ goꞌ, tak jwanꞌ mas ntak lo men, Dios ngo'tala.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ley chan' Moises nde yalnyebeꞌ chan' Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Nde nchab Jesus: Ley chan' Moises nde re jwan' mbloꞌ re profet ngexobyek xaꞌy axta senꞌ mbyeꞌd Juan. Xata zya mdobte mbryaꞌs diꞌs wen chanꞌ Dios, nde reta men nchal yote tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Mas nale' dyonꞌ beꞌ nde izyo, ke thi diꞌs nge lo ley, retay atakey xaja nchab lo ley.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndloꞌ yalke ndlaꞌ men salꞌ men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Reta xaꞌ biꞌ jwanꞌ ndlaꞌ ngol naꞌ, nde nselyaꞌ xaꞌ kon tediba' ngol, yalke nchap xa' lo Dios, nde xa' jwan' nselya' kon ngol ta mblaꞌ xaꞌ biꞌ ya, taga yalke nchap xa'.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent chanꞌ ti xaꞌ rik nde Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />ꞌꞌNgo thi xaꞌ rik, nchok lar nawe nya nde lar nap, nde reta wiz ndli xaꞌ fyest nde nab jwan' wen ngo xaꞌ mes. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Nde nogaꞌ ngo thi xaꞌ prob ndole Lazaro nde ndo yeꞌs dib lad xaꞌ, ndyob xaꞌ izyo ro yalan xaꞌ rika. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Nde ndya'bla's xaꞌ wa xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab ro mes xaꞌ rik sa se xa' nde axta re mbak mbike lo xa' ndyup mbak re ye's ndo lad xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Per thib wiz nguj Lazaro xa' nalat ndyaka, nde re anj chanꞌ Dios mbeꞌ Lazaro tenꞌ nzo Abraham. Nde noga xaꞌ rika nguj nde mka's men xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Nde senꞌ nzo rik yeꞌr abil, nzo xaꞌ lo pen, zyasa mblit lo xaꞌ, nde tij mbwiꞌ xaꞌ Abraham, nde Lazaro ndo lad Abraham. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Zyasa mbrez yaj rik lo Abraham nchab: ꞌꞌ¡Xud na Abraham, blat lazoꞌa na! Ptelꞌ Lazaro sa gas xaꞌ xi kwen yaꞌ xaꞌ lenꞌ nit nde yeꞌd tayal xaꞌ los na, tak naꞌxektra na lo bel reꞌ.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Per Abraham nchab: ꞌꞌXinꞌ na, ptelaꞌs ke bro jwanꞌ mkenoa nde wen mban la lo izyo, nde mbiꞌ reꞌ mbriꞌd yalti nde ngen kwan mkeno xaꞌ. Per naya nawe nzo xaꞌ ncheꞌ, nde leꞌ lu nzo lo pen. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Nde parka nzo thi xlaj toz jwanꞌ ngen cho gak rid, xij naꞌ, nde tenye xaꞌ nzo ncheꞌya ncholaꞌs xaꞌ ya xaꞌ tenꞌ nzoꞌa, naꞌgakta rid xaꞌ, nde xaꞌ nzo tenꞌ nzoꞌa ba, naꞌakta rida xaꞌ sa yeꞌd xaꞌ tenꞌ nzo náꞌ.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ rik lo Abraham: "Nyaꞌb na loa xud na, ptelꞌ Lazaro ya xaꞌ liz xud na, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />tak tya ngenon gayꞌ wes na, sa taꞌ Lazaro kwent lo xaꞌ, sa naꞌyeta xaꞌ tenꞌ nzon lo pen reꞌ.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abraham nchab: ꞌꞌNgenoa xaꞌ re jwanꞌ mkeꞌ Moises lo ye's, nde re jwanꞌ mkeꞌ re profet lo ye's ¡Ndablo xoꞌbyek xaꞌy!ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Per xaꞌ rik nchab: ꞌꞌXud na, Abraham, pa li lazoꞌ xaꞌy, per tez thi xaꞌ ngujla ryoꞌxban nde ryoꞌto xaꞌ lo xaꞌ, zyasa tli lazoꞌ xaꞌ Dios nde tseꞌ xgab xaꞌ.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Per Abraham nchab lo xaꞌ rika: ꞌꞌTez na'xobyekta xaꞌ jwanꞌ mkeꞌ Moises, nde re profet, taga' naꞌlid lazoꞌ xaꞌy, teꞌnyega ryoꞌxban thi xaꞌ nguj.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Nathoz nak gab men lo jwanꞌ narax</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Jesus nchab lo re xin' te'd Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:1">—Tibka nzo jwanꞌ li sa gab men lo jwanꞌ narax, per ¡nalat nya men li gab ta men naꞌ lo jwanꞌ narax! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Mas jwin nda xaꞌ, tyobdoꞌ thi ke ntoꞌ men jwanꞌ yen xaꞌ nde yobi xaꞌ lenꞌ nittoꞌ, ke li xaꞌ gab ti men lo yalke. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Pkenap goꞌ lazoꞌ goꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">ꞌꞌTez cho ta goꞌ mbli jwan' narax lo goꞌ; brez go' yek xaꞌ, tez zyeꞌ ak xaꞌ la' xa' jwan' narax, ptori'd go' yek go' jwanꞌ mbli xaꞌ lo goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nde teꞌnye gaz gob li xaꞌ jwan' narax lo goꞌ lenꞌ wiz, nde tez gaz gob nde xaꞌ lo goꞌ nde nye xaꞌ lo goꞌ: ꞌꞌNalitra nayꞌꞌ, ptori'd goꞌ yek go' jwan' mblino xa' go'.<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bli sa masra' li lazo' na' lu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Zyasa nchab re xin'te'd Jesus lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:5">—Bli sa masra' li lazo' ná' lu.<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:6">—Tez ndli lazoꞌ goꞌ Dios, masa thi jwanꞌ lud xapa thi mbis mostaz, toyal gab goꞌ lo ya reꞌ: “Byiꞌb ncheꞌya nde btob lenꞌ nittoꞌ”, txoꞌbyeka goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xa ndablo li mos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Nde nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:7">Tez thi goꞌ ba ngeno thi mos, jwanꞌ penta mbere ngwa sinꞌ wan o ngwa kenap re maꞌ, leꞌ hor mbere xaꞌ lo sinꞌ, ¿Cho tab goꞌ lo xaꞌ: ꞌꞌPtob sa waa?" <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Cheꞌla, gab goꞌ lo xaꞌ: ꞌꞌPtoxkwaꞌ jwanꞌ wa rzyeꞌn, pseꞌ xab la nde ptosaꞌ sa koa jwanꞌ wan nde jwanꞌ gun, senꞌ mne mdan seraꞌ waa nde gua.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />¿Nde cho mdaꞌ goꞌ dyux lo mos lo mbli mos re jwanꞌ mnebeꞌ goꞌ?, nda lazoꞌn namdaꞌd goꞌ dyux lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Taga' goꞌ, ngolo mbli goꞌ re jwanꞌ mnibeꞌ Dios lo goꞌ li go', zyasa gab goꞌ: ꞌꞌMos ngen cho jwis nak náꞌ, tak benꞌta mbli náꞌ sinꞌ, jwanꞌ mnibeꞌta xaꞌ lo náꞌ ndli náꞌ.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodanꞌ siꞌ xaꞌ ndyak ye's ya's</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Laj ndo Jesus ned ndya Xaꞌ yez Jerusalen, ndariꞌd Xaꞌ xij xyon men Samaria nde xyon men Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Nde senꞌ ndozin Jesus thi yez lud, mbroꞌ siꞌ xaꞌ biꞌ ndyak ye's ya's lo Jesus, nde re xaꞌ ya tijraꞌ mbre xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />mbrez yaj xaꞌ, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:13">—¡Jesus, Maestr, blat lazoꞌa náꞌ!<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Jesus re xaꞌ, nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">—Wa goꞌ sa wiꞌ nglweyꞌ goꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Nde laj ndo xaꞌ ned, mbyak xaꞌ nde mbyanꞌ nambi belꞌ xaꞌ lo yis ndyak xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Nde thib xaꞌ ya, senꞌ mne xaꞌ mbyak xaꞌ, mbere xaꞌ nde leꞌka ne mbrez xaꞌ nde mbli naro xaꞌ le Dios. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Nde mdoxub xaꞌ lo Jesus, axta mdinꞌ yek xaꞌ izyo, nde mdaꞌ xaꞌ dyux lo Jesus. Nde xaꞌ reꞌ, nak xaꞌ yez Samaria. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:17">—¿Cho nakta siꞌ goꞌ jwanꞌ mbyanꞌ nambi belꞌ naꞌ nde mbyak lo yis? ¿Mbay ma thi yeꞌ xaꞌ sa? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />¿Cho benꞌta thib xaꞌ thiblada mbere nde linaro xaꞌ le Dios? <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:19">—Btoli nde bya; Tak mbli lazoꞌa Dios jwanꞌ na mbyak la.<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xamod ak senꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Zyasa re xaꞌ fariseo mnabdiꞌs lo Jesus, pol sin yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios, zyasa mkab Jesus lo xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">— Yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios, na'aktey thi jwanꞌ toyal wi' reta mena sen' sina. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Ngen cho gab: ꞌꞌleꞌy ncheꞌyaꞌꞌ o ꞌꞌleꞌy ba", tak yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios ndola xij goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo re xin'te'd Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:22">—Tsin wiz, sen' ncholaꞌs goꞌ wi' goꞌ thi wiz chanꞌ Xinꞌ Mbi, per naꞌwi'd goꞌy. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Nde ryoꞌ pla xaꞌ nye lo goꞌ: ꞌꞌLeꞌ Xaꞌ ndo ncheꞌyaꞌꞌ, o ꞌꞌle' Xa' ndo baꞌꞌ, per na'yad go' nde naꞌtyonked goꞌ xis xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Tak xaja ndloꞌ ncho xni belti dib lo be', taga' ak Xin' Mbi' senꞌ sin wiz yeꞌd Xa'. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Per ner nakinꞌ riꞌd Xa' bro toz yalti nde kotal re men nzi naya Xa'. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Ta xa ngok lenꞌ wiz senꞌ ngo Noe, taga' ak wiz senꞌ yeꞌd Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Lenꞌ re wiz ya ncha xa' nde nchuꞌ xa', nselyaꞌ xa', nde ndaꞌ xa' xinꞌ got xa' sa selyaꞌr, axta mzin wiz senꞌ ngo Noe lenꞌ bark, nde mdobte nde nit toz tira, nde reta men mblux. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Nde taga' ngok lenꞌ re wiz ngo Lot: Re men ncha xaꞌ nchuꞌ xaꞌ, ndiꞌ xaꞌ nde nthoꞌ xaꞌ, ngo xaꞌ bin nde ntaꞌ xaꞌ yo. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Per wiz senꞌ mbroꞌte Lot yez Sodoma, mbroꞌ bel lo beꞌ xaja yike ba, nde mbluxa reta men yez Sodoma. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Nde taga' yotey lenꞌ wiz senꞌ ryotoꞌ Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Wiz ya, xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndo yek yo, nalyad xa' ya xiꞌ xaꞌ chanꞌ xaꞌ nzi lenꞌ yo, nde re xaꞌ ndo len' wan naꞌbereda xaꞌ liz xa'. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />¡Ptelaꞌs goꞌ jwanꞌ ngote ngol Lot. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Xaꞌ jwanꞌ nkelo tolaꞌ yalnaban chanꞌ naꞌ, xaꞌ ya cheꞌ taꞌba, per xaꞌ jwanꞌ taꞌb yalnaban chanꞌ naꞌ lo ndli lazoꞌ xaꞌ na, xaꞌ ya cheꞌ tolaꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nin lo goꞌ, yal' ya nzi yat chop xaꞌ lo ka, thib xaꞌ yoꞌ, nde tedib xaꞌ ba'. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Nde chop ngol thita nge yuꞌ, thib xaꞌ yoꞌ nde tedib xaꞌ baꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Nde chop xaꞌ biꞌ nge sinꞌ wan; thib xaꞌ yoꞌ nde tedib xaꞌ baꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs re xin'te'd Jesus, nchab xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">—¿Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, plo ak re jwanꞌ reꞌ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">—Tenꞌ nax maꞌ nguj, tya ndyope re ngol.<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Kwent nagan chanꞌ thi ngol nguj sal' na'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Jesus mdaꞌ thi kwent nagan, sa loꞌ Jesus xamod ndablo tiblaꞌ todi'sno men Dios nde sa naꞌlyayod men. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:2">—Thi yez ngo thi juez, jwanꞌ nanzepta lazoꞌn Dios neka ndyo xa' re men. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Leꞌga yez ya ngo thi ngol nguj sal' na', jwanꞌ ngyo kon tediba xaꞌ nde nchanaꞌb ngol lo Juez sa nyaꞌb juez kwent lo xaꞌ ta ndabeyono ngol la. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Nde bro tyemp mkete ngol lo juez per naꞌgoxyod juez jwanꞌ nyaꞌb ngol, ya lulka sa mbli juez xgab: Nanzepta lazoꞌn Dios nde neka ndyon men, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />per ngol reꞌ thibla' ndotaꞌ ngol xyan yek na, mas laꞌston ngol, sa naꞌyetra ngol lon, tak yoloba yoche lazoꞌn.<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:6">—Bin goꞌ jwanꞌ nchab juez narax naka. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />¿Nde cho ndyak goꞌ na'lastod Dios re xaꞌ jwanꞌ mblí Dios, jwan' nyaꞌb lo Dios yalꞌ ndlya be? ¿Cho ndyak goꞌ na, sowꞌ toz kab Dios lo xaꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Na ni lo goꞌ, Dios naxax laꞌsto Xaꞌ go'. Per senꞌ ye'd Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ, ¿Cho benꞌ tasal xa' men jwanꞌ ndli lazoꞌn Dios lo izyo reꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent nagan chanꞌ xaꞌ fariseo nde xaꞌ nyaꞌb tmi low</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Jesus mdaꞌ kwent chanꞌ pla xaꞌ, jwanꞌ ndli xgab nak xaꞌ men galꞌ, nde ngotal xaꞌ temas men:<verse eid="LUK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />—Ngo thi wiz, ngoxoꞌb chop xaꞌ biꞌ yodoꞌ, sa todi'sno xa' Dios: Thib xaꞌ nak xaꞌ fariseo, nde tedib xaꞌ nak, xaꞌ nyaꞌb tmi low. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Leꞌ xaꞌ fariseo ndo li, nde ndotodi'sno xa' Dios nchab xaꞌ: ꞌꞌDios, tan dyux loa tak nanakta na xaja temas men, re men wanꞌ, re men ndli jwanꞌ narax, re men ndyen ngol xaꞌgaꞌ men, nde neka nak na xaja xaꞌ ta nyaꞌb tmi low ndo ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Na ndli yalse chop gob lenꞌ sman nde ndan dyesmo lo reta jwanꞌ ndlin gan.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Leꞌ xaꞌ nyaꞌb tmi lowa, mdo tij xaꞌ, nde neka ndlit xaꞌ lo xaꞌ wiꞌ xaꞌ lo beꞌ, benꞌta nginyaꞌ xaꞌ lazoꞌ xaꞌ nde nchab xaꞌ: ꞌꞌ¡Dios, blat lazoꞌa na, tak na nak xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ!ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Na ni lo goꞌ, leꞌ xaꞌ nyaꞌb tmi low, senꞌ ndya xaꞌ liz xaꞌ, mtonꞌka Dios xken xaꞌ, per xaꞌ fariseo naꞌntonꞌta Dios xken xaꞌ. Tak xaꞌ nchak naro, xaꞌ ya ryoꞌyantho, per xaꞌ nanchaknaroda, xaꞌ ya ak naro.<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus nxoꞌb yaꞌ yek or bix</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Tagaꞌ mzin re men ndeno re or bix lo Jesus, sa xoꞌb yaꞌ Jesus yek or, per senꞌ mbwiꞌ re xin'te'd Jesus jwanꞌ reꞌ, mdobte mbrezno xaꞌ re men ndeno re or bixa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Leꞌ Jesus mbrez re or bix nde nchab Jesus lo xinꞌ teꞌd Jesús:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:16">—Btaꞌ goꞌ diꞌs yeꞌd re or bix lon, nde naꞌkad goꞌ diꞌs, tak tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios nak par reta men jwanꞌ nak lazoꞌn xaja re or bixa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nde galꞌ diꞌs nin lo goꞌ, xaꞌ jwanꞌ nankayaꞌd yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios, xaja or bix, naꞌyoted xaꞌ tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thi mbyo rik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Thi mbi' nak kabes mnabdiꞌs lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:18">—Maestr wen, ¿Kwan ndablo lin sa kayan yalnaban adiꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:19">—¿Kwan liy ngoꞌlea na xaꞌ wen? Ngen cho wen nak, benꞌta thita xaꞌ wen nzo, xaꞌ ya nak Dios. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Mnea la re jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ xkiꞌs Dios: ꞌꞌNaꞌtyenta la ngol jwanꞌ nanakta ngol la, naꞌkujta la men, naꞌliwanꞌta la, naꞌnit la diꞌs kwinꞌ xis nek thib men, xoꞌbyek xud la nde xnaꞌa.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Le mbi' ya nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:21">—Reta jwanꞌ reꞌ nxobyek na xata lud na.<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Senꞌ mbin Jesus jwanꞌ reꞌ, nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:22">—Thipta jwanꞌ nchak jwad lia, ptho reta jwanꞌ ngenoa nde ptaꞌ tmi lo re xaꞌ prob. Tamod sa kenoa yalrik lo beꞌ sera' deꞌ sa tyonkea xis na.<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Per senꞌ mbin xaꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ, ngo nabil lazoꞌ xaꞌ, tak xaꞌ rik toz xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Jesus ngo nabil lazoꞌ xaꞌ, nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:24">—¡Ne toz yote thi xaꞌ rik tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Tak mas naleꞌ rid thi kamey lenꞌ yeꞌr yagux, ke rid thi xaꞌ rik tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Zyasa re xaꞌ mbin jwanꞌ reꞌ nchab xaꞌ, ¿Cho li gan lyaꞌ sa?<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:27">—Re jwanꞌ ta naꞌakta li men, Dios tak li.<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Pedr nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:28">—Náꞌ mblaꞌ náꞌ reta jwanꞌ ngeno náꞌ sa tyonke náꞌ xis la.<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:29">—Lipa nin lo goꞌ, xaꞌ jwanꞌ mblaꞌ liz naꞌ, mblaꞌ salꞌ naꞌ, mblaꞌ wes naꞌ, mblaꞌ xud naꞌ, mblaꞌ xinꞌ naꞌ, por yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />xaꞌ ya kayaꞌ mas yalwen naya, nde mas yoloba kayaꞌ xaꞌ yalnaban adiꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tedib gob mdej Jesus gaj Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Zyasa xaꞌta mbrez Jesus re tib sen xin'te'd Jesus, nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:31">—Naya ndanꞌ yez Jerusalen, tenꞌ ak reta jwanꞌ mkeꞌ re profet yate Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Tya tayaꞌ xaꞌ xaꞌ lo yaꞌ re xaꞌ nanakta xaꞌ Israel. Xaꞌ ya xino xaꞌ xaꞌ, loꞌs xaꞌ xaꞌ nde suk xaꞌ lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Kin xaꞌ xaꞌ nde kuj xaꞌ xaꞌ; per yaxob mbyon wiz ryoꞌxban xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Per nek lud naꞌngyenta xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ, anaꞌnye xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ, tak jwanꞌ nagan yen mena.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mtodan' thi xaꞌ syeg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Senꞌ nde sin gax Jesus yez Jerico, tya ndob thi xaꞌ syeg ro ned, ndob na'b gon. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Senꞌ mbin xaꞌ ndarid men toz tir tya, mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ, ¿Cho kwan ndoyak? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Zyasa nchab men lo xaꞌ, Jesus Nazaret ndarid ncheꞌya. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Zyasa mbrez yaj xaꞌ syega, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:38">—¡Jesus, xaꞌ nde lo bin David, blat lazoꞌa na!<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Nde re xaꞌ nda siblo lo Jesus, mtokox xaꞌ xaꞌ syega, sa na'kwesta xaꞌ, per cheꞌla masra' ne mbrez xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:39">—¡Xaꞌ nde lo bin David, blat lazoꞌa na!<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Zyasa ngoto Jesus, nde mnebeꞌ Jesus yeꞌdno men xaꞌ lo Jesus, senꞌ mzin xaꞌ lo Jesus, mnabdiꞌs Jesus lo xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />—¿Cho kwan ncholaꞌs la lin loa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Zyasa mkab xaꞌ syega nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, na ncholas yoni lon. <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:42">—¡Leꞌ loa yoni! Tak lo mbli lazoꞌa na, mdyanꞌ la.<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Zyaga ngoni lo xaꞌ syega, mdonke xaꞌ xis Jesus nde mbli naro xaꞌ le Dios. Nde reta men jwanꞌ mbwiꞌ jwanꞌ ngok, no xaꞌ mbli naro xaꞌ le Dios.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Jesus nde Zaqueo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Lo ngote Jesus len' yez Jerico, ndaridndab Jesus lenꞌ yez, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />nde tya nzo thi mbiꞌ rik ndole Zaqueo, xaꞌ ya nak xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re xaꞌ nyaꞌb tmi low, <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />nde ncholaꞌs Zaqueo wiꞌ xaꞌ Jesus. Per naꞌgakta wiꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, tak bro thoz men nde Zaqueo xaꞌ lud xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Jwanꞌ nasa mkeꞌ xaꞌ karel, mziblo xaꞌ nde ngwap xaꞌ thi lo ya ndole sicomoro, sa toyal wiꞌ xaꞌ Jesus, tak tya ridndaꞌb Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Senꞌ ndarid Jesus tya, mblit lo Jesus lo ya nde mbwiꞌ Xaꞌ nzo Zaqueo lo ya, nde nchab Xaꞌ lo Zaqueo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:5">—Zaqueo nabanka bla, tak naya nakinꞌ kwed na liz la.<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zyasa leꞌ Zaqueo naban mbla xaꞌ, nde nale toz ngo lazoꞌ xaꞌ mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus liz xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ re men jwanꞌ reꞌ, mdobte narax mdodiꞌs xaꞌ xis Jesus nchab xaꞌ, Jesus nda sa kwed Jesus liz thi xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zyasa mdoli Zaqueo nde nchab Zaqueo lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:8">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, wiꞌ nea, reta jwanꞌ ngenon tan rola lo re xaꞌ prob; nde tez mbli wanꞌ na cho lo men, zireney masraꞌ thap gob.<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:9">—Naya mzin wiz lyaꞌ re men nzo yo re', lo ta no mbiꞌ reꞌ nde lo bin Abraham. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Tak Xin' Mbi' nde Xaꞌ sa kwan' Xaꞌ nde tola' Xaꞌ re men mdyaꞌb.<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent nagan chanꞌ tmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Laja nzi yon reta men jwanꞌ ndej Jesus, Jesus mdaꞌ thi kwent nagan lo xaꞌ, tak ndosin gaxla Jesus yez Jerusalen, nde re men ndli xgab leꞌ yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios ndosin gaxtirla. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:12">—Ngo thi xaꞌ ntak toz, mbro' nda tij lo xaꞌga xyon men, sa tya kayaꞌ xaꞌ yalnyebeꞌ ak xaꞌ rey, sera' bere xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Senꞌ teraꞌ ryoꞌ xaꞌ, mbrez xaꞌ siꞌ mos xaꞌ, nde mdaꞌ xaꞌ bro tmi lo kad thib mos, nde nchab xaꞌ lo mos: "Bli niꞌ go' tmi reꞌ sin', axta kebeꞌ beren." <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Per re men las xaꞌ, ngiꞌno men xaꞌ, nde mtelꞌ re men las xaꞌ pla men ndyaga tya, yayab: ꞌꞌNa'nchola'sta náꞌ xaꞌ reꞌ ak rey lo náꞌ.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Per mkayaꞌ xaꞌ yalnyebeꞌ ngok xaꞌ rey, nde senꞌ mbere xaꞌ las xaꞌ, mnebeꞌ xaꞌ kwes men re mos xaꞌ jwanꞌ mdaꞌyaꞌ xaꞌ tmi lonꞌ ya, sa nye xaꞌ, plopa mxyen tmin xa' lo mbli niꞌ mosa. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mos ner mbyeꞌd nde nchab: ꞌꞌXaꞌ nyebeꞌ, tmi mdaꞌa lon mxyena siꞌ gob masra'.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Leꞌ rey nchab lo mos: ꞌꞌWen toz mblia, thi mos wen nak la lo ta galꞌ mkea sinꞌ, lo jwanꞌ lud mdan loa, naya lilal na lu, xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo siꞌ yez.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Zyasa mbyeꞌd tedib mos nchab: ꞌꞌXaꞌ nyebeꞌ, tmi mdaꞌa lon, mxyena gayꞌ gob masra'.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Noga lo mos ya nchab xaꞌ: ꞌꞌLu nyebeꞌ lo gayꞌ yez.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Per mbyeꞌd tedib mos nchab lo rey: ꞌꞌXaꞌ nyebeꞌ, ncheꞌ tmin la, mchal na tmin la lo thi bayek nde mtobsaꞌney. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Tak nzyeb na lu, mnen, ne nak la, nyaꞌb la jwanꞌ namket la sinꞌ nde ndlit la jwan' ngok tenꞌ namblod la bin.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Zyasa nchab rey lo xaꞌ: ꞌꞌMos xkap, kon leꞌga xkiꞌs la koxyon la. Tez mneꞌa ne nak na, nyaꞌb na jwanꞌ namket na sinꞌ nde ndlit na jwan' ngok tenꞌ namblod na bin, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />¿Kwan ndliy sa namblot la tmin na yaꞌ xaꞌ nkeno tmi sinꞌ, sa senꞌ mberen ndaꞌyaꞌa tmin na kon xinꞌ neꞌy?ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Nde nchab rey lo xaꞌ nzi tya: Bkib goꞌ tmi yaꞌ mos reꞌ, nde pta' goꞌy lo mos jwanꞌ ta nden siꞌy. <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Zyasa mkab xaꞌ lo rey: ꞌꞌXaꞌ nyebeꞌ, ¡Per ndenla xaꞌ siꞌy! <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Per rey nchab: Nin lo goꞌ, xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngenolay, masra'y kayaꞌ xaꞌ, per xaꞌ nangenodey, axta jwanꞌ lud ngeno xaꞌ, yiꞌba yaꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Mbay re xaꞌ jwanꞌ ta ngiꞌno xa' na ba, xa' jwan' nancholaꞌsta ak na rey lo xaꞌ, deꞌno goꞌ xaꞌ ncheꞌya, nde bij goꞌ xaꞌ lon reꞌ.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ngote yez Jerusalen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Senꞌ mne nchab Jesus re jwanꞌ reꞌ, ndya Jesus yez Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Senꞌ ndo sin gax Jesus yez Betfage nde yez Betania, lad yiꞌ jwanꞌ ndole Oliv, zyasa mtelꞌ Jesus chop xin'te'd Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:30">—Wa goꞌ yez nzi lad tso ba, sen' yote go' len' yez yosal goꞌ thi bur teꞌ yen' ngedoꞌ, ma' tera tyob nek thib men. Bxak goꞌ ma' nde deꞌno goꞌ ma'. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nde tez cho men nyabdiꞌs lo goꞌ, kwan ndliy ngexak goꞌ bur, gus goꞌ lo xaꞌ, Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ nakinꞌ ma'.<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Zyasa ngwa rop xaꞌ, nde mzyal xaꞌ bur a xata nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Nde laja ngexak xaꞌ bur, xwanꞌ bur mna'bdi's lo xaꞌ, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:33">—¿Kwan ndliy ngexak goꞌ bur?<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Zyasa mkab xaꞌ nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:34">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ nakinꞌ ma'.<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Nde mbe' xaꞌ bur lo Jesus, mxob xaꞌ xab xaꞌ xis bur, nde mtob xaꞌ Jesus xis bur. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Nde xa nderidandab Jesus, taja ntogaꞌ men xab men lo ned. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Senꞌ ndo sin gax Jesus, par tyola Jesus yiꞌ Oliv, zyasa reta xaꞌ ndanke xis Jesus mdobte ne mbrez xaꞌ tak nale nzo lazoꞌ xaꞌ nde ndaꞌ xaꞌ dyux lo Dios, por reta yalnaro jwanꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ mbli Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Nde nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:38">—¡Nayon nak Rey jwanꞌ nde lo le Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ! ¡Yalnabe'z lo be' nde naro toz nak Dios lo beꞌ!<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Zyasa pla xaꞌ fariseo jwanꞌ nzo xij re men nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:39">—Maestr, brez yek re xaꞌ ta ndenke xis la.<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:40">—Leꞌ na ni lo goꞌ, tez re xa' re' nakwesta xa', re ke ba kwes.<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Senꞌ mzin Jesus gax yez Jerusalen, lo mbwiꞌ Jesus yez, mbinꞌno Jesus yez, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />nde nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:42">—¡Tez goꞌ men Jerusalen, tez ngaka na wiz reꞌ nye goꞌ cho taꞌ yalnabeꞌz lo goꞌ! Per naya nzo nagasa, nde naꞌakta wiꞌ goꞌy. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Per yeꞌd wiz nathoz par goꞌ, re xaꞌ ngi'no goꞌ, dib nchek yez la kwek xa' yo nde kwetowꞌ xaꞌ lo go'. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Nde thibtane lux reta goꞌ, kon re xinꞌ goꞌ, nde tub xaꞌ reta pto nde naꞌyanta nek thib ke xis ta ke, tak naꞌntakbeꞌd go' tyemp jwanꞌ senꞌ mbyeꞌdtna Dios goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mblote re xaꞌ ntho jwanꞌ lo len yodoꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Zyasa ngote Jesus lo len yodoꞌ, nde mdobte mbloꞌte Jesus re xaꞌ ntho, nde re xaꞌ ndiꞌ tya. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:46">—Lo xkiꞌs Dios ngeni: ꞌꞌLiz na nak yo ten' todi'sno men naꞌꞌ; per goꞌ mblilala yeꞌr ncho xaꞌ wanꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Nde reta wiz ndloꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo men, lo len yodoꞌ, leꞌ re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re nglweyꞌ, re maestr nchak xkiꞌs Dios, nde re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo yez, nkwanꞌ xaꞌ xamod kuj xaꞌ Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Per naꞌyosalta xa' xamod li xaꞌy, tak reta men leꞌka ntobnza xaꞌ nzi yon xkiꞌs Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Thib wiz senꞌ ngeloꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios nde ngetej Xa' di's wen chan' Dios lo re men lo len yodo', mzin re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re nglweyꞌ, re maestr nchak ley, nde re xaꞌ gox jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ lo yez, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />nde nchab xaꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:2">—Btej lo náꞌ, ¿kon cho yalnyebeꞌ ndlya re jwanꞌ reꞌ? ¿Cho mdaꞌ yalnyebeꞌ reꞌ loa?<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:3">—Noga na nyaꞌbdiꞌs lo goꞌ, mne go' lon: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />¿Cho mnebe' lo Juan ko'le Juan men? ¿Cho Diosa o mena?<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:5">—Tez gab na' Dios mtelꞌ Juan, nye Jesus lonꞌ, ꞌꞌ¿Kwan ndliy naꞌndlid lazoꞌ goꞌ jwanꞌ mbloꞌ Juan?ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Nde tez gab naꞌ, men mtelꞌ Juan, reta men gadke xaꞌ naꞌ nde kuj xaꞌ naꞌ, tak ndli lazo' xa' le' Juan nak thi profet.<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Zyasa mkab xaꞌ, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:7">—Naꞌnyed náꞌ cho mtelꞌ Juan. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Zyasa mkab Jesus lo xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:8">—Taga' na naꞌtejta na cho mdaꞌ yalnyebeꞌ lon lin re jwanꞌ reꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwent nagan chanꞌ xaꞌ nale'da nke sinꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Zyasa mdaꞌ Jesus tedib kwent nagan lo men, nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:9">—Ngo thi mbiꞌ jwanꞌ mblo bin lus ub, nde mtan'no xa'y kwent rol lo ya' men sa kenap mena. Nde mbroꞌ xaꞌ nda xaꞌ tij bro tyemp. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Senꞌ ngol tyemp dyop jwan' ngok, mtelꞌ xaꞌ biꞌ ya thi mos xaꞌ, sa ya naꞌb mos rol kosech jwanꞌ ndinꞌ kayaꞌ xaꞌ, lo xaꞌ ta ngenapa, per re xaꞌ ngenapa mdin xaꞌ mos nde tatanya mos mblo ned xaꞌ mos, ndya mos. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Xisa mtelꞌ xaꞌ tedib mos, per noga mos ya mtoti xaꞌ, mdin xaꞌ mos nde mbloꞌs xaꞌ mos, ngen kwan mdayaꞌ xaꞌ lo mos, tatanya mos mbloned xaꞌ mos. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Zyasa le' xwanꞌ lus ub bere mtelꞌ mbyon mos, per re xaꞌ ngenap lus ub, taga' mdin xaꞌ mos, nde mbloꞌte xaꞌ mos lo izyo tenꞌ nzo lus ub.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Zyasa, xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ lus ub mbli xaꞌ xgab: ꞌꞌ¿Kwan lin naya? Telꞌ na xinꞌ na jwanꞌ nkeꞌ toz lazoꞌn, ta'da senꞌ wiꞌ xa' or txoꞌbyek xaꞌ or.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Per senꞌ mbwiꞌ re xaꞌ ngenap lus ub, xinꞌ xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ lus ub, nchab xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ: ꞌꞌOr reꞌ yan'no reta jwanꞌ nak chanꞌ xud or, kuj naꞌ or, sa jwan' ndin' or, na' yan'noy.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Nde mbloꞌte xaꞌ or tenꞌ nzobin lus ub nde mbij xaꞌ or.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Zyasa mna'bdi's Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">—¿Cho xgab ndli goꞌ?, ¿kwan lino xaꞌ nak xwanꞌ lus ub re xaꞌ ya?<verse eid="LUK 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Yeꞌd xaꞌ nde kuj xaꞌ reta xaꞌ ngenap lus ub, nde taꞌ xa' lus ub kenap xaꞌga men.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Senꞌ mbin re xaꞌ nzi tya jwanꞌ reꞌ, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">—¡Ta nathoza lon' tez ta yatey!<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Per Jesus mbwiꞌ lo xaꞌ, nde nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:17">—¿Xamod nak jwanꞌ nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">Leꞌ ke jwanꞌ ta mblo'tal re xaꞌ ntaꞌ yo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">ke ya ngolal ke jwanꞌ mas ntak,<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Achoja men ryoꞌndaꞌb xis ke ya, tas men, nde tez ke gab xis men, toꞌy men.<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndablo yax tmi low</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Zyasa re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re nglweyꞌ nde re xaꞌ nak maestr nchak ley, ncholaꞌs xaꞌ tyen xaꞌ Jesus or yaga, tak mbyen xaꞌ ke reta kwent ta mdaꞌ Jesus xis xaꞌ ndey. Per naꞌngakta nden xaꞌ Jesus tak nzyeb xaꞌ re men nzi tya. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Zyasa re xaꞌ ya, mtelꞌ xaꞌ pla men sa ya laꞌs xaꞌ, nde li xaꞌ xaja men wena, sa li xaꞌ ni Jesus diꞌs naꞌleda, sa toyal keꞌ xaꞌ yalke yek Jesus nde toyal tayaꞌ xa' Jesus lo gobernador. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:21">—Maestr, mne náꞌ ke re jwanꞌ nia nde re jwanꞌ ndloꞌa naka jwanꞌ li nde nambit la men, galꞌ ndloꞌa xkiꞌs Dios lo men. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ptej lo náꞌ ¿Cho ndablo kix naꞌ tmi low lo Cesar o nandablode kix naꞌy?<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Per Jesus mnela xgab narax ndli xaꞌ, nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:23">—¿Kwan liy sa nchola's goꞌ tokan go' na? <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />Bloꞌ goꞌ thi tmi lon. ¿Cho lo xa' nde cho le xa' ta nge lo tmi ba?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Zyasa mkab xaꞌ, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">—Lo Cesar nde le Cesar nge lo neꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:25">—Ptaꞌ goꞌ lo Cesar jwanꞌ nak chanꞌ Cesar nde ptaꞌ goꞌ lo Dios jwanꞌ nak chanꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Nde naꞌnzalta xaꞌ thi di's xamod ngala Jesus, cheꞌla nzoyen xaꞌ lo jwanꞌ mkab Jesus nde xe mbre xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yalnyabdiꞌs chanꞌ ryoꞌxban men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Zyasa mbike pla xaꞌ Saduseo, jwanꞌ mbez ke nandryoꞌxbanta men ngujla tib gob; por jwanꞌ nasa ngwa nabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus nchab xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />—Maestr, Moises mkeꞌ lo yes: Tez thi xaꞌ biꞌ ndob ngol naꞌ gaj xaꞌ nde ngenta xinꞌ xaꞌ, leꞌga wes thabol ndablo ka ngol sal' thabol, sa gal or bix nde or bix ya, ak xinꞌ wes or jwanꞌ ta nguja. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Wiꞌ nea, ngo thi xaꞌ gaz wes xaꞌ, xaꞌ nera mselyaꞌ, per nguj xa', nde ngenta xinꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Leꞌ wes xaꞌ or yenꞌ jwanꞌ nde xis xaꞌ, mselyaꞌno ngol ta nguj sal' na'ya nde taga' ngalta xinꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Nde taga' or mbyon, mselyaꞌnor ngol nguj sal' na ya, per taga' ngenta xinꞌ or, nde taga' mbli temas wes or mselyaꞌnor ngol nguj sal' na' ya, per re gaz wes or nguj nde ngenta xinꞌ nek thib or. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Lulka no ngol ya nguj. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Mbay senꞌ ryoꞌxban re xaꞌ nguj, ¿Xanya xaꞌ ak salꞌ ngol ya, tez re gaz wes xa' mdobno ngol?<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Jesus nchab lo xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:34">—Re men lo izyo reꞌ, re xaꞌ biꞌ nde re ngol nselyaꞌ xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Per re xaꞌ jwanꞌ nzalꞌ ryoꞌxban lo yalguj sa gal xa' tedib izyo, naꞌselyaꞌtra xaꞌ, nde naꞌyotra yalselyaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />tak naꞌgajtraꞌ xaꞌ. Tak xaja re anj chanꞌ Diosa nak xaꞌ nde xinꞌ Dios nak xaꞌ lo mbroꞌxban xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Nde axta Moises ndloꞌ, ke re xaꞌ nguj ndryoꞌxban, ma tenꞌ nda'y kwent nchol yabxi'd, tya mni Dios lo Moises nchab: Na nak Dios chanꞌ Abraham, Dios chanꞌ Isaac nde Dios chanꞌ Jakob. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Nde Dios nanakta Dios chanꞌ re xaꞌ nguj, Dios nak chanꞌ re xaꞌ naban, tak par Dios reta men naban<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Zyasa pla maestr nchak ley, nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:39">—Maestr, jwin thoz mkab la.<verse eid="LUK 20:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Nde ngentra cho xa' ngoyek na' nabdi's lo Jesús.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">¿Cho xin' nak Crist?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mt. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mr. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Jesus lo re men:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:41">—¿Kwan liy mbez men Crist nde lo bin David? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Nde leꞌga David mkeꞌ lo libr chanꞌ Salmos, tenꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Dios nchab lo Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ lon:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">ꞌꞌPtob lad ban na,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Axta kebeꞌ lin sa re xaꞌ nayiꞌ loa ak xis jwanꞌ tyobnia.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />¿Xamod ye'd Crist lo bin David, tez le'ga' David mbez lo Xa', Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mni xis re maestr nchak ley</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Nde nzi yon reta men senꞌ nchab Jesus lo re xin'te'd Xaꞌ<verse eid="LUK 20:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />—Pkenap lazoꞌ goꞌ lo re maestr nchak ley, jwan' nak xa', ndyen xaꞌ gok xaꞌ lar nolꞌ, nde ndyen xaꞌ nawe ni men dyux lo xaꞌ lo xbiꞌ. Nde nkwanꞌ xaꞌ tyob xaꞌ ten' ndyob re men ntak lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, ndyen xa' tyob xa' tenꞌ ndyob re men ntak ten' ncho yalwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Nkib xaꞌ liz re ngol nguj sal' na', nde sa naꞌlo'd re jwanꞌ ndli xaꞌ, bro toz ndyodi'sno xaꞌ Dios. Re xaꞌ ya mas naro pen ya xa'.<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Tmi yon chanꞌ ngol prob nguj sal' na'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Lo ndo Jesus yodoꞌ, mblit lo xaꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ, xa ngo re xaꞌ rik tmi lenꞌ yin ncho tmi yon, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />nde mbwiꞌ Jesus noga' thi ngol prob nguj sal' na', mblo chop tmi cobr lenꞌ yin ncho tmi yon. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:3">—Nipa na lo goꞌ, le' ngol prob ta nguj sal' na' reꞌ, mdaꞌ mas broy ke lo reta xaꞌ mdaꞌ tmi, <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />tak reta men ndaꞌ tmi gon lo jwanꞌ ndryoxoꞌb lo xaꞌ, per ngol re' tenye lo ta prob xa', mdaꞌ xaꞌ reta tmi jwanꞌ nden xaꞌ par wa xa'.<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndej yub yodoꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Nde pla men nzi taꞌ kwent chanꞌ yodoꞌ, ndej xaꞌ re ke nawetoz nya ndaꞌ xna lo yodoꞌ nde re jwanꞌ yon mdaꞌ men mdoxkwaꞌ yodoꞌ. Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:<verse eid="LUK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />—Reta ke nawe nya ndo wiꞌ goꞌ naya, sin tib wiz senꞌ naꞌyanꞌta nek thib ke reꞌ xis ta ke, retay yub.<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwanꞌ ak senꞌ teraꞌ lux izyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs xa' lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:7">—Maestr, ¿Pol ak re jwanꞌ reꞌ? ¿Cho kwan loꞌ, lo sen' mbyentir ak re jwanꞌ reꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:8">— Ndawi' toz goꞌ, naꞌkwinꞌno xaꞌ goꞌ, tak naꞌr xaꞌ yeꞌd nde lirsinꞌ xaꞌ len, nye xaꞌ: ꞌꞌNa nak xaꞌ mtelꞌ Diosꞌꞌ; ꞌꞌse mzin wiza.ꞌꞌ Per naꞌtyonked goꞌ xis xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Nde senꞌ gon goꞌ nzo re byo nde re mayez yache yo kon re xa' nak sin', naꞌzyebta goꞌ, tak nakinꞌ ner re jwanꞌ reꞌ rid, per benꞌ teraꞌ sin lulka wiz.<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Nde noga' nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:10">—Thi yez keꞌ byo kon tediba' yez nde thi rey ke' byo kon tediba' rey. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Zyasa naꞌr ten' win re xo toz, yo win nde ye'dbe re yis ngoꞌ, nde lo beꞌ yo re jwanꞌ nathoz, nde loꞌ re jwanꞌ naro ak lo beꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Per senꞌ teraꞌ ak re jwanꞌ reꞌ, tyen men goꞌ, chubla xaꞌ goꞌ, we xaꞌ goꞌ lenꞌ yo tenꞌ ndyop xaꞌ Israel, nde we xaꞌ goꞌ lo re xaꞌ nak rey nde lo re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ yolow, ko xaꞌ goꞌ lizyiꞌb, kwent ndli lazoꞌ goꞌ na. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Tamod sa jwanꞌ reꞌ li sa tej goꞌ xkiꞌs na lo xa'. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Nde naꞌlid goꞌ xgab kwan kab goꞌ lo xaꞌ yolow, senꞌ ndo goꞌ lo xaꞌ, sa lya' go', <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Tak na ta re di's nde yalnchak lo go' kab go', jwan' nek thib xa' jwan' ngi'no go' nalid xa' gan tow' xa' lo xki's go', nde nekla zyal ten' tyobro xa'. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Per leꞌga xud goꞌ, leꞌga wes goꞌ, leꞌga ta goꞌ, nde leꞌga re xaꞌ nsal'ta goꞌ, tayaꞌ xaꞌ goꞌ nde kuj xaꞌ pla goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Reta men yiꞌno xaꞌ goꞌ, tak ndli lazoꞌ goꞌ na. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Per nek thib yisyek goꞌ ngen kwan tyak. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Btoli xgab goꞌ ne pto goꞌ, sa gal goꞌ yalnaban adiꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Per senꞌ wiꞌ goꞌ mzalꞌ sondad dib yez Jerusalen, zyasa mne goꞌ se mzin wiz lux yez Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Zyasa re xaꞌ nzo lo xyon Judea xyonꞌ xaꞌ ya xaꞌ re yiꞌ, nde re xaꞌ nzo lenꞌ yez, ryoꞌte xaꞌ tya nde re xaꞌ nzo wan naꞌyad xaꞌ lenꞌ yez. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Tak wiz ya nye xa' pen toz, sa ak reta jwanꞌ xa nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Nde wiz ya nalat toz yate re ngol jwanꞌ ndo lo yistan, nde re ngol jwanꞌ ngeno re mbed mey jwanꞌ nchuꞌ nis, tak pen toz rid reta men yez ya tak xyan chanꞌ Dios nde xis xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Zyasa bro men gaj lo byo, nde ti pla men we xaꞌ lizyiꞌb dib nax izyo, nde re xaꞌ nandlid lazoꞌn xkiꞌs Dios, nyebeꞌ xaꞌ yez Jerusalen axta senꞌ yaxoꞌb wiz taꞌ Dios diꞌs ak reta jwanꞌ reꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Senꞌ yeꞌd Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Zyasa loꞌ re jwanꞌ nathoz nya lo wiz, lo mbeꞌ nde lo re mbel lo beꞌ. Reta men nzo lo izyo gan yek men, nde jwanꞌ toz zyeb re men por nathoz toz tyez re bi nittoꞌ nde re bde nittoꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Nde re men axta kow xaꞌ zyeb xaꞌ, senꞌ li xaꞌ xgab re jwanꞌ ak lo izyo, tak re jwanꞌ nzi lo beꞌ win na. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Zyasa wiꞌ goꞌ Xin' Mbi', yeꞌd xa xij xkow kon yalne nde kon xni ro thoz. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Senꞌ tyobte ak re jwanꞌ reꞌ, blit yek goꞌ nde blone lazoꞌ goꞌ, tak mbyentirla lyaꞌ goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Zyasa mdaꞌ Jesus thi kwent nagan, nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:29">—Bwiꞌ goꞌ ya hig, o lo xaga' ya. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Senꞌ ngwiꞌ goꞌ ndoroꞌ la yenꞌ na, mne goꞌ ndo sin gaxla beꞌ yi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Tagaꞌ, senꞌ wiꞌ goꞌ ndoyak re jwanꞌ reꞌ, mne goꞌ ndo sin gax yalnyebeꞌ chanꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Nipa na lo goꞌ ke naꞌgajta men nzo naya, axta ke ak reta jwanꞌ reꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Beꞌ nde izyo tluxa per xkiꞌs na naꞌluxtay.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Pkenap go' lazoꞌ goꞌ lo re jwanꞌ narax nzo lo izyo reꞌ, lo yalguy, lo re jwan' nda' xgab yek go', sa list nzi go' sen' sin wiz ya. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Tak wiz ya yeꞌd xaja ti koꞌ xis reta men nzo lo izyo reꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Jwanꞌ nasa bresaꞌ goꞌ, nde thibla btodi'sno go' Dios, sa ne nzo lazoꞌ goꞌ lo lyaꞌ goꞌ lo re jwanꞌ ak nde sa li goꞌ gan tyoli goꞌ lo Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Dib ndlyabe ndloꞌ Jesus xkiꞌs Dios lo men lo len yodoꞌ, leꞌ senꞌ ndlya yalꞌ nda Jesus yiꞌ ni xaꞌ Oliv, tya nchanꞌ Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Nde tilꞌ toz nda re men lo len yodoꞌ, sa gon xaꞌ xkiꞌs Dios ndloꞌ Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Nkwanꞌ xaꞌ xa kuj xaꞌ Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Senꞌ ndo sin gaxla ni jwanꞌ ncha xaꞌ pan nanchod lebadur, ni ya ndole Pask. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Leꞌ re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ, nde re maestr nchak ley, nkwanꞌ xaꞌ xamod kuj xaꞌ Jesus, tak nzyeb xaꞌ re ma yez.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Zyasa mbla Maxuꞌ lazoꞌ Judas xa' ndole Iscariote, jwanꞌ no nak xin'te'd Jesus ta ndenta re thib sen xa' ya. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Nde ngwa Judas lo re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ nde lo re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re xaꞌ ngenap yodoꞌ, sa todiꞌsno Judas xaꞌ, sa nyenꞌ xamod taꞌyaꞌ Judas Jesus lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nale toz ngo lazoꞌ re xaꞌ, nde nchab xaꞌ taꞌ xaꞌ tmi lo Judas. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Le' Judas mxeyal nde mdobte xa' mkwanꞌ xa' xamod taꞌyaꞌ xa' Jesus, senꞌ na'ngenta men.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mnabeꞌ tyoxkwaꞌ rzyeꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Senꞌ mzin wiz ncha xaꞌ pan nanchod lebadur, nde wiz ya ndablo kuj xaꞌ mbakxilꞌ yen', par ni pask. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Jesus mbloned Pedr nde Juan, nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:8">—Wa toxkwaꞌ goꞌ jwanꞌ wa rzyenꞌ ni pask.<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:9">—¿Plo ncholaꞌs la toxkwaꞌ naꞌy?<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Jesus mkab nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:10">—Senꞌ lya go' lenꞌ yez Jerusalen yosal goꞌ thi xaꞌ biꞌ jwanꞌ neꞌ thi re nzo nit. Ptonke goꞌ xis xaꞌ axta sin goꞌ yo tenꞌ yote xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />nde gab goꞌ lo xwanꞌ yo: ꞌꞌLeꞌ Maestr ne: ¿Plo ndob yo tenꞌ wa rzyeꞌn kon re xin'te'd na, rzyeꞌ chanꞌ pask?ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Zyasa loꞌ xaꞌ thi yo ro lo goꞌ, jwanꞌ ndob xtaꞌ gap, nde tya nzila re jwanꞌ nakinꞌ goꞌ, tya ptoxkwaꞌ goꞌ rzyeꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Zyasa ngwa rop xaꞌ nde mzyal xaꞌ retay a xata nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ, nde mtoxkwaꞌ xaꞌ rzyeꞌ par wa xaꞌ ni pask.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Senꞌ mzin hor wa rzyeꞌ xaꞌ, mdob Jesus kon re thib sen xin'te'd Jesus ro mes. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:15">—¡Jwanꞌ toz ndonkeꞌn wan rzyeꞌ chanꞌ pask reꞌ kon goꞌ, nal tera riꞌdndaꞌb na yalti! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Tak nin lo goꞌ ke naꞌwartraney tedib gob axta kebeꞌ akpey tenꞌ nyebeꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Zyasa mxen Jesus kop nde mdaꞌ Jesus dyux lo Dios, nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:17">—Bxen goꞌ kop reꞌ guꞌ goꞌy nde bdiꞌd goꞌy lo ta goꞌ; <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Tak nin lo goꞌ naꞌgutra na jwan' nda' lus ub, axta kebeꞌ sin wiz nyebeꞌ Dios.<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Mxen na' Jesus pan nde mdaꞌ Xa' dyux lo Dios nde mbli rol Xa' pan nde mda' Xa'y lo re xin'te'd Xa', nde nchab Xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:19">—Jwanꞌ reꞌ nak belꞌ na, jwanꞌ tayan por goꞌ, bli goꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ sa telaꞌs goꞌ na.<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Senꞌ mne mda rsyeꞌ xaꞌ, mxen Jesus kop nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:20">—Kop reꞌ nak nakub mda' Dios xki's Dios, jwan' mblí di's kon ren na, ren jwanꞌ xyo por goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Per naya, yaꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ taꞌyaꞌn lo re xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngiꞌno na, yaꞌ xaꞌ ya nzo'b lo mes kon yan'. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Naya leꞌ Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ nakinꞌ riꞌd Xa' xata mbyan'la aka, per ¡Nalat nya xaꞌ jwanꞌ taꞌya' Xa'!<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Zyasa mdobte re xin'te'd Jesus mnabdiꞌs lo re ta xaꞌ, xanya xa' ta li ya.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xaꞌ mas ntak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Zyasa re xin'te'd Jesus, mdobte mdodiꞌs xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ nchab xaꞌ: "¿Cho xaꞌ mas ntak?" <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:25">—Re xaꞌ nak rey, nchak naro xaꞌ lo re yalnyebeꞌ ngeno xaꞌ, nde re xaꞌ yolow ncholaꞌs xaꞌ re ma yez xoꞌbyek men xaꞌ, nde re xaꞌ ngeno bro yalnyebeꞌ, ndli xaꞌ sa gab men lo xaꞌ, "xaꞌ ndla'sto men nak go'." <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Per goꞌ nandabloda li goꞌ mod ya, che'la xa' mas xa' gox xij go', ndablo ak xa' xaja xa' yen' na, nde xaꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ nakinꞌ ak xaja xaꞌ ndli sinꞌ lo ta men na'. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Tak ¿Cho mas ntak, cho xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndyob ro mes way o xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngo mesa? ¿Cho na'naktey xa' jwan' ndyob ro mes way? Per na ndo ncheꞌya xaja xaꞌ ngo mes.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Nde goꞌ thibla nzi goꞌ kon na lo re yalti mbriꞌd na. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Jwanꞌ nasa, na ta yalnyebeꞌ lo goꞌ, ta xa mdaꞌ Xud na yalnyebeꞌ lon, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />nde tyob go' ro mes na sa wa go' nde gu goꞌ sen' ndob nyebeꞌn, nde tyob goꞌ tenꞌ ndyob re rey sa koxyo goꞌ re thib sen bin xaꞌ Israel.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus nchab, Pedr gab nancholot Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Noga' nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:31">—Simon, maxuꞌ mnaꞌb lo Dios sa tokan xaꞌ goꞌ, xaja men mbib triga. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Per na mnaꞌb lo Dios por lu, sa naꞌlat la xkiꞌs Dios jwanꞌ ndli lazoꞌa. Nde lu, senꞌ mberea lon tedib gob, la'stoa temas re men ndli lazonꞌ na sa tyo ne xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Le' Pedr nchab lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:33">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, toyal na yan lizyiꞌb kon lu nde axta gaj na kon lu.<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Nde Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:34">—Pedr, na ni loꞌa, leꞌga naya, benꞌ tera kwez ngidteꞌ, mbyonla gob gab la nanzolod la na.<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndozin gax ak re yalti jwanꞌ nakinꞌ ak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Nde Jesus mnabdiꞌs lo xaꞌ, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">—Senꞌ mtelꞌ na goꞌ, nangwed go' tmi neka bed, neka tedib ned yalyid goꞌ, ¿cho ngok jwad jwanꞌ nakinꞌ goꞌ zya?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Zyasa mkab re xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">—Ngen kwan ngok jwad lo náꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:36">—Per naya, xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngeno bed, che' ndablo we xaꞌy, nde taga' xaꞌ nden tmi we xaꞌy, nde xaꞌ jwanꞌ nangenoda espad, ndablo tho xaꞌ chamar xaꞌ sa tiꞌ xaꞌ thiba. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Tak nin lo goꞌ, nakinꞌ ri'd na reta jwanꞌ nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios, tenꞌ nchab: "mblino xaꞌ xaꞌ, xaja thi xaꞌ jwanꞌ mbli jwanꞌ naraxa." Tak ndablo ri'd na reta jwan' nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios.<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">—Xaꞌ nyebeꞌ, ncheꞌ nzo chop espad.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Jesus mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">—Naꞌtodisꞌta naꞌ jwanꞌ reꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndodiꞌsno Dios tenꞌ ndole Getsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Nde mbroꞌ Jesus nda Jesus yiꞌ Oliv tenꞌ nchaga Jesus, nde re xin'te'd Jesus mdonke xa' xis Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Senꞌ mzin Jesus tya, nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:40">—Mnaꞌb goꞌ lo Dios sa naꞌtokanta maxuꞌ goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Zyasa mbike Jesus tib lad, xapa tenꞌ nzin thi ke ta ngobi mena, nde tya mdoxub Jesus sa todiꞌsno Jesus Dios. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Nde nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:42">—Xud na, tez ncholaꞌs la, ptola'n lo re yalti toz reꞌ, per nagaktey xa ncholas na, aka xa ncholaꞌs la.<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Zyasa mbroꞌto thi anj mbro' lo be', mblo ne lazoꞌ Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Nde lo ta nabil toz nzo lazo' Jesus, masra dib fwerz Jesus mnaꞌb Jesus lo Dios. Nde lon jwan' ndryo' lo Jesus xaja zun' rena nchaba izyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Senꞌ mne mdodiꞌsno Jesus Dios mdoli Jesus, nda Xaꞌ tenꞌ nzi re xin'te'd Xaꞌ, nde ngosi'b Xa' reta xin' te'd Xaꞌ nziyat, tak nabil toz nzo lazoꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:46">—¿Kwan ndliy nziyat goꞌ? Goche goꞌ nde mnaꞌb goꞌ lo Dios, sa na'ganta xgab goꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mxen xaꞌ Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Tata benꞌ ndotodiꞌs Jesus, senꞌ mzin bro toz men. Nde xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndole Judas, xa' jwanꞌ nak ta thib sen xin'te'd Jesus, nda siblo lo reta men. Zyasa mbike Judas gax lo Jesus nde mda Judas chut kwat Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />per Jesus nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:48">—Judas, ¿cho kon thi chut taꞌyaꞌa Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ re xaꞌ nzino Jesus re jwanꞌ ndoyak, zyasa mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:49">—Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ, ¿cho ndablo keꞌ naꞌy cho xaꞌ kon espad?<verse eid="LUK 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Nde thib xaꞌ jwanꞌ nzino Jesus, mpchoꞌ nza ban thi xaꞌ nak mos nglweyꞌ ro. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:51">—Blaꞌ goꞌ xaꞌ, baja mney.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:51">Nde mbwal Jesus nza mos nde mtodanꞌ Jesus nza xa'. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo re nglweyꞌ jwan' nyebe' nde re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re xaꞌ nkenap yodoꞌ nde lo re xaꞌ gox jwanꞌ nde sa we xa' Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:52">—¿Goꞌ nde kon espad nde kon ya, sa tyen goꞌ na xaja ndyen men thi xaꞌ wanꞌ na? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Senꞌ reta wiz mbrenon goꞌ lo len yodoꞌ, nde naꞌndenta goꞌ na. Per naya nak hor chanꞌ goꞌ, tyen goꞌ na, tak naya nde yalne chanꞌ yalꞌkow.<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pedr gab nanzolod xa' Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Zyasa mxen xaꞌ Jesus nde mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus liz nglweyꞌ ro. Nde Pedr tij, tij, ndanke xisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Nde mtolꞌ xaꞌ ki xtowꞌ lo le, nde mdob xaꞌ dib ro, nde no Pedr mdob xij xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Zyasa thi ngol ndli sin' yo, lo mbwiꞌ ngol ndob Pedr tenꞌ ndoyol ki, xe mbwiꞌ ngol lo Pedr, nde nchab ngol:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:56">—No xaꞌ biꞌ reꞌ mketenke xis Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Per Pedr mka's, nde nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:57">—Ngol, nanzolot na xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Tudla ndate mbwiꞌ tediba xaꞌ Pedr nde nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">—Noa nak thi men Jesus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Pedr mkab, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">—Naktey na.<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Mbriꞌd thib hor pa, tediba xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:59">—Gal' di's no xaꞌ reꞌ ndo kon Jesus, tak xaꞌ yez Galilea xa'.<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Per Pedr nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">—Naꞌnyet na kwan ndej goꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Nde tata benꞌ ndotodiꞌs Pedr, mbrez ngidteꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Zyasa mbyek Jesus mbwiꞌ Jesus lo Pedr, nde mtelaꞌs Pedr jwanꞌ nchab Jesus lo Pedr: Ben' tera' kwez ngidteꞌ, mbyonla gob gab la nanzolod la na. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Zyasa mbroꞌte Pedr tya, nde jwanꞌ toz nabil mbinꞌ Pedr.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nxino xaꞌ Jesus nde mkeꞌ xaꞌy cho Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Nde re xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngenap Jesus, nxino xaꞌ Jesus nde ngin xaꞌ Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Nde mtowꞌ xaꞌ ngudlo Jesus, mke' xa'y lo Jesus nde mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:64">—Tez naye'a, ptej cho mkeꞌy choa!<verse eid="LUK 22:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Nde anta che'pa naxin mbrez xaꞌ lo Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo re xaꞌ ngeno yalnyebe' ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Senꞌ mduxni tedib wiz, mketa reta xaꞌ gox jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ lo xaꞌ Israel, re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ nde re maestr jwanꞌ nchak ley, mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo junt chanꞌ re xaꞌ ngeno yalnyebe' ro. Tya mnabdiꞌs xaꞌ lo Jesus:<verse eid="LUK 22:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />—Ptej lo náꞌ, ¿Cho lu nak Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Jesus, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">—Tez nin lo goꞌ, nay, pa li lazoꞌ goꞌy. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Nde tez nyaꞌbdiꞌs na lo goꞌ, pa kab goꞌ lon, neka laꞌ goꞌ na. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Per naya leꞌ Xinꞌ Mbiꞌ, tyob lad ban Dios jwanꞌ ngeno reta yalnyebeꞌ ro.<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Zyasa reta xaꞌ mnabdiꞌs lo Jesus, nchab xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">—¿Cho lu nak Xinꞌ Dios?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Jesus mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">—Mne go' sa wi', le'ga goꞌ ndotej ke nay.<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:71">—¿Wenraꞌ na' kwanꞌ naꞌ men tej lonꞌ nchap Xaꞌ yalke? Yub naꞌ mbin ke le'ga ro Xaꞌ mbroꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Zyasa mdoli reta xaꞌ, nde mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo Pilat. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Nde mdobte mkeꞌ xaꞌ yalke yek Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:2">—Mbi' re' ngoga lo náꞌ, ngetoxol Xa' re men las náꞌ. Mbez Xaꞌ lo men, nandabloda kix náꞌ tmi low lo Cesar, nde mbloꞌro Xaꞌ, mbez Xaꞌ, le' Xaꞌ nak Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios, nde rey nak Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Pilat lo Jesus, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">—¿Cho lu nak Rey lo re xaꞌ Judi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">—Jesus mkab, nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">—Le'ga lu ndoteja.<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Zyasa nchab Pilat lo re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ nde lo re men nzi tya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:4">—Nekthib yalke naꞌnzalta na nchap mbiꞌ reꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Per mas ne ro re xaꞌ, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:5">—Nyaga ndli xa' nchak xol' reta men dib Judea, xata mdobte Xa' axta Galilea nde naya axta nche' ngoxob Xa' ngetote'd re men.<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo Herodes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Senꞌ mbin Pilat jwanꞌ reꞌ, zyasa mnabdiꞌs Pilat nchab Pilat:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:6">—¿Cho xaꞌ Galilea mbiꞌ reꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Nde senꞌ mbin Pilat ke Jesus nak xaꞌ yez tenꞌ nyebe' Herodes, zyasa mtelꞌ Pilat Jesus lo Herodes, tak lenꞌ wiz ya noga Herodes mbya yez Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ Herodes Jesus, jwanꞌ toz ngo nale lazoꞌ xa', tak ndala ncholaꞌs xa' wiꞌ xa' Jesus, tak nchon xa' nda' men kwent chan' Jesus nde ndombed xa' wiꞌ xa' li Jesus thi yalnaro. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Herodes naꞌr jwanꞌ lo Jesus, per ngen kwan nkab Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ nde re maestr nchak ley ta nzi tya, anega ndo xa' ngeke' xa' yalke yek Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Zyasa Herodes nde kon re sondad xaꞌ, mblotal xaꞌ Jesus nde par xiꞌno xaꞌ Jesus mbwok xaꞌ Jesus thi lar wen nde bere mtelꞌ Herodes Jesus lo pilat tedib gob. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Nde lenꞌ wiz ya bere mzalꞌta Pilat kon Herodes tedib gob, tak mas pola nanzal'ta xki's rop xa'.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdaya' xa' Jesús sa gaj Jesús</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Zyasa mbrez Pilat re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ, re xaꞌ ngeno yalnyebeꞌ nde re ma yez, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />nde nchab Pilat lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:14">—Goꞌ ndeno mbiꞌ re lon, mbez goꞌ xaꞌ ntoxol re men, per naya nzi wiꞌ goꞌ mnabdiꞌs na lo xaꞌ, nde naꞌyosalta na nek thib yalke jwanꞌ nkeꞌ goꞌ yek xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Nde noga' Herodes naꞌngazalta xa' nek thib yalke mbli mbiꞌ reꞌ, jwanꞌ nasa mzire Herodes xaꞌ lon tedib gob. Per ngen cho jwanꞌ narax mbli mbiꞌ reꞌ par gaj xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Senꞌ mne mdin na Xa', lan Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Nde reta lin' len' ni, nakin' la' xa' thi xa' jwan' nge lizyi'b. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Zyasa reta xaꞌ nzi tya mdobte ne toz mbrez xaꞌ, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:18">—¡Blaꞌ diꞌs gaj mbiꞌ reꞌ nde blaꞌ Barrabas!<verse eid="LUK 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Tak Barrabas nge lizyiꞌb kwent mtoxol xaꞌ men xis xaꞌ nak sin' nde mbij xaꞌ thi men. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Per Pilat mni lo xaꞌ tedib gob, tak Pilat ncholaꞌs laꞌ Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Nde reta men masra ne toz mbrez xaꞌ, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:21">—¡Pkeꞌ Xaꞌ lo cruz! ¡Pkeꞌ Xaꞌ lo cruz!<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Zyasa ngo xob mbyon gob mni Pilat lo xaꞌ nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:22">—Per ¿cho jwanꞌ narax mbli mbiꞌ reꞌ? Naꞌyozalta na nek thib jwanꞌ narax mbli Xaꞌ sa gaj Xaꞌ. Senꞌ mne mdin na Xa', lan Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Per re men ne ro xaꞌ masra' ne toz mbrez xaꞌ, mnaꞌb xaꞌ sa keꞌ Pilat Jesus lo kruz, nde por lo ne toz mbez xaꞌ, mbli xaꞌ gan, mbli Pilat jwanꞌ ncholaꞌs xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Zyasa mnebeꞌ Pilat ak axaja ncholaꞌs re xaꞌ ya. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Zyasa mdaꞌ Pilat di's mbroꞌte Barrabas, xaꞌ jwanꞌ nge lizyiꞌb kwent mtoxol' xa' re men xis xaꞌ nak sin' nde mbij xaꞌ men nde mdayaꞌ Pilat Jesus axaja ncholaꞌs re xaꞌ ya.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mke' xaꞌ Jesus lo kruz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Senꞌ mbeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus sa keꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo kruz, zyasa thi xaꞌ yez Cirene ndole Simon, jwanꞌ ndobere ndya ngwa sin', mnibeꞌ sondad lo xaꞌ mxoꞌbyen xaꞌ kruz, mbeꞌ xaꞌy nde ndanke xaꞌ xis Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Nde men toz ndanke xis Jesus nde re ngol jwanꞌ toz tir mbez ngol nchonꞌno ngol Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Per Jesus mbwiꞌ lo re ngolꞌ nde nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:28">—Men got yez Jerusalen, naꞌgonod goꞌ na, che'la leꞌga goꞌ bin'no go' nde bin'no re xinꞌ goꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Tak tsin wiz senꞌ gab men: ꞌꞌWen nda re ngol jwanꞌ na'nkeloda xinꞌ naꞌ nde re ngol jwanꞌ namxanta mbed, nekla mdaꞌ nis nguꞌ mbed.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Zyasa tyobte gab re men re lo yiꞌ: ꞌꞌGob xis náꞌ,ꞌꞌ nde lo re kox, ꞌꞌBwot xis náꞌ.ꞌꞌ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Tez ta ndlino xaꞌ ya yeba, ¿cho leta ya bis, xa lino xa'y?<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Nde noga mbeꞌ xaꞌ chop xaꞌ xkap, sa thita kuj xa' xa' kon Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Senꞌ mzin xaꞌ tenꞌ ndole "Zij yek men," tya mkeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo kruz, nde kon rop xaꞌ xkapa: thib xaꞌ mkeꞌ xaꞌ lad ban Jesus nde tedib xaꞌ mkeꞌ xaꞌ lad beg Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Zyasa nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">—Xud na, btonꞌ xken xaꞌ, tak naꞌnyed xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndli xaꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Nde re sondad, mblibe' xaꞌ xis xab Jesus sa nyenꞌ xanya xaꞌ ndinꞌ yan'noy. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Nde men nzi tya nzi wiꞌ xa', nde axta re xaꞌ nyebeꞌ yolow nxino xaꞌ Jesus nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:35">—Mtola' Xaꞌ xaꞌga re men, xa na'naya tolaꞌ Xaꞌ leꞌga leꞌ Xaꞌ, tez lipa nak Xaꞌ, Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios nde Xaꞌ mblí Dios.<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Noga re sondad nxino xaꞌ Jesus nde mbike xaꞌ gax tenꞌ nge Jesus sa taꞌ xaꞌ nit ub ni gu Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />nde nchab xaꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:37">—¡Tez lu nak Rey lo re xa' judi, le' ptolaꞌ lazo'a.<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Nde mkeꞌ xaꞌ thi letr a'yek Jesus, jwan' nge diꞌs grieg, diꞌs latin nde diꞌs hebreo, nchab: ꞌꞌXAꞌ REꞌ NAK REY LO RE XAꞌ JUDI.ꞌꞌ<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Nde thib xaꞌ xkap nge lo cruz cho Jesus mnixin xaꞌ lo Jesus, nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:39">—Tez nak la xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios, le' ptolaꞌ lazo'a nde btolaꞌ náꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Le' tedib xaꞌ xkap jwanꞌ nge tedib lad cho Jesus, mbrez xa' yek ta xa':</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:40">—¿Cho nanzyebta la Dios, ta thita yalti ndoriꞌd re yon naꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Per rop naꞌ nzal'ka na' rid naꞌ re yalti reꞌ, por re jwanꞌ narax mbli naꞌ; per mbiꞌ reꞌ namblid Xaꞌ nek thib jwanꞌ narax.<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ lo Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:42">—Jesus, telaꞌs la na senꞌ tyobtea nyebeꞌa.<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Jesus mkab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:43">—Nipa na loa, thita kwen' lo beꞌ na wiz.<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguj Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Nde a rolja wiz mbla yalꞌkow dib izyo, axta hor mbyon bzyeba. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Nde mdo' wiz, nde lar jwanꞌ nge len' yodoꞌ, a rolja mcheda ngok chop ley. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Zyasa ne mbrez Jesus, nde nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:46">— Xud na, lo ya'a tayan xbin na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:46">Nde senꞌ mne nchab Jesus jwanꞌ reꞌ, nguj Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Senꞌ mbwiꞌ xaꞌ nyebeꞌ lo re sondad jwan' ngok, mblinaro xaꞌ le Dios, nde nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:47">—Lipa mbiꞌ reꞌ ngok Xaꞌ thi mbi' gal'.<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Nde reta men jwanꞌ nzi tya, mbwiꞌ xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ ngok, mbere xa' yez, nginya' xaꞌ lazoꞌ xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Le' re xaꞌ jwanꞌ ncholo Jesus, nde re ngol jwanꞌ xata jwan' mdonke xis Jesús xata mbro' xa' Galilea, tij mbre re xa' mbwi' xa' reta jwan'.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mka's xaꞌ Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Ngo thi mbiꞌ wen nde galꞌ nak ndole Jose, xaꞌ yez Arimatea lo xyon Judea. Nde no xaꞌ nak xaꞌ nyebeꞌ ro lo re xaꞌ Israel. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Per nanda'd ro xaꞌ lo re xaꞌ ta mtoti Jesus, tak xaꞌ ngembed sin yalnyebeꞌ chan' Dios, <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />zyasa ngwa xaꞌ lo Pilat nde mnaꞌb xaꞌ thabol Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Senꞌ ngolo mbla xaꞌ thabol Jesus lo cruz, mchal lar xaꞌ Xa' nde mka's xaꞌ Xa' lenꞌ baꞌ jwanꞌ mdenꞌ xaꞌ lad ke, tenꞌ tera' ga's nek thib men. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Nde wiz ya nak wiz ntoxkwaꞌ xaꞌ jwanꞌ wa xaꞌ lenꞌ wiz ndryoꞌxkwen xaꞌ, nde tud la ndab tyobte wiz ya.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Nde no re ngol jwanꞌ mbro'no Jesus Galilea, mdonke ngol nde mbwiꞌ ngol baꞌ tenꞌ mka's xa' Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Senꞌ mbere re ngol yo, mtoxkwaꞌ ngol aseyt nde pomad naxeꞌ ndyaꞌ. Nde mbroꞌxkwen xaꞌ wiz jwan' ndryoꞌxkwen men Israel, xata nyebeꞌ ley chan' Moisés.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Jesus mbroꞌxban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Wiz ner xan' sman, til' toz ngwa re ngol ro baꞌ, nde mbeꞌ ngol re aseyt naxeꞌ jwanꞌ mdoxkwaꞌ ngol. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Senꞌ mzin re ngol tya, mbwiꞌ ngol leꞌ ke jwanꞌ ta nowꞌ ro baꞌ ya, mbikey tib lad nde ndoxalꞌ ro baꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />lo senꞌ ngote ngol len' baꞌ naꞌngazalta ngol thabol Jesus Xaꞌ Nyebeꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Le'ka mbli ngol xgab nyed ngol kwan li ngol nde xaj mbwiꞌ ngol chop xaꞌ biꞌ ndoli gax lo ngol, nok lar ndlyabel nya. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Zyasa jwanꞌ toz mzyeb ngol, nde mbla yek ngol axta mdin' yek ngol izyo, le' rop xaꞌ biꞌ ya, nchab lo ngol:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:5">—¿Kwan ndliy nkwanꞌ goꞌ Xaꞌ naban xij xaꞌ nguj? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ngenta Xaꞌ ncheꞌya, leꞌ Xaꞌ mbroꞌxbanla. Ptelaꞌs goꞌ jwanꞌ ne Xaꞌ lo goꞌ, senꞌ benꞌ nzo Xaꞌ lo xyon Galilea, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />ne Xaꞌ lo goꞌ: Xin' Mbi', nakinꞌ tayaꞌ xaꞌ Xa' lo yaꞌ re xaꞌ nzoꞌb xken naꞌ, nde keꞌ xa' Xa' lo kruz, per senꞌ yaxoꞌb son wiz ryoꞌxban Xa'.<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Zyasa mtelaꞌs ngol re diꞌs jwanꞌ nchab Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />nde senꞌ mbere ngol ngwa ngol ro baꞌ, zyasa mdej ngol reta jwanꞌ ngok lo re siꞌbthib xin'te'd Jesus nde lo temasra' men. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Nde re xa' ya nak Mari Magdalen, ngol ndole Juan, Mari xnaꞌ Jakob, nde tipla ngol. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Per re xin'te'd Jesus, mbli xaꞌ xgab mdya'b yek ngol lo ta ndyodi's ngol, nde naꞌndlid lazoꞌ xaꞌy.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Le' Pedr zyaga ngwa karel ngwa wiꞌ ro baꞌ; nde senꞌ mbwiꞌ Pedr lenꞌ baꞌ, benꞌta lar jwanꞌ mchal Jesus nax tya, zyasa mbere Pedr yo nde jwanꞌ toz nzoyen Pedr jwanꞌ ngok.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mbro'to lo chop xa' ned nda Emaus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lega wiz ya, chop xin'te'd Jesus, ndo ned nda yez ndole Emaus, nde yez Emaus nchanꞌ chopka hor tenꞌ nax yez Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Nde rop xaꞌ ya ndatodiꞌs xaꞌ reta jwanꞌ ngok. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Nde laj ndatodiꞌs xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ, Jesus mbike gax lo xa' nde thita nda xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />per mkal ngud lo xa' sa naꞌyolod xaꞌ Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Jesus lo xaꞌ nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">—¿Cho jwan' taja ndetodiꞌs goꞌ nde kwan ndliy nabil nzo lazoꞌ goꞌ? <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Nde thi xaꞌ jwanꞌ ndole Cleofas, mkab nchab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:18">—¿Cho thita lu xaꞌ thiblad yez Jerusalen naꞌnyet reta jwanꞌ ngok lenꞌ yez Jerusalen na lenꞌ wiz reꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Zyasa mnabdiꞌs Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">—¿Cho kwan ngok?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Le' xaꞌ mkab:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">—Náꞌ ndetodiꞌs re jwanꞌ ngote Jesus Nazaret, Xaꞌ mtorid xkiꞌs Dios lo men, ngeno Xa' yalne lo re jwan' ndli Xa', lo Dios nde lo reta men. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Nde re nglweyꞌ jwanꞌ nyebeꞌ nde re xaꞌ jwanꞌ ngeno yalnyebeꞌ lo yez, mdayaꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo re men sa kuj xa' Jesus, nde mkeꞌ xaꞌ Jesus lo kruz. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Le' náꞌ mbli xgab ke Jesus ak xaꞌ tolaꞌ re náꞌ xaꞌ Israel lo yaꞌ re xaꞌ yez Rom, per naya ngokla son wiz ngok re jwanꞌ na. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Nde pla ngol jwanꞌ mkete xij náꞌ, le'ka nzoyen náꞌ jwanꞌ mdej ngol, lo ngwa ngol ro baꞌ na tilꞌ reꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />nde naꞌngazalta ngol thabol Jesus, senꞌ mbere ngol mdaꞌ ngol kwent lo náꞌ ke pla anj mbro'to lo ngol, nde nchab anj, le' Jesus naban xa'. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Xisa ngwa thipla men náꞌ ro baꞌ nde taga' xa ne re ngol ya lo náꞌ, taga' ne xaꞌ lo náꞌ, naꞌngwiꞌd xaꞌ Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:25">—¡Xaxka ne yek goꞌ nanchenta goꞌ, sa li lazoꞌ goꞌ re jwanꞌ nchab re profet! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />¿Chon nanakinꞌta rid Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios reta yalti reꞌ, sera' sa yote Xa' ten' li naro Dios Xa'?<verse eid="LUK 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nde mdobte mdej Jesus reta jwanꞌ nchab lo ley chanꞌ Moises, nde lo reta jwan' nke' re profet, nde re jwan' nchab xki's Dios, mblo'xkan Jesus xa nda'y kwent chan' Jesús lo xa'.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Senꞌ mzin xaꞌ yez tenꞌ nda xaꞌ, zyasa mbli Jesus xaja thi xaꞌ ndara mas tij. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Le' xa ya mna'b toz lo Jesus nchab xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">—Kwed la kon náꞌ, tak mzyela izyo, nde se ndela yalꞌ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">Zyasa ngote Jesus lenꞌ yo nde mbled Jesus kon xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Senꞌ ndob xaꞌ ro mes wa xaꞌ, mxen Jesus pan nde mdaꞌ Jesus dyux lo Dios, nde mbli rol Jesus pan nde mdiꞌd Jesus pan lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Axta zyara' mbi lo xaꞌ nde mbyolo xaꞌ Jesus, per hor yaga mti' Jesus lo xa'. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ lo ta xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:32">—¿Chon jwanꞌ nade axta ngo nale lazonꞌ senꞌ ndetodiꞌs xaꞌ lonꞌ ned nde ngoꞌxkan xaꞌ re xkiꞌs Dios jwanꞌ nge lo ye's lonꞌ?<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Nde zyaga ngo xaꞌ ned mbere xaꞌ yez Jerusalen, nde senꞌ mzin xaꞌ tya thita nzi re si'bthib xin'te'd Jesus kon temas re xaꞌ nzino xa' tya. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Zyasa nchab xaꞌ: Lo rop xaꞌ ta mzin na:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:34">—Lipa mbroꞌxban Jesus, tak Simon mbwiꞌ xaꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Zyasa mdaꞌ rop xaꞌ ya kwent re jwanꞌ ngokte xa' ned lo nda xaꞌ, nde xamod mbyolo xaꞌ Jesus senꞌ mbli rol Jesus pan.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus mbroꞌto lo re xin'te'd Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Laj tata benꞌ nzi todiꞌs xaꞌ re jwanꞌ reꞌ, senꞌ xaj mbroꞌto Jesus xij re xaꞌ, nde mni Jesus dyux lo xaꞌ, nchab Jesus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:36">—Yalnabez tyo kon go'.<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Zyasa jwanꞌ toz mzyeb re xaꞌ, mxak xaꞌ jwanꞌ bet ngwi' xa'. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Per Jesus nchab lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:38">—¿Kwan ndliy nzyeb goꞌ? ¿Kwan ndliy tanya xgab ndli go'? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Bwiꞌ goꞌ yaꞌn nde bwiꞌ goꞌ nin, ¡nay! Bwal goꞌ na, sa nye goꞌ ke nay, tak jwan' bet ngenta belꞌ nde ngenta zij xa nak na re'.<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Laj ndotej Jesus jwanꞌ reꞌ lo re xaꞌ, mbloꞌ Jesus yaꞌ Jesus nde ni Jesus lo xaꞌ. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Nde lo nale toz nzo lazoꞌ xaꞌ nde lo nzoyen xa' naꞌndlid lazoꞌ xa'y, zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:41">—¿Choꞌ nzo kwan ngeno go' wa men?<verse eid="LUK 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Zyasa mdaꞌ xaꞌ thi ble mbel mbyex nde thib ble ser nzo mzin lo Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Nzi wi' re xa' ya mxen Xa'y mda Xa'y. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Zyasa nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:44">—Reta jwanꞌ re' mdej na lo go' senꞌ benꞌ nzinon goꞌ: nakinꞌka ri'd na reta jwan' re, xata nchab lo ley chan' Moisés nde re jwanꞌ mke' re profet, nde re jwanꞌ nchab lo libr chanꞌ Salmos.<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Zyasa mbli Jesus mxyal' yek re xa' sa yen xaꞌ jwanꞌ nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />nde nchab Jesus lo xaꞌ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:46">—Cheꞌmod nchab lo xkiꞌs Dios jwanꞌ nge lo yez, le' Xaꞌ mtelꞌ Dios nakinꞌ gaj Xaꞌ, nde yaxo'b mbyon wiz ryoꞌxban Xaꞌ, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />nde lo le Xa' ta' men kwent chan' Xa' sa la' men re jwan narax nde bere men lo Dios nde ton' Dios xken' men. Nde dib nax izyo yen kwent re' ya xata tyoptey yez Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nde go' mne xa nak reta jwan' re'. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Naya na telꞌ lo goꞌ jwanꞌ mke'yek Xud na taꞌ Xaꞌ lo goꞌ, per ndablo kwed goꞌ yez Jerusalen axta kebeꞌ kayaꞌ goꞌ yalne chanꞌ Dios jwanꞌ ryo' lo beꞌ.<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus ndya lo beꞌ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Zyasa mbeꞌ Jesus reta xaꞌ jwanꞌ nzino Jesus axta yez Betania, nde mblen Jesus yaꞌ Jesus nde mbli ley' Jesus xa'. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Nde laj nge li ley' Jesus xa', mbla' Jesus xa', ngwap Jesus lo beꞌ ndya Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Zyasa re xin'te'd Jesus, senꞌ mne mdoxub xa' lo Jesus, nale thoz ngo lazoꞌ xaꞌ mbere xaꞌ yez Jerusalen. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Nde thibla' nzi xaꞌ yodoꞌ, ni xaꞌ diꞌs wen lo Dios nde ndli ley' xa' le Dios. Ta naka.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>